  <para style="h">Yesaya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Yesaya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yesaya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yes</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yesaya</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ISA 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 1:1" />Ibi ni ivyo Yesaya mwene Amozi yeretswe vyerekeye Ubuyuda na Yerusalemu, ku ngoma ya Uziya, iya Yotamu, iya Ahazi n’iya Hezekiya, abami b’i Buyuda.<verse eid="ISA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 1:2" />Nimwumve mwa majuru mwe! Umviriza wa si we!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:2">Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:2">“Naronkeje abana, ndabakuza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:2">ariko barangararije.<verse eid="ISA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 1:3" />Inka iramenya shebuja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">n’indogoba ikamenya ubwato shebuja ayigabuririramwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:3">Ariko Abisirayeli nta na kimwe bazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:3">ubwoko bwanje nta co butahura.”<verse eid="ISA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 1:4" />Uragowe wa hanga rikora ivyaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">abantu bagirizwa ibigabitanyo bikomeye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">uruvyaro rw’inkozi z’ibibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">abana bononekaye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:4">Bataye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">bakengera Uwera wa Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:4">bamuvako, basubira inyuma.<verse eid="ISA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 1:5" />Ni igiki gitumye mushaka kwongera guhanwa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:5">Ni igiki gituma muguma mu bugarariji?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:5">Ehe raba umutwe wuzuye ibikomere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:5">umutima na wo uragwaye.<verse eid="ISA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 1:6" />Uhereye mu kirenge ugashitsa ku mutwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">nta na hamwe hagikomeye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">Mwuzuye inguma, ibivyimba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">n’ibisebe binuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:6">bitigeze vyozwa canke ngo bipfukwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:6">canke ngo bisigweko amavuta ya elayo.<verse eid="ISA 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 1:7" />Igihugu canyu carasanganguwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">ibisagara vyanyu vyarahiye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:7">Amatongo yanyu ariko aranyagwa n’abanyamahanga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">mubiraba n’amaso yanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">hasigaye ari mu gahinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:7">nk’ahasenyuwe n’abanyamahanga.<verse eid="ISA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 1:8" />I Siyoni hasigaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">hameze nk’akazu kashaje ko mu ruzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">hameze nk’akazu k’ivyatsi k’uwurarira umurima w’imyungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:8">hameze nk’igisagara gikikujwe n’ingabo zagiteye.<verse eid="ISA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 1:9" />Iyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose atadusigariza abadukomokako bakeya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:9">tuba twararanduwe nk’ab’i Sodomu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:9">tuba twaraherengetejwe nk’ab’i Gomora.<verse eid="ISA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 1:10" />Nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:10">yemwe batware b’i Sodomu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:10">Nimwumve Ivyagezwe vy’Imana yacu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:10">yemwe bantu b’i Gomora.<verse eid="ISA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 1:11" />“Mbega ibimazi vyanyu vyinshi bimariye iki?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">“Ndarambiwe n’ibimazi vyanyu bituriwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">vyaba ivy’amapfizi y’intama n’ibindi bitungwa binuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">ivyo mwama munshikanira, ndabihaze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:11">Sinezerwa n’amaraso y’amashuri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:11">canke ay’amapfizi y’intama, canke amasuguru y’impene.<verse eid="ISA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 1:12" />Iyo muje kunshengerera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:12">ni nde aba yababwiye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:12">ngo muze kumponyangira mu rugo?<verse eid="ISA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 1:13" />Ntimuze musubire kunzanira ibimazi bitagira akamaro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">Ibimota neza vyanyu biranukira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:13">Ndarambiwe n’amakoraniro yanyu yo ku mboneko z’ukwezi n’ayo ku masabato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:13">sincihanganira amakoraniro yanyu avanze n’ibibi.<verse eid="ISA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 1:14" />Nzinutswe imisi mikuru y’imboneko z’ukwezi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">n’iyindi misi mikuru mwishingiye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:14">Irandemereye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:14">Naniwe no kuyihanganira.<verse eid="ISA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 1:15" />Nimwaduza ibiganza musenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">nanje nzobanyegeza mu nyonga hanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:15">Naho mwosenga amasengesho menshi cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:15">sinzobumviriza.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 1:15" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:15">Ibiganza vyanyu vyuzuye amaraso.<verse eid="ISA 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 1:16" />Nimwiyuhagire, mushire ubuhoma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:16">Nimunkure mu maso ibikorwa vyanyu bibi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:16">Mureke gukora ibibi.<verse eid="ISA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 1:17" />Nimwige gukora ivyiza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">Murondere guca izigororotse, murenganure abarenganijwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:17">Muburanire impfuvyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:17">muvugire abapfakazi.”<verse eid="ISA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 1:18" />“Ehe nimuze tuje inama,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">“Naho ivyaha vyanyu vyotukura tukutuku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">nzovyeza vyere derere nka shelegi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:18">Naho vyotukura nk’amaraso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:18">bizohinduka nk’ubwoya bwera cane.<verse eid="ISA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 1:19" />Nimwemera mukanyumvira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:19">muzorya ku vyiza vyo mu gihugu.<verse eid="ISA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 1:20" />Ariko nimwaguma mungarariza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:20">inkota izobarya.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:20">Kuko ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 1:21" />Nimurabe ingene Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">umugwa wari umwizigirwa, ubu wahindutse maraya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:21">Wahora wuzuye imanza zigororotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">ubugororotsi ni ho bwibera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:21">ariko ubu hasigaye ari ah’abicanyi.<verse eid="ISA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 1:22" />Amafeza yanyu aguye ingese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:22">n’imivinyu yanyu nta kanovera, yasutswemwo amazi.<verse eid="ISA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 1:23" />Abatware banyu ni abagarariji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">bagendana n’inkozi z’ibibi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">Bose barya ibiturire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">bagakunda gushikanirwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:23">Ntibaburanira impfuvyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:23">n’urubanza rw’abapfakazi ntirubashikira.<verse eid="ISA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 1:24" />Ni co gituma Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:24">Umunyenkomezi wa Isirayeli, avuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:24">Nzokwimarira ishavu kuri mwebwe mungwanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:24">ndabihore mwebwe abansi banje.<verse eid="ISA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 1:25" />Nzohindukiza ukuboko ngwanye Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:25">nzokuvugutira ndagukureko ingese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:25">nzogukuramwo umwanda wose.<verse eid="ISA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 1:26" />Nzogarukana abarongozi beza nk’abo mu gihe ca kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:26">nsubizeho abahanuzi nk’abo mu gihe ca mbere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:26">Hanyuma uzokwitwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:26">igisagara c’ubugororotsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:26">umugwa wizerwa.<verse eid="ISA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 1:27" />Siyoni hazotabarwa n’ubutungane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:27">abazokwihana bo muri Yerusalemu bazokizwa n’ukugororoka.<verse eid="ISA 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 1:28" />Ariko abagarariji n’abanyavyaha bazovunagurwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:28">n’abareka <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bazorandurwa.<verse eid="ISA 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 1:29" />“Muzoterwa isoni n’ugusenga ibigirwamana kwanyu muri musi y’imirinzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:29">iyo mwanezerererwamwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:29">muzomaramara nimwibuka ya matongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:29">ayo mwatoranirije ibigirwamana.<verse eid="ISA 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 1:30" />Muzomera nk’umurinzi ufise amababi akabiranye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:30">mumere nk’amatongo atagiramwo amazi.<verse eid="ISA 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 1:31" />Abahambaye bo muri mwebwe bazomera nk’icatsi cumye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:31">ibikorwa vyabo na vyo bimere nk’ivyatsi bifashwe n’umuriro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 1:31">Bazoshana na vyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 1:31">habure uwuzimya umuriro.”<verse eid="ISA 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ISA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Umusozi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 2:1" />Ibi ni ibindi Yesaya mwene Amozi yeretswe vyerekeye Ubuyuda na Yerusalemu:<verse eid="ISA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 2:2" />Mu misi y’iherezo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">umusozi uriko ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">uzoba ushimangiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">nk’umusozi usumba iyindi yose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:2">uzoshirwa hejuru usumbe udusozi twose;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:2">kandi amahanga yose azohondogana aja kuri wo.<verse eid="ISA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 2:3" />Amoko menshi azoza, avuge ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">“Nimuze tuduge tuje ku musozi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">mu ngoro y’Imana ya Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Izotwigisha inzira zayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">kugira ngo tuzigenderemwo.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:3">Kuko i Siyoni ari ho hazova ivyagezwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:3">ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rive i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 2:4" />Azocira imanza amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">atature amatati hagati y’amoko menshi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">Inkota zabo bazozicuramwo amasuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">amacumu yabo bayacuremwo imihoro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:4">Nta hanga rizosubira gutera irindi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:4">kandi ntibazosubira kwiga ivy’intambara.<verse eid="ISA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 2:5" />Nimuze, yemwe ruvyaro rwa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:5">ehe nimuze tugendere mu muco w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>!<verse eid="ISA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umusi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 2:6" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> we, warahevye ubwoko bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">ari rwo ruvyaro rwa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:6">Buzuyemwo ivyo kugendereza vy’abanyamahanga bo mu buseruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">baraguza nk’Abafilisitiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:6">kandi bifatanya n’abanyamahanga.<verse eid="ISA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 2:7" />Igihugu cabo cuzuye ifeza n’inzahabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:7">ubutunzi bwabo ntibugira iherezo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:7">Igihugu cabo cuzuye amafarasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:7">imikogote yabo ntigira igitigiri.<verse eid="ISA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 2:8" />Igihugu cabo cuzuye ibigirwamana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:8">bunamira ibintu bakoresheje amaboko yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:8">ivyo bacurishije intoke zabo.<verse eid="ISA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 2:9" />Ni co gituma abo bantu bazocinyizwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:9">n’umuntu wese agacishwa bugufi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:9">Ntuze ubaharire.<verse eid="ISA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 2:10" />Nimwinjire mu masenga, mwinyegeze mu kuzimu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:10">ntimuhure n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kuko biteye ubwoba cane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:10">ntimuhure n’ugukayangana kw’ubwiza bwiwe!<verse eid="ISA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 2:11" />Amaso y’ubwibone azocishwa bugufi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:11">n’ubwibone bwose bw’abantu bunyitswe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:11">kuri uwo musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> wenyene ni we azoshirwa hejuru.<verse eid="ISA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 2:12" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, arafise umusi yibikiye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:12">uwo azokwihorerako abishira hejuru n’abibona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:12">kandi n’igishizwe hejuru cose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:12">gicishwe bugufi.<verse eid="ISA 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 2:13" />Azoca amasederi maremere y’i Libani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:13">hamwe n’imirinzi ikomakomeye y’i Bashani.<verse eid="ISA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 2:14" />Imitumba miremire hamwe n’uturambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:14">bizoringanizwa.<verse eid="ISA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 2:15" />Iminara miremire hamwe n’ibihome vyose bikomeye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:15">azobisenyagura.<verse eid="ISA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 2:16" />Azomenagura amato y’abadandaji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:16">n’amato y’igiciro kinini.<verse eid="ISA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 2:17" />Ubwibone bw’abantu buzoshirwa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:17">abishira hejuru bose bacishwe bugufi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:17">Uwo musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> wenyene ni we azoba ashizwe hejuru.<verse eid="ISA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 2:18" />Ibigirwamana bizokurwaho vyose.<verse eid="ISA 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 2:19" />Abantu bazohungira mu masenga y’amabuye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">no mu binogo vyimbwe mu kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:19">ngo bahunge uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">n’ugukayangana kw’ubwiza bwiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:19">igihe azohagurukira gutigitisha isi.<verse eid="ISA 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 2:20" />Kuri uwo musi w’urubanza, abantu bazota kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:20">baterere imbeba n’ubuhungarema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:20">ibigirwamana vyabo bicuzwe mw’ifeza no mu nzahabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:20">ivyo bicuriye ngo babisenge.<verse eid="ISA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 2:21" />Bazohungira mu masenga y’amabuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">no mu binogo vyo mu kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 2:21">ngo bahunge uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">n’ugukayangana kw’ubwiza bwiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:21">igihe azohagurukira gutigitisha isi.<verse eid="ISA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 2:22" />Nimureke kwizigira abantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:22">kuko bameze nk’impwemu zo mu mazuru yabo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 2:22">Mbega hari ico bobamarira?<verse eid="ISA 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ISA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Urubanza rwa Yerusalemu na Yuda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 3:1" />Ehe raba, Umwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:1">agira anyage ab’i Yerusalemu n’ab’i Buyuda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:1">ivyo baronka n’ivyabashigikira:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:1">ivyo baronka vyose vyokurya n’ivyo baronka vyose vy’amazi.<verse eid="ISA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 3:2" />Azohonya abahizi mu ntambara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:2">abacamanza, abavugishwa, abapfumu hamwe n’abakuru,<verse eid="ISA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 3:3" />intwazangabo irongora abasoda mirongo itanu n’abanyacubahiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:3">abahanuzi, abanyamyuga bahambaye hamwe n’inkerebutsi z’abaragura.<verse eid="ISA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 3:4" />Nzobaha abana babo bababere abatware,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:4">abana bato babe ari bo babategeka.<verse eid="ISA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 3:5" />Abantu bazocinyizanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:5">umugabo acinyize uwundi mugabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:5">umubanyi acinyize umubanyi wiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:5">Umwana azosuzugura umutama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:5">umuntu ata co amaze asuzugure umunyacubahiro.<verse eid="ISA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 3:6" />Ico gihe umuntu azobwira uwo bavukana ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:6">“Ko ari wewe ufise umwambaro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:6">ba ari wewe uba umutware wacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:6">abe ari wewe witaho ico kirundo c’umusaka!”<verse eid="ISA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 3:7" />Ariko muri ico gihe na we azosemerera ababwire ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:7">“Erega nta co nobafasha!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:7">Simfise ivyokurya canke ivyambarwa mu nzu yanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:7">ntimungire umurongozi w’abantu.”<verse eid="ISA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 3:8" />Yerusalemu haradandabagirana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:8">n’i Buyuda haratemvye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:8">Amajambo n’ibikorwa vyabo bigwanya <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:8">bagashinyagurira imbere y’ubwiza bwiwe.<verse eid="ISA 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 3:9" />Mu maso habo harabagiriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">bagenda berekana ivyaha vyabo nk’ab’i Sodomu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">ntibabinyegeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:9">Baragowe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:9">Bihamagariye ivyago.<verse eid="ISA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 3:10" />Bwira abagororotsi ko bazomererwa neza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:10">kuko bazorya ibivuye mu maboko yabo.<verse eid="ISA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 3:11" />Ariko abanyavyaha bazobona ibara!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:11">Ivyago bizobagwako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:11">Bazosubirizwa mu nkoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:11">ibihwanye n’ivyo bakoze.<verse eid="ISA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 3:12" />Ubwoko bwanje bucinyijwe n’abana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:12">abagore ni bo babutegeka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:12">Yewe bwoko bwanje, abarongozi bawe barakuzimije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:12">bagutesheje inzira.<verse eid="ISA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 3:13" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yicaye ku ntebe y’imanza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:13">ahagurukijwe no gucira urubanza ubwoko bwiwe.<verse eid="ISA 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 3:14" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yinjiye ngo ace urubanza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:14">arucira abatware n’abarongozi b’ubwoko bwiwe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:14">“Ni mwebwe mwamponereje uruzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:14">ivyo mwanyaze abakene bikaba biri mu mazu yanyu.<verse eid="ISA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 3:15" />Ni iki catumye musiribanga ubwoko bwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:15">mukamenagura imitwe y’aboro?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:15">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="ISA 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 3:16" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuze ati: “Abakobwa b’i Siyoni buzuye ubwibone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">bagenda baneze amazosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:16">barabisha amaso yuzuye ubushirasoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">kandi bakagenda baneze amazosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:16">bajegeza ibisharizo vy’imigufu bambaye ku maguru.<verse eid="ISA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 3:17" />Ni co gituma Imana izoteza abakobwa b’i Siyoni ibisekera ku mitwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:17">imitwe yabo iyigire ibiharabuga.”<verse eid="ISA 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 3:18" />Kuri uwo musi Imana izokuraho ubwiza bw’ivyambarwa vyabo: <verse eid="ISA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 3:19" />amahereni, imiringa yo ku maboko, hamwe n’imyitwikiro, <verse eid="ISA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 3:20" />ingori, imigufu yo ku maguru, uducupa tw’ibimota neza, utugirwamana, <verse eid="ISA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 3:21" />impeta zo ku ntoke n’izo ku mazuru, <verse eid="ISA 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 3:22" />amakanzu mezameza, impuzu zo kurenza hejuru n’udusaho, <verse eid="ISA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 3:23" />ivyirore, inkenyerano zera hamwe n’ibitambara vyo ku mutwe.<verse eid="ISA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 3:24" />Maze aho kumota neza, bazonuka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:24">mu gishingo c’umukanda, azobakenyeza umugozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 3:24">mu gishingo co gusokoza uruhanika, azobaharangura imitwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:24">mu gishingo c’impuzu nziza azobambika amagunira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:24">mu gishingo c’ubwiza, azobambika ibimaramare.<verse eid="ISA 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 3:25" />Abagabo banyu bazomarwa n’inkota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:25">abagwanyi banyu na bo bazogwa ku rugamba.<verse eid="ISA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 3:26" />Amarembo y’i Siyoni azorira aboroge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 3:26">igisagara gisanganguwe, kizokwicara hasi.<verse eid="ISA 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ISA 4" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 4:1" />Muri ico gihe, abagore indwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">bazofata umugabo umwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:1">bamubwire bati: “Tuzorya ivyokurya twirondereye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">kandi tuzokwironderera impuzu twambara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 4:1">Twemerere gusa twitirirwe izina ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 4:1">udukureko ibimaramare.”<verse eid="ISA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishami ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 4:2" />Ariko muri ico gihe ishami ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rizokwambikwa ubwiza n’ugukayangana, kandi amasigarira y’Abisirayeli azokwishimira yongere anezererwe ivyamwa vyo mu gihugu. <verse eid="ISA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 4:3" />Abazoba basigaye i Siyoni, bakaguma i Yerusalemu, bazokwitwa abera. Ni abazoba barokotse bakaba banditswe mu gitabu c’abazima i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ISA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 4:4" />Imana izokwoza imyanda y’abakobwa b’i Siyoni, ihanagure amaraso yasesekeye i Yerusalemu ikoresheje impwemu y’urubanza n’impwemu y’umuriro. <verse eid="ISA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 4:5" />Ku murango, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azorema igicu kibe hejuru y’umusozi Siyoni hamwe n’abahakoranira bose, mw’ijoro na ho aharemere imbeya z’umuriro. Icubahiro ciwe kizoba hejuru ya vyose nk’ihema rinini rihapfutse. <verse eid="ISA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 4:6" />Kizoba ubwugamo n’igitutu mu bushuhe bwo ku murango, n’ubuhungiro n’ubwihisho mu gihe c’igihuhusi n’imvura.<verse eid="ISA 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ISA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Indirimbo y’uruzabibu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 5:1" />Reka ndirimbire umukunzi wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">indirimbo y’umurima wiwe w’imizabibu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:1">Umukunzi wanje yari afise umurima w’imizabibu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:1">ku musozi umera cane.<verse eid="ISA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 5:2" />Uwo musozi yarawurimye, akuraho amabuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">atoranya imizabibu myiza kurusha iyindi, ayitera kuri wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Awubakako umunara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">ashiramwo n’ubwato baganiramwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:2">Mu nyuma aja kuraba ko yoronka inzabibu nziza yokwimbura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:2">ariko asanga huzuyeyo ibihumbwa gusa.<verse eid="ISA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 5:3" />None rero yemwe ababa i Yerusalemu, namwe bagabo b’i Buyuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:3">nimuducire urubanza twe n’uwo murima wanje.<verse eid="ISA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 5:4" />Ni igiki kirengeye ivyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:4">nari gukorera uwo murima wanje w’imizabibu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:4">Ni kuki wamye ibihumbwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:4">kandi nari niteze ko unyamira inzabibu nziza?<verse eid="ISA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 5:5" />Hinge ndababwire</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">ico ngiye gukorera uwo murima wanje w’imizabibu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">Nzosambura inzitiro zawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">kugira ngo wonwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:5">Nzosenyura impome ziwukikuje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:5">kugira ngo uze uhonyangwe.<verse eid="ISA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 5:6" />Nzowuhonya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">ntuzotuturirwa, ntuzonabagarirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">amahwa n’ibitovu ni vyo bizowumeramwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:6">Nzotegeka ibicu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:6">ntihagire imvura iwugwamwo.<verse eid="ISA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 5:7" />Umurima w’imizabibu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">ni inzu ya Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">abantu b’i Buyuda na bo ni bo murima wamuhimbara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari abitezeko imanza zigororotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">ariko abona ugusesa amaraso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:7">yabarondeyeko ukugororoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:7">ariko abumvamwo amarira n’imibabaro.<verse eid="ISA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amagorwa n’imanza</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 5:8" />Muragowe mwebwe mwomeka amazu ku yandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">amatongo ku yandi mukifataniriza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:8">igihugu mukaciganzira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:8">ngo mukibemwo mwenyene.<verse eid="ISA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 5:9" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose yabivuze numva, ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:9">“Ndababwije ukuri, amazu mezameza azosambuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:9">kandi n’amazu maninimanini azosigara ata wuyabamwo.<verse eid="ISA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 5:10" />Ihegitari zitatu z’imizabibu zizovamwo ingero batu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amalitiro 22.</char></note> imwe gusa y’umutobe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:10">ingero homeru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 160.</char></note> y’imbuto z’ingano izovamwo ingero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 16.</char></note> imwe gusa y’umwimbu.”<verse eid="ISA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 5:11" />Muragowe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">mwebwe muzindukira kunywa ibiboreza</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:11">mukarara mwicaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:11">mwishusha mu kunywa umuvinyu.<verse eid="ISA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 5:12" />Ibirori vyabo birimwo inanga, amakembe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">ingoma, imyironge n’umuvinyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:12">ariko nta wubabara ibikorwa vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:12">nta wuha agaciro ibikorwa vy’amaboko yiwe.<verse eid="ISA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 5:13" />Ni co gituma abantu banje bazoja mu kinyago,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">kuko batigeze bagira ugutahura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:13">Abashizwe hejuru bo muri bo bazokwicwa n’inzara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:13">abaciye bugufi bicwe n’inyota.<verse eid="ISA 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 5:14" />Ni co gituma i kuzimu haguye umuhogo waho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">hagataburura umunwa cane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:14">Abubashwe n’amasinzi hazobamira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:14">bajane n’amasinzi y’imborerwa zaho.<verse eid="ISA 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 5:15" />Abantu bazosubizwa hasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:15">kandi n’umwana w’umuntu acishijwe bugufi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:15">amaso y’abibone amaramare.<verse eid="ISA 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 5:16" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose azoshirwa hejuru mu bugororotsi bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:16">kandi Imana Yera izokwerekanwa ko ari iyera n’ibikorwa vyayo vy’ubugororotsi.<verse eid="ISA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 5:17" />Ico gihe intama zizorisha nk’iziri mu buragiro bwazo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:17">imyagazi na yo izorisha ahahora amazu y’abatunzi.<verse eid="ISA 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 5:18" />Bazobona ibara abakwegesha ivyaha imigozi y’ububeshi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:18">Bakwegana n’ivyaha vyabo nk’uko umuntu akwega umukogote.<verse eid="ISA 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 5:19" />Ni bo bavuga bati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nanyaruke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">nanyarutse igikorwa ciwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">natwe tukibone.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:19">Integuro y’Uwera wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">nitwegere, nishike aho tuyibona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:19">kugira ngo tuyimenye.”<verse eid="ISA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 5:20" />Bazobona ibara abafata ibibi bakavyita ivyiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">ivyiza na vyo bakavyita ibibi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">Umuco bawita umwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">umwijima bakawita umuco.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:20">Kuri bo, ikirura kirasosa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:20">igisosa na co kirarura.<verse eid="ISA 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 5:21" />Baragowe abigira abanyabwenge mu mitima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:21">bakibona ko bafise ubumenyi bukomeye.<verse eid="ISA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 5:22" />Baragowe abigira abahizi mu kunywa umuvinyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:22">no mu kugana inzoga zikaze,<verse eid="ISA 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 5:23" />bakarya ibiturire kugira beze uwatsinzwe n’icaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:23">bagatsindisha uwutagira ico azira.<verse eid="ISA 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 5:24" />Ni co gituma, bazozimangana nk’ubwatsi buturirwa n’umuriro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">imizi yabo izobora, n’amashurwe yabo azokabirana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:24">kuko bataye Ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:24">birengagiza ijambo ry’Uwera wa Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 5:25" />Ni co gituma uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bururumvye ku bantu biwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">ukuboko kwiwe akakubangurira kubahonya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Imisozi izonyiganyiga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">imivyimba y’abapfuye izokwandagara ku mabarabara nk’imyanda.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 5:25" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:25">Ariko ivyo vyose ntibizohwamika uburake bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:25">ukuboko kwiwe kuzoba kukibanguye kuri bo.<verse eid="ISA 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 5:26" />Azorungikira amahanga ikimenyetso ari kure.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:26">Azovuza uruhwa ahamagare abo ku mpera z’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:26">maze bose bazosiganwa baja i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 5:27" />Nta n’umwe muri bo azoruha canke ngo atsitare.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">Nta wuzohunyiza canke ngo asinzire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:27">Imikanda yabo ntizokenyuruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:27">n’imigozi y’ibirato vyabo ntizocika.<verse eid="ISA 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 5:28" />Imyampi yabo irasongoye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:28">n’imiheto yabo irabanze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:28">Ibinono vy’ifarasi zabo bimeze nk’amabuye y’amasare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:28">imikogote yabo yiruka nk’agashururu.<verse eid="ISA 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 5:29" />Ukwivuga kwabo ni nk’ukw’intambwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">bivuga nk’imikangara y’intare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:29">Ziraroha iyo zigize ico zubura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:29">zikagitwara ata gitabara.<verse eid="ISA 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 5:30" />Muri ico gihe, hazoba imituragaro hejuru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">kandi abazoterera amaso mu gihugu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 5:30">bazobona ukwiraburanirwa kuvuye ku mibabaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 5:30">n’umuco uzozimanganywa n’ibicu.<verse eid="ISA 5:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ISA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesaya yezwa aca arahamagarwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 6:1" />Mu mwaka Uziya yapfa, nabonye Imana yicaye ku ntebe y’inganji ishizwe hejuru, imisozo y’ikanzu yayo yuzuye Ingoro. <verse eid="ISA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 6:2" />Abaserafi bari hejuru yayo, umwumwe wese afise amababa atandatu. Amababa abiri bayipfukisha mu maso, yandi abiri bakayapfukisha amaguru yabo, ayandi abiri bakayagurukisha. <verse eid="ISA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 6:3" />Bahamagarana bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:3">“Uwera, Uwera, Uwera ni we <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:3">isi yose yuzuye icubahiro ciwe.”<verse eid="ISA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 6:4" />Ijwi ry’indirimbo yabo rinyiganyiza ibishimaryango n’umushinge vy’Ingoro kandi na rwo rwuzura umwotsi.<verse eid="ISA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 6:5" />Nca ndatakamba nti: “Yewe jewe ndagowe, kuko iminwa yanje yanduye, kandi mba mu bantu bafise iminwa yanduye, none amaso yanje akaba abonye Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose!”<verse eid="ISA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 6:6" />Umwe mu baserafi aca aguruka aza aho ndi afise ikara ryaka mu ntoke, yokoje icuma cokora amakara ku gicaniro. <verse eid="ISA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 6:7" />Arinkoza ku munwa avuga ati: “Ehe raba iri kara rikoze ku munwa wawe, ukugabitanya kwawe ugukuweko, n’ivyaha vyawe urabihariwe.”<verse eid="ISA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 6:8" />Nca numva ijwi ry’Imana ribaza riti: “Ni nde notuma? Ni nde yogenda mu gishingo cacu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 6:8">Nanje nca ndishura nti: “Ndi hano ntuma!”<verse eid="ISA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 6:9" />Na we aca ambwira ati: “Genda umbwirire barya bantu uti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:9">‘Muze mwame mwumva ariko ntimuze mwigere mutahura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:9">Muze mwame muraba ariko ntimuze mwigere mubona.’<verse eid="ISA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 6:10" />Genda ukomantaze imitima y’abo bantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">amatwi yabo uyazivye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">amaso yabo uyahumye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">Kugira ngo ntibashobore kubonesha amaso yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">no kwumvisha amatwi yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:10">canke ngo batahurishe imitima yabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:10">bagahava bahindukira, nanje nkabakiza.”<verse eid="ISA 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 6:11" />Nanje nca ndabaza nti: “None ga Mwami, ivyo bizomara igihe kingana gute?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 6:11">Na we aranyishura ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">“Gushika ibisagara vyabo bisambutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">ata na kimwe gisigaye gihagaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:11">amazu yose agasigara agaragara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:11">igihugu cose kigahinduka igisanze,<verse eid="ISA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 6:12" />gushika ndabirukanye kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:12">bagata igihugu cabo cose.<verse eid="ISA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 6:13" />Kandi n’aho hosigara igice kimwe kuri cumi c’igihugu, na ho nyene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">kizosubira gisamburwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 6:13">Ariko nk’uko ibiti vyitwa terebinti na aloni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">bisiga ibishitsi vyavyo iyo vyiciwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 6:13">ni ko imbuto yejejwe izozigamwa nk’igishitsi muri kino gihugu.”<verse eid="ISA 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ikimenyetso ca Emanuweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 7:1" />Ku ngoma ya Ahazi mwene Yotamu, Yotamu mwene Uziya umwami w’i Buyuda, Rezini umwami w’i Siriya hamwe na Peka mwene Remaliya umwami wa Isirayeli bagiye gutera i Yerusalemu, ariko biranka ko bahafata.<verse eid="ISA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 7:2" />Abo mu nzu ya Dawidi babwirwa ngo: “Siriya yifatanije na Efurayimu.” Umwami Ahazi n’abantu bose baranduka imitima, bahinda agashitsi kurya kw’ibiti bihuye n’umuyaga w’igihuhusi.<verse eid="ISA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 7:3" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Yesaya ati: “Sohoka ujane n’umuhungu wawe Sheyari-Yashubi, muje guhura na Ahazi muhurire aho umugende ujana amazi kw’itangi yo haruguru ugarukira, ku nzira ija aho bamesurira. <verse eid="ISA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 7:4" />Umubwire uti: ‘Tekana ugumye umutima, ntugire ubwoba. Ntucike ivutu kubera uburake bwa Rezini na Siriya hamwe na mwene Remaliya. Bameze nk’ibiti biri mu ziko bifumba umwotsi gusa. <verse eid="ISA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 7:5" />Abana ba Siriya, Efurayimu na Remaliya bagiye inama yo kukugwanya, bavuga bati: <verse eid="ISA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 7:6" />“Reka dutere i Buyuda, tuhagabangane hagati yacu maze mwene Tabeyeli tumugire umwami waho.” <verse eid="ISA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 7:7" />Ariko uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:7">Ivyo ntibizoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:7">ntibizokwigera biba,<verse eid="ISA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 7:8" />kuko Siriya ntihakomeye gusumvya umugwa mukuru waho, Damasiko.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:8">Kandi Damasiko ntihakomeye gusumvya umwami waho, Rezini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:8">Nayo mu myaka mirongo itandatu n’itanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:8">aba Efurayimu bazoherengetezwa ntibabe bacitwa ihanga.<verse eid="ISA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 7:9" />Umugwa mukuru wa Efurayimu ni Samariya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:9">kandi uwuganza Samariya ni mwene Remaliya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 7:9">Nimba mudashikamye mu kwizera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 7:9">ntimuzohagarara na gatoya.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 7:10" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arasubira atuma kuri Ahazi, <verse eid="ISA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 7:11" />ati: “Saba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe aguhe ikimenyetso, caba ikiri kure i kuzimu, canke kure hejuru mu kirere.”<verse eid="ISA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 7:12" />Ariko Ahazi avuga ati: “Nta kimenyetso nsaba, sinokwubahuka kugerageza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="ISA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 7:13" />Maze Yesaya aca avuga ati: “Nimwumve rero yemwe abakomoka kuri Dawidi! Mbega ntibihagije kugerageza ukwihangana kw’abantu? None mugomba no kugerageza ukwihangana kw’Imana yanje na kwo? <verse eid="ISA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14" />Ko bimeze uko Imana izokwitangira ikimenyetso yo nyene: inkumi izosama inda, ivyare umwana w’umuhungu kandi bazomwita Emanuweli. <verse eid="ISA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 7:15" />Azotungwa n’amata avuze hamwe n’ubuki gushika amaze kumenya gutandukanya ikibi n’iciza. <verse eid="ISA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 7:16" />Ariko imbere yo kumenya gutandukanya ivyo, ibihugu vy’abo bami babiri utinya cane bizoba bisigaye ari ubugaragwa ata muntu akihaba. <verse eid="ISA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 7:17" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azozana ivyago bikomeye kuri mwebwe no ku bwoko bwanyu no ku muryango wanyu. Muzoterwa n’ubwoba mutigeze mugira kuva Abefurayimu bitandukanije n’Abayuda. Azorungika umwami wa Ashuri abatere.”<verse eid="ISA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ashuri, igikoresho c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 7:18" />Uwo musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azovuza uruhwa gusa, maze isazi zizanane kw’isesero ry’uruzi Nili, inzuki na zo zizanane mu gihugu ca Ashuri. <verse eid="ISA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 7:19" />Zizozira icarimwe zisagaze ku mimanuko ihanamye, mu masenga yo mu bitandara, ku bisaka vy’amahwa yose no ku binogo vy’amazi vyose. <verse eid="ISA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 7:20" />Uwo musi Uhoraho azokota urwembe akuye hakurya y’uruzi Efurate ari rwo mwami wa Ashuri, arukoreshe mu kubamwa ahantu hose: imitwe yanyu, ahari ubwoya hose, hamwe n’ubwanwa. <verse eid="ISA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 7:21" />Inyuma y’ivyo bihe, umuntu atunze azoba afise inyana y’inka imwe hamwe n’impene zibiri gusa. <verse eid="ISA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 7:22" />Ariko hazoba umusesekara w’amata zizokamwa, kuko igihugu kizoba casigayemwo abantu bake cane. Amasigarira azoba yasigaye mu gihugu azonywa amata avuze arye n’ubuki. <verse eid="ISA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 7:23" />Uwo musi ahahora hari umurima w’imizabibu igihumbi wogurwa shekeli igihumbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 12.</char></note> z’ifeza nyene, hazosigara hari imikere n’ibitovu gusa. <verse eid="ISA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 7:24" />Abahigi bazokwinjirayo bitwaje imyampi n’imiheto, kuko igihugu cose kizoba cuzuye amahwa n’ibitovu. <verse eid="ISA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 7:25" />Nayo imitumba yahora irimishwa amasuka, ntimuzoba mukiyishikako kubera gutinya amahwa n’ibitovu. Hazohinduka uburagiro ibitungwa bizorishamwo.<verse eid="ISA 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ISA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yesaya n’abana biwe nk’ikimenyetso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 8:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ambarira ati: “Fata umuzingo munini uwandikeko n’ikaramu isanzwe uti: Maheri-Shalali-Hashi-Bazi.” <verse eid="ISA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 8:2" />Maze nca mpamagara Uriya umuherezi na Zakariya mwene Yeberekiya, ngo bambere ivyabona vyizerwa yuko nabikoze. <verse eid="ISA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 8:3" />Hanyuma ndyamana n’umugore wanje w’umuvugishwakazi, asama inda, avyara umwana w’umuhungu. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambwira ati: “Numwite Maheri-Shalali-Hashi-Bazi. <verse eid="ISA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 8:4" />Imbere y’uko uwo mwana amenya kuvuga ngo data canke mama, umwami wa Ashuri azoba yaramaze gutwara ubutunzi bwose bw’i Damasiko n’i Samariya.”<verse eid="ISA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 8:5" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yongera ambwira ati:<verse eid="ISA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 8:6" />Kubera ko aba bantu bagaye ukubitaho kwanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:6">kugereranywa n’amazi meza atemba y’i Shilowa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:6">bakanezerererwa umwami Rezini hamwe na mwene Remaliya,<verse eid="ISA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 8:7" />nuko rero Uhoraho agiye kubateza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">umwuzure w’inkomezi nyinshi, uvuye ku ruzi Efurate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">ni wo mwami wa Ashuri n’ingabo ziwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:7">Uzosendanisha urengere imivo yose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:7">urengere n’inkombe zarwo zose,<verse eid="ISA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 8:8" />kugeza ushike n’i Buyuda, uharengere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">uzosendanisha uduge gushika no ku mazosi y’abantu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:8">Kandi nirwasanzara ruzokwira igihugu cawe cose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:8">yewe Emanuweli.<verse eid="ISA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 8:9" />Nimuje hamwe yemwe mahanga, muhinde agashitsi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:9">Nimwumve namwe abo mu bihugu vya kure mwese.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:9">Mwitegurire intambara, ariko muhinde agashitsi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:9">Mwitegurire intambara, ariko muhinde agashitsi!<verse eid="ISA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 8:10" />Nimuje inama, ariko inama zanyu zizoba impfagusa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:10">Nimwagira n’ico mupfundika ntikizorama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:10">kuko Imana iri ku ruhande rwacu.<verse eid="ISA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 8:11" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamfatishije ukuboko kwiwe kw’inkomezi, ambwira anyihanikiriza ati: Ntuzogendere mu ngeso z’ubwo bwoko:<verse eid="ISA 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 8:12" />Ntimwite umugararizo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:12">ibintu vyose abo bita umugararizo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:12">ntimugatinye ivyo batinya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:12">kandi na bo ubwabo ntimubatinye.<verse eid="ISA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 8:13" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose abe ari we wenyene mwita Uwera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:13">ni we mukwiye kwubaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:13">ni we mukwiye gutinya.<verse eid="ISA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 8:14" />Azobazigama.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">Ariko kuri Yerusalemu no ku Buyuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:14">azobabera ibuye batsitarako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">n’urutare rutuma bagwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:14">Kandi ababa i Yerusalemu bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:14">azobabera umutego.<verse eid="ISA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 8:15" />Benshi muri bo bazomutsitarako bagwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:15">bazogwa bavunagurike,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:15">bazogwa mu mutego.<verse eid="ISA 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 8:16" />Bika neza ico gishingantahe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:16">ivyagezwe ubifatanishe ikimenyetso mu bigishwa banje.<verse eid="ISA 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 8:17" />Nzororera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 8:17">yahishije ab’inzu ya Yakobo mu maso hiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 8:17">Ni we nzokwizigira.<verse eid="ISA 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 8:18" />Ehe raba jewe, n’abana <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yampaye, turi abo kubera Abisirayeli ibimenyetso biva k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, ahangamye ku Musozi Siyoni.<verse eid="ISA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwijima uzohinduka umuco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 8:19" />Nihagira umuntu akubwira ngo uje kuraguza ku bapfumu n’abasiguza imizimu, bavuga bongorera kandi bajwigira kugira ngo bakubwire ivyo muri kazoza, mbega igikwiye si ugusiguza Imana yanyu? Ni kuki muja kubaza abapfuye ivy’abakiriho? <verse eid="ISA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 8:20" />Nimusuzumire ivyo bavuga ku vyagezwe vyanje no ku ntahe! Nimba bavuga ibitandukanye n’ijambo ryanje, bazokwama mu mwijima. <verse eid="ISA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 8:21" />Ukwihebura n’ikigoyi ni vyo bizorangwa mu gihugu cabo. Nibafatwa n’ikigoyi, bazoterwa n’ishavu, maze barabe hejuru, bavume umwami wabo n’Imana yabo. <verse eid="ISA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 8:22" />Bazoraba hasi babone amakuba n’umwijima, n’umubabaro w’umururazi, kandi bazotererwa mu mwijima w’umuzitanya.<verse eid="ISA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 9:1" />Naho biri uko, umwijima ntuzokwamaho ibihe vyose ku bari mu mubabaro. Muri kahise yacishije bugufi intara ya Zebuloni n’iya Nafutali. Ariko muri kazoza azotera iteka inzira ija ku kiyaga, hakurya ya Yorodani, i Galilaya h’Abanyamahanga.<verse eid="ISA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 9:2" />Abantu bahora bagendera mu mwijima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:2">babonye umuco mwinshi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:2">Ababa mu gihugu c’umwijima w’umuzitanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:2">bakiwe n’umuco mwinshi.<verse eid="ISA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 9:3" />Waragwije ihanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">wongereza umunezero w’abantu baho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">banezererewe imbere yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">nk’uko abantu banezerwa mw’iyimbura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:3">nk’uko abagwanyi banezerwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:3">iyo bariko baragabura iminyago.<verse eid="ISA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 9:4" />Kuko umutwaro wahora ubaremereye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">ikimoko bakubitwa ku mugongo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:4">n’inkoni bakubitwa n’uwabacinyiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">wabivunaguye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:4">nk’uko wabigiriye Abamidiyani.<verse eid="ISA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 9:5" />Ibirato vyose vyambawe mu ntambara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:5">n’impuzu yavumbagajwe mu maraso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:5">bizoturirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:5">bitongorwe n’umuriro.<verse eid="ISA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 9:6" />Kuko umwana avutse ku neza yacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">duhawe umwana w’umuhungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">ubutware bwose buzoba ku bitugu vyiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:6">Azokwitwa Umujenama w’igitangaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">Imana ikomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:6">Data ahoraho, Umwami w’amahoro.<verse eid="ISA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7" />Ubutware bwiwe n’amahoro yiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">ntibizogira iherezo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Azoganzira ku ntebe ya Dawidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">no mu bwami bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">aganzanye ubutungane n’ukugororoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">uhereye ico gihe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">gushitsa ibihe vyose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:7">Ishaka ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:7">ni ryo rizobishitsa.<verse eid="ISA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ashavurira Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 9:8" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arungikiye ubutumwa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:8">bushika kuri Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 9:9" />Abantu bose bazobimenya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:9">baba Abefurayimu canke ababa i Samariya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:9">ari bo bavugana ubwibone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:9">bagakomantaza imitima, bavuga bati:<verse eid="ISA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 9:10" />“Amatafari yarakoraguritse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">ariko tuzosubira tugisanuze amabuye abaje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:10">Ibiti vy’imisukomora vyariciwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:10">ariko tuzobisubiriza amasederi.”<verse eid="ISA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 9:11" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobaneshesha umwansi wabo Rezini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:11">kandi azokwongerereza ububasha abansi babo.<verse eid="ISA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 9:12" />Abasiriya bo mu buseruko n’Abafilisitiya bo mu burengero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">bazokwasama babatabagure.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 9:12" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:12">Ariko ivyo vyose ntibizohwamika uburake bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:12">ukuboko kwiwe kuzoba kukibanguye kuri bo.<verse eid="ISA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 9:13" />Ariko abo bantu ntibagarutse ku wabahanye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:13">ntibarondeye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose.<verse eid="ISA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 9:14" />None rero, ku musi umwe wonyene, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoca Isirayeli umutwe n’umurizo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:14">ikigazi n’irenga abicire amababi umusi umwe.<verse eid="ISA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 9:15" />Abatware n’abahambaye muri Isirayeli ni bo mutwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:15">abavugishwa b’ibinyoma na bo ni bo murizo.<verse eid="ISA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 9:16" />Abarongora abo bantu barabayobeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:16">abayobowe na bo barazimijwe.<verse eid="ISA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 9:17" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntazonezererwa abasore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">kandi ntazogirira impuhwe impfuvyi n’abapfakazi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:17">Kuko bose bahevye Imana, bagakora ibibi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">akanwa kabo kavuga ububeshi gusa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 9:17" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:17">Ariko ivyo vyose ntibizohwamika uburake bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:17">ukuboko kwiwe kuzoba kukibanguye kuri bo.<verse eid="ISA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 9:18" />Erega ubugarariji buturira nk’umuriro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:18">utongora imikere n’amahwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:18">ugatuma ishamba rinini rirurumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:18">umwotsi ugapfunduka umeze nk’igicu mu kirere.<verse eid="ISA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 9:19" />Uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:19">butumye igihugu gitongorwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:19">abantu biwe bamera nk’inkwi zo gucana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:19">Abantu bazoryana ata kubabarirana.<verse eid="ISA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 9:20" />Bazoshikura i buryo ariko bagume bashonje.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:20">Bazorya i bubamfu, na ho nyene ntibahage.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:20">Mu mperuka, abantu bazorya n’inyama z’abana babo.<verse eid="ISA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 9:21" />Manase azorya Efurayimu, Efurayimu na we arye Manase.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:21">Bompi bazohindukira batere Yuda.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 9:21" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 9:21">Ariko ivyo vyose ntibizohwamika uburake bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 9:21">ukuboko kwiwe kuzoba kukibanguye kuri bo.<verse eid="ISA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 10:1" />Muragowe mwebwe mushinga amategeko y’akarenganyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:1">mugashinga amategeko acinyiza abantu.<verse eid="ISA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 10:2" />Munyaga abakene utwabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:2">mukareka gucira imanza zibereye abacinyijwe bo mu bwoko bwanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:2">abapfakazi mubagira iminyago yanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:2">impfuvyi mukazisahura utwazo.<verse eid="ISA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 10:3" />Mbega ku musi w’imanza muzogira gute,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:3">igihe amakuba azobashikako avuye kure?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:3">Muzohungira kwa nde ngo abatabare?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:3">Mbega ubutunzi bwanyu muzobunyegeza he?<verse eid="ISA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 10:4" />Nta kindi muzoba musigaje atari ukuburanirwa muri mu banyagano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">canke imivyimba yanyu ikagwa mu basogoswe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 10:4" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:4">Ariko ivyo vyose ntibizohwamika uburake bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:4">ukuboko kwiwe kuzoba kukibanguye kuri bo.<verse eid="ISA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imana icira urubanza Ashuri</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5" />“Uragowe, yewe Ashuri, wewe nkoni y’ishavu ryanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:5">inkoni witwaje ni yo burake bwanje.<verse eid="ISA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6" />Nzogutuma gutera ihanga ritubaha Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">nzokurungika mu bwoko buntera ishavu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:6">ubasahure wongere ubatware nk’iminyago,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:6">ubahonyangishe ibirenge nk’uwuhonyanga ivyondo mu nzira.<verse eid="ISA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 10:7" />Ariko umwami wa Ashuri ntazoba atahura ko ari igikoresho canje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:7">ivyo si vyo azoba afise mu mutwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:7">intumbero yiwe ni uguhonya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:7">ashire iherezo ku mahanga menshi.<verse eid="ISA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 10:8" />Kuko avuga ati: umwe wese mu baganwa banje azoba umwami vuba.<verse eid="ISA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 10:9" />Tuzosangangura Kalino nk’uko twabikoreye Karikemishi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:9">Hamati hazogwa mu maboko yacu nk’uko vyagendeye Arupadi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:9">Kandi tuzosangangura Samariya nk’uko twabikoze i Damasiko.<verse eid="ISA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 10:10" />Ko ukuboko kwanje kwashoboye gufata ubwami bufise ibigirwamana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:10">ubwami bwasumvya ibigirwamana Yerusalemu na Samariya,<verse eid="ISA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 10:11" />mbega sinzomara amanyama Yerusalemu n’ibigirwamana vyaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:11">nk’uko namaze amanyama Samariya n’ibigirwamana vyaho?”<verse eid="ISA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 10:12" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> niyamara gushitsa ivyago yateguriye umusozi Siyoni na Yerusalemu, azovuga ati: “Ngiye guhana umwami wa Ashuri, kuko yuzuye ubwibone n’ukwishira hejuru. <verse eid="ISA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 10:13" />Kuko azovuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">‘Narabikoze jewe ubwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">ndabikoresheje inkomezi z’ukuboko kwanje n’ubwenge bwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">kuko ndi umunyabwenge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:13">Nakuyeho imbibe hagati y’amahanga, nanyaze ubutunzi bwaho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">mu butwari bwinshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:13">nakuye ku ngoma abami benshi.<verse eid="ISA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 10:14" />Nk’uko umuntu yaruza icari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">ni ko ukuboko kwanje kwatwaye ubutunzi bw’amahanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:14">Nk’uko umuntu yegeranya amagi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">ni ko negeranije ibihugu vyo kw’isi vyose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:14">Nta n’umwe yakubise n’ibaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:14">nta n’uwaryogoye.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 10:15" />Mbega incabiti yokwirata ku wuyikoresha?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">Canke umusumeno wokwishima ku wuwukoresha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:15">Mbega inkoni yokubita ata wuyikubitishije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:15">canke inkoni yokwigendagendesha ata wuyishimikije?<verse eid="ISA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 10:16" />Ni co gituma Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:16">azoteza ingwara abasoda bawe bakomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:16">amagara abashiremwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:16">kandi musi y’ubwiza bwiwe, hazocanwa umuriro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:16">umuriro utongora.<verse eid="ISA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 10:17" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Umuco wa Isirayeli, azohinduka umuriro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:17">kandi Uwera azohinduka nk’urubeya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:17">Ku musi umwe, azotongora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:17">ayo mahwa n’imikere.<verse eid="ISA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 10:18" />Ubwiza bw’amashamba yiwe n’amatongo yiwe amera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:18">bizotikizwa bihere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:18">bimere nk’umugwayi acikanye.<verse eid="ISA 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 10:19" />Ibiti bizosigara muri ayo mashamba yaho bizoba ari bike,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:19">ku buryo n’umwana yobiharura.<verse eid="ISA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amasigarira y’Abisirayeli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 10:20" />Kuri uwo musi amasigarira ya Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">abazoba barokotse ba Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:20">ntibazoba bakimwisunga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">ntibazisunga uwabakubise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">ahubwo bazokwizigira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:20">Uwera wa Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 10:21" />Amasigarira azogaruka, amasigarira ya Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:21">azogaruka ku Mana Ikomeye.<verse eid="ISA 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 10:22" />Isirayeli we, naho abantu bawe ari nk’umusenyi wo ku kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:22">inkehwa gusa ni zo zizogaruka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:22">Agatikizo karamaze gutegurwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:22">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yahisemwo kubatikiza kuko ari co babereye.<verse eid="ISA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 10:23" />Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:23">azoshitsa ako gatikizo ku gihugu cose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:23">nk’uko yabiteguye.<verse eid="ISA 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 10:24" />None rero uku ni ko Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:24">“Yemwe bwoko bwanje buba i Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:24">ntimutinye Abashuri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:24">babakubita inkoni, bakababangurira ibibando,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:24">nk’uko Abanyegiputa babigira.<verse eid="ISA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 10:25" />Hasigaye igihe gito, uburake nari mfitiye mwebwe bugahera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:25">uburake bwanje buzoba agatikizo k’Abashuri.”<verse eid="ISA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 10:26" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose azobakubitisha ikimoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:26">nk’uko yakubitiye Abamidiyani ku gitandara c’i Horebu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:26">kandi azoramvurira inkoni yiwe hejuru y’amazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:26">nk’uko yabigize muri Egiputa.<verse eid="ISA 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 10:27" />Kuri uwo musi imitwaro yabo izokurwa ku bitugu vyanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:27">ingogo zabo zikurwe ku mazosi yanyu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:27">ingogo izovunika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:27">kuko muzoba mwaravyibushe cane.<verse eid="ISA 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 10:28" />Ehe raba Abashuri bageze muri Ayiyati;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:28">baciye i Miguroni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:28">i Mikimashi bahagize ububiko bw’ibikoresho vyabo.<verse eid="ISA 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 10:29" />Bariko barajabuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:29">bavuga bati: “Tuza gucumbika ijoro ryose i Geba.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:29">Ab’i Rama barajugumiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:29">ab’i Gibeya kwa Sawuli barahunze.<verse eid="ISA 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 10:30" />Semerera yewe Mukobwa w’i Galimu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:30">Umviriza yewe Layisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:30">nawe Anatoti wigorewe!<verse eid="ISA 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 10:31" />Ab’i Medimena bariko barahunga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:31">ab’i Gebimu barinyegeje.<verse eid="ISA 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 10:32" />Ariko uwo musi bazogira ikambi i Nobu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:32">baforere ingumu umukobwa w’i Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:32">ku musozi wa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 10:33" />Ehe raba, Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">azotemaguza amashami inkomezi ziwe zihambaye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 10:33">Ibiti birusha ibindi uburebure bizotemwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:33">birebire na vyo bicishwe bugufi.<verse eid="ISA 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 10:34" />Azotemesha incabiti amashamba akomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 10:34">Libani hazokubitwa hasi n’Umunyenkomezi.<verse eid="ISA 10:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ishami rikomoka kuri Isayi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 11:1" />Umunago uzova ku gishitsi ca Dawidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:1">kandi ishami riva ku mizi yaco rizokwama ivyamwa.<verse eid="ISA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2" />Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba kuri we;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">ni we Mpwemu w’ubwenge n’ugutahura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">Mpwemu w’ukuja inama kandi w’ububasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:2">Mpwemu w’ubumenyi n’ukwubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="ISA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 11:3" />Azonezerezwa no kwubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 11:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:3">Ntazoca imanza afatiye ku vyo abonesheje amaso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:3">canke ngo afatire ingingo ku vyo yumvise;<verse eid="ISA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 11:4" />ahubwo abakene azobacira izigororotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">azotunganiriza aboro bo kw’isi bose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:4">Azokubitisha isi inkoni yo mu kanwa kiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:4">kandi impwemu zo mu kanwa kiwe zizotikiza abagarariji.<verse eid="ISA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 11:5" />Ukugororoka kuzoba nk’umukanda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:5">kandi ubwizigirwa azobwambara mu rukenyerero.<verse eid="ISA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 11:6" />Ico gihe amabingira azobana n’imyagazi y’intama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">ingwe iryamane n’impene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:6">inyana y’inka igendane n’intare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:6">biragirwe n’umwana mutoya.<verse eid="ISA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 11:7" />Inka izorisha hamwe n’idubu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:7">inyana zavyo zizoryamana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:7">intare zizorisha ubwatsi nk’inka.<verse eid="ISA 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 11:8" />Umwana yonka azokinira ku mwobo w’imvuvyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:8">n’umucuko azoshira ukuboko kwiwe mu mwobo w’inkoma.<verse eid="ISA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 11:9" />Nta bizoba bikiryana canke ngo vyonone</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:9">ku musozi wanje wera iyo uva ukagera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:9">kuko isi izokwuzura ukumenya <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:9">nk’uko amazi yuzura ikiyaga.<verse eid="ISA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 11:10" />Ico gihe uwukomoka kuri Isayi azoba ibendera ry’agakiza k’isi yose; amahanga yose azokwifatanya na we, kandi ikibanza c’uburuhukiro bwiwe kizoba ic’ubwiza. <verse eid="ISA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 11:11" />Ico gihe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoramvura ukuboko kwiwe ubugira kabiri, agarukane amasigarira y’abantu biwe abakuye muri Ashuri, abadugane abakuye muri Egiputa, muri Etiyopiya, muri Elamu, i Babiloni, i Hamati, no mu mazinga yo mu biyaga.<verse eid="ISA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 11:12" />Azodugiriza ibendera amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:12">yegeranye Abisirayeli basabagiye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:12">Azokwegeranya ubwoko bw’Abayuda bwashwiragiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:12">abakure ku mpande zine z’isi.<verse eid="ISA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 11:13" />Ni ho ishari rya Efurayimu rizokamanganira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:13">abansi ba Yuda na bo bahaherengeterezwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:13">Efurayimu ntazokwongera kugirira ishari Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:13">canke ngo Yuda agirire urwanko Efurayimu.<verse eid="ISA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 11:14" />Bazokwiyunga, bacakire imisozi y’Abafilisitiya mu burengero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">kandi bazoja hamwe banyage amahanga yo mu buseruko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:14">Bazokwigarurira Edomu na Mowabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:14">kandi Abamoni bazoba abagurano babo.<verse eid="ISA 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 11:15" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokamya ikigobe c’ikiyaga ca Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">azohungabanisha uruzi Efurate ukuboko kwiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:15">Azorucamwo imigende indwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:15">kugira ngo abantu bashobore kurujabuka bambaye isandare.<verse eid="ISA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 11:16" />Hazobaho inzira yagutse ku bantu biwe b’amasigarira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:16">bazoza bavuye muri Ashuri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 11:16">nk’iyo Abisirayeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 11:16">baciyemwo bava muri Egiputa.<verse eid="ISA 11:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ISA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Indirimbo y’ishimwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 12:1" />Ico gihe uzovuga uti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">“Ndaguhimbaza, ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">Naho wandakiye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:1">uburake bwawe bwaraheze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:1">kandi urandemesheje.<verse eid="ISA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 12:2" />Ni ukuri <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we gakiza kanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">nzomwizigira kandi sinzotinya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:2">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ubwiwe ni we nkomezi zanje n’indirimbo yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:2">yambereye agakiza.”<verse eid="ISA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 12:3" />Muzovoma amazi munezerewe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:3">kw’isoko y’agakiza.<verse eid="ISA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 12:4" />Uwo musi muzovuga muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 12:4">“Nimushimire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, mwambaze izina ryiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">mumenyekanishe mu mahanga ivyo yakoze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:4">muvuge ko izina ryiwe rihambaye.<verse eid="ISA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 12:5" />Nimuririmbire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko yakoze ibihambaye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:5">mumenyekanishe mu mahanga yose ivyo yakoze.<verse eid="ISA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 12:6" />Nimuririmbane umunezero, yemwe bantu b’i Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 12:6">kuko Uwera wa Isirayeli aba hagati muri mwebwe ahambaye.”<verse eid="ISA 12:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ISA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Babiloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 13:1" />Ibi ni vyo Yesaya mwene Amozi yeretswe, vyerekeye ugutikizwa kwa Babiloni:<verse eid="ISA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 13:2" />Nimushinge ibendera ku musozi muremure utagirako ibiti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:2">musemerere mubabwire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:2">mubahamagare</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:2">binjire mu marembo y’abanyacubahiro.<verse eid="ISA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 13:3" />Jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni je nategetse ingabo zanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:3">zinezererwa icubahiro canje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:3">kugira ngo zishitse ivy’uburake bwanje.<verse eid="ISA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 13:4" />Nimwumve urwamo ku misozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">rumeze nk’urw’ingabo isinzi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:4">Nimwumve urwamo rw’ubwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">rumeze nk’urw’amahanga ateranye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:4">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ariko aragenzura ingabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:4">nk’abasoda biteguriye intambara.<verse eid="ISA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 13:5" />Baje bava mu bihugu vya kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:5">iyo amajuru aherera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:5">Bazananye n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’ibigwanisho vyiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:5">kugira ngo batikize igihugu cose.<verse eid="ISA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 13:6" />Nimuboroge, kuko umusi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uri hafi gushika.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:6">Uzobashikira umeze nk’agatikizo karungitswe n’Iyishoboravyose.<verse eid="ISA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 13:7" />Ivyo bizotuma amaboko y’ingabo zikomeye adendebukirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:7">umutima ukomeye na wo ucike ivutu.<verse eid="ISA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 13:8" />Bazocika intege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">umubabaro n’uburibwe bizobafata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">baribwe nk’umugore ari ku bise.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:8">Bazorabana mu maso bumirwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:8">kandi mu maso habo hazohishira hase n’umuriro.<verse eid="ISA 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 13:9" />Ehe raba umusi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> urashitse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:9">umusi w’uburake bw’inkazi buteye ubwoba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:9">Azotikiza igihugu gicike ubugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:9">abanyavyaha bashirane na co.<verse eid="ISA 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 13:10" />Inyenyeri zo kw’ijuru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:10">ntizizokwaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:10">Izuba riserutse rizocura umwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:10">ukwezi ntikuzobonesha.<verse eid="ISA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 13:11" />Ab’isi nzobahanira ibibi bakoze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">n’abagarariji ndabahanire ivyaha vyabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:11">Abishira hejuru nzobamara ubwibone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:11">ncishe bugufi agasuzuguro k’abanyacubahiro.<verse eid="ISA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 13:12" />Nzomara abantu, basigare bakenye kurya kw’inzahabu z’indobanurwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:12">kandi abantu bazokena gusumvya inzahabu y’agaciro yo muri Ofiru.<verse eid="ISA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 13:13" />Kuko nzotigitisha amajuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:13">isi inyiganyige, ive mu kibanza cayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:13">ndabikoreshejwe n’umujinya w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:13">ku musi w’uburake bwiwe bw’inkazi.<verse eid="ISA 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 13:14" />Maze umuntu wese azosubira inyuma ahunga nk’ingeregere ihigwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:14">canke intama itagira umwungere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:14">umwe wese asubire iwabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:14">umwe wese ahungire mu gihugu ciwe.<verse eid="ISA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 13:15" />Uwo bazobona wese azotoborwa n’umwampi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:15">kandi uwuzofatwa wese azosogotwa inkota.<verse eid="ISA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 13:16" />Inzoya zabo bazozifyonyangira imbere yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:16">amazu yabo azosahurwa, abagore babo bafatwe ku nguvu.<verse eid="ISA 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 13:17" />Ehe raba nzobateza Abamedi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:17">batitaho ifeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:17">batanezererwa inzahabu.<verse eid="ISA 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 13:18" />Imyampi yabo izotobekeranya abasore;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:18">kandi inzoya ntibazozigirira akagongwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:18">canke ngo bagirire impuhwe abana.<verse eid="ISA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 13:19" />Babiloni, mu cubahiro c’ubwami bw’amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:19">ubwiza bw’ubwibone bw’Abakaludaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:19">nzohatikiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:19">nk’uko natikije Sodomu na Gomora.<verse eid="ISA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 13:20" />Nta bantu bazosubira kuhaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:20">kandi nta wuzosubira kuhubaka uko urunganwe ruzogenda rurakurikirana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:20">Abungere bama bimuka ntibazosubira kuhashinga ihema,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:20">nta n’umwungere azosubira kuharagira.<verse eid="ISA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 13:21" />Ariko ibikoko vyo mu bugaragwa ni vyo bizohaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:21">imbwebwe ni zo zizokwuzura mu mazu yaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:21">ibihuna ni vyo bizoba mu mazu yaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:21">kandi impene z’inyeshamba ni zo zizohakinira.<verse eid="ISA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 13:22" />Imfyisi zizogerera mu mazu maninimanini yaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:22">imbwebwe zibere mu mazu mezameza yaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 13:22">Igihe caho kirageze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 13:22">umusi waho ntuzoteba gushika.<verse eid="ISA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 14:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azogirira impuhwe aba Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">asubire atoranye Abisirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">abasubize mu gihugu cabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:1">Abanyamahanga bazokwifatanya na bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:1">biyunge n’uruvyaro rwa Yakobo.<verse eid="ISA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 14:2" />Amahanga ni yo azobarerura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">abagarukane mu gihugu cabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:2">Kandi igihugu ca Isirayeli kizokwigarurira amahanga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">kiyahindure abagurano n’abaguranokazi mu gihugu c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:2">Kizogira imbohe abari barakigize imbohe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:2">kiganze abari barakiganje.<verse eid="ISA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 14:3" />Kuri uwo musi w’igitangaza, aho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobamarira imibabaro n’ubwoba vyo mu buja no mu minyororo, <verse eid="ISA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 14:4" />umwami w’i Babiloni muzomwitamba ku muvyimba muvuga muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:4">Mbega vyagenze gute ngo uwucinyiza azimangane?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:4">Ubwicanyi bwiwe buheze gute?<verse eid="ISA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 14:5" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavunaguye ububasha bw’abanyakibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:5">ari yo nkoni y’abaganza.<verse eid="ISA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 14:6" />Ni yo yakubita abantu n’umujinya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:6">ikabakubita idahengeshanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:6">yategekana amahanga uburake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:6">ikabatwaza umukazo ubudasiba.<verse eid="ISA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 14:7" />Ubu isi yose iraruhutse, ihawe impore;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:7">baraturikisha bakaririmba.<verse eid="ISA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 14:8" />Mbere n’ibiti vy’amapinusi n’amasederi vy’i Libani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:8">bizokwitamba ku muvyimba biti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:8">“Uhereye igihe bakwicira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:8">natwe nta wasubiriye kutwicira.”<verse eid="ISA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 14:9" />I kuzimu iwabo w’abapfuye harahagurutse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">ngo hagusanganire ushitse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:9">hazuye imizimu y’abapfuye ngo ikuramutse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">bamwe bahoze ari abategetsi mw’isi bose;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:9">hahagurukije ku ntebe zabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:9">bamwe bahoze ari abami b’amahanga bose<verse eid="ISA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 14:10" />Abo bose bazokwakira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:10">bakubwire bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:10">“Ehe nawe ubaye umunyantegenke nkatwe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:10">Ubaye nk’umwe muri twebwe!”<verse eid="ISA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 14:11" />Icubahiro cawe kimanuwe iwabo w’abapfuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:11">kijanye n’amajwi y’inanga zawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:11">Inyo ni zo ndava wisasiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:11">kandi inyo ni zo burengeti wipfutse.<verse eid="ISA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12" />Mbega ukuntu uvuye mw’ijuru ugakoroka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:12">wa nyenyeri yo mu gaturuturu, mwana w’umutwenzi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:12">None bakujugunye kw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:12">wewe wahora unesha amahanga!<verse eid="ISA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13" />Wahora wibwira mu mutima uti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">“Nzoduga nshike kw’ijuru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:13">nzoduza intebe yanje y’ubwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">isumbe inyenyeri z’Imana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:13">Nzokwicara nganze ndi ku musozi mw’ikoraniro ry’imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:13">hejuru cane ku masonga y’umusozi Zafoni.<verse eid="ISA 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14" />Nzorenga aho ibicu bigarukira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:14">nzokwigira nk’Iyisumbavyose.”<verse eid="ISA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 14:15" />Ariko umanutse i kuzimu mu bwami bw’abapfuye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:15">ugeze epfo i bwina mu nda y’urwobo.<verse eid="ISA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 14:16" />Abakubona barakwihweza cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:16">bakakwibazako bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:16">“Uyu ni wa wundi yahindisha isi agashitsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:16">akajugumiza ubwami bwose,<verse eid="ISA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 14:17" />agahindura isi yose ubugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:17">agasenyura ibisagara vyo muri yo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:17">akabuza n’impfungwa gusubira iwabo?”<verse eid="ISA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 14:18" />Abami b’amahanga bose basinziranye ivyubahiro vyabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:18">umwe wese mu mva yiwe.<verse eid="ISA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 14:19" />Ariko weho bagutesheje imva yawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">ubaye nk’ishami ritawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:19">urengejweko imivyimba y’abishwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">iy’abacumiswe inkota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:19">itererwa ikamanuka ku mabuye yo mu rwobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:19">Ubaye nk’umuvyimba bakandagira.<verse eid="ISA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 14:20" />Ntuzohambanwa iteka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:20">kuko watikije igihugu cawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:20">ukica ubwoko bwawe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 14:20" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:20">Uruvyaro rw’abanyakibi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:20">ntiruzokwibukwa.<verse eid="ISA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 14:21" />Nimutegure aho kwicira abana biwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:21">bazira ivyaha vya ba sekuruza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:21">kugira ngo ntibahaguruke ngo batorane igihugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:21">hanyuma ngo bacuzuzemwo ibisagara vyabo.<verse eid="ISA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 14:22" />“Nzobahagurukira,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:22">“Kandi nzosibanganya izina rya Babiloni n’abacitse kw’icumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">abana biwe n’abamukomokako,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:22">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 14:23" />“Babiloni nzohahindura igihugu c’ibihuna n’ibidengeri vy’amazi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:23">nzoyikubuza umukubuzo w’agatikizo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:23">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="ISA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 14:24" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose yararahiye ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:24">“Ni ukuri, uko nabitegekanije ni ko nzobikora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:24">kandi bizorama nk’uko nabiteguye.<verse eid="ISA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 14:25" />Nzovunagurira Abashuri mu gihugu canje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">kandi nzobahonyangira ku misozi yanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:25">Ingogo yabo izova ku bantu banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:25">n’umutwaro wabo uzova ku bitugu vy’abantu banje.<verse eid="ISA 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 14:26" />Uwo ni wo mugambi wateguriwe isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:26">kandi ukwo ni kwo kuboko kuramvuriwe hejuru y’amahanga yose.”<verse eid="ISA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 14:27" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ari we yabiteguye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:27">Ukuboko kwiwe kurabanguye: mbe ni nde yogusubiza inyuma?<verse eid="ISA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imburi ku Bafilisitiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 14:28" />Mu mwaka Ahazi yapfuyemwo, ni ho haza iyi mburi:<verse eid="ISA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 14:29" />Yemwe Bafilisitiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">ntimunezerezwe n’uko inkoni yabakubita yavunitse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:29">Kuko ku gishitsi c’iyo nzoka hazovamwo imvuvyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">kandi uruvyaro rwayo ruzoba inzoka iguruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:29">y’ubumara bw’inkazi.<verse eid="ISA 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 14:30" />Abakene kurusha abandi bantu bose bazogaburirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">n’aboro bazoryama basinzire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:30">Ariko uruvyaro rwawe nzorumarisha inzara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:30">n’abazocika kw’icumu nzobica.<verse eid="ISA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 14:31" />Boroga, yewe wa rembo we!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">Namwe Bafilisitiya, nimurire!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:31">Kuko igicu c’umwotsi giturutse mu buraruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:31">kandi nta musoda n’umwe asigaye adatonze urugamba.<verse eid="ISA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 14:32" />Mbega intumwa z’iryo hanga bazozishura iki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we ashinze Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 14:32">kandi abantu biwe barenganywa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 14:32">ni ho bazohungira.”<verse eid="ISA 14:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ISA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Mowabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 15:1" />Ivyo Yesaya yavugishijwe kuri Mowabu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:1">Igisagara Ari c’i Mowabu kirasambutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:1">gitikijwe mw’ijoro rimwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:1">Ikindi citwa Kiri c’i Mowabu nyene gihindutse umusaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:1">gitikijwe mw’ijoro rimwe!<verse eid="ISA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 15:2" />Ab’i Diboni baraduze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">bagiye mu nsengero</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">no ku dutwe tw’imisozi kuririrayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">Abanyamowabu bariko baraborogera i Nebo n’i Medeba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:2">Umuntu wese yimosheje uruharabuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:2">kandi abafise ubwanwa barabumoye.<verse eid="ISA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 15:3" />Mu mabarabara, bambaye amagunira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:3">bari hejuru ku mazu yabo no mu bibanza vy’amakoraniro</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:3">bose baraboroga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:3">bubamye barira.<verse eid="ISA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 15:4" />Heshiboni na Eliyalehi bakoma induru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:4">induru yabo irumvikana gushika i Yahazi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:4">Ni co gituma ingabo z’i Mowabu zikomye induru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:4">imitima yabo icitse ivutu.<verse eid="ISA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 15:5" />Umutima wanje uraririra Mowabu:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">abacitse kw’icumu baho birutse bahunga bashika n’i Zowari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">bageze no muri Egulati-Shelishiya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:5">Baduze n’umusozi witwa Luhiti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">barira ingenda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:5">bafashe inzira ija i Horonayimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:5">bagiye baracura intimba kubera agatikizo kababayeko.<verse eid="ISA 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 15:6" />Amazi y’i Nimurimu arakamye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:6">ivyatsi birakabiranye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:6">ibiterwa biratikiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:6">nta catsi kibisi gisigaye.<verse eid="ISA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 15:7" />Ubutunzi bari bariyegeranirije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:7">butwawe hakurya y’umwonga w’i Popalarisi.<verse eid="ISA 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 15:8" />Induru zabo zirasekera gushika ku mbibe zose za Mowabu:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:8">amaborogo yabo ashika kure no muri Egilayimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:8">gucura intimba kwabo gushika kure n’i Beyeri Elimu.<verse eid="ISA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 15:9" />Amazi y’i Diboni yuzuyemwo amaraso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:9">kandi sindaheza gutera i Dimoni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 15:9">intambwe yirutse ku banyamowabu bahunze</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 15:9">no ku basigaye mu gihugu.<verse eid="ISA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ISA 16" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 16:1" />Nimurungike imyagazi y’intama nk’ishikanwa ryo kwisaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:1">muyirungikire umurongozi w’igihugu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:1">uhereye i Sela ugaca mu bugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:1">ukageza ku musozi w’Umukobwa Siyoni.<verse eid="ISA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 16:2" />Nk’uko inyoni ziyerera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:2">iyo zisamburiwe ivyari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:2">ni ko abagore b’i Mowabu bazomera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:2">ku vyambu vy’uruzi Arunoni.<verse eid="ISA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 16:3" />“Tugire inama,” ni ko ab’i Mowabu bavuga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">“Fata ingingo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:3">Tuma igitutu cawe kitubere nk’ijoro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">mu mashoka y’inka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:3">Nyegeza abacitse kw’icumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:3">ntuhemukire impunzi.<verse eid="ISA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 16:4" />Reka Abanyamowabu bacitse kw’icumu bagumane nawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">ubabere ubwihisho bubakingira umuranduzi.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 16:4" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:4">Kuko uwucinyiza ivyiwe bizoteba bihere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">kandi agatikizo kazorangira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:4">abateye bazokamangana bave mu gihugu.<verse eid="ISA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 16:5" />Ico gihe, intebe y’ubwami izokomezwa n’urukundo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">mu bwizigirwa umugabo umwe azoyicarako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">ni uwukomoka mu nzu kwa Dawidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:5">uwo mu guca imanza azorondera gukora ibigororotse:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:5">kandi azonyarutsa guca urubanza mu bugororotsi.<verse eid="ISA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 16:6" />Twarumvise ivy’ubwibone bwa Mowabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:6">ko yibona birengeje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:6">Twarumvise ivy’ukwishira hejuru kwiwe n’agasuzuguro kiwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:6">Ariko ukwishira hejuru kwiwe ni ukw’ubusa.<verse eid="ISA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 16:7" />Ni co gituma Abanyamowabu baboroga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:7">bakoraniye hamwe kuborogera Mowabu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:7">Nimucure intimba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:7">ku bw’udutsima tw’inzabibu z’i Kiru-Hareseti.<verse eid="ISA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 16:8" />Imirima y’i Heshiboni irakabiranye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">co kimwe n’inzabibu z’i Sibuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">Abategetsi b’amahanga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">basiribangiye hasi inzabibu z’indobanurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">kera zahora zishika n’i Yazeri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">zigakwira no mu bugaragwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:8">Imivyaro yazo yararandarara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:8">igashika kure ku kiyaga.<verse eid="ISA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 16:9" />Ni co gituma ndira, nk’uko ab’i Yazeri barira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">baririra uruzabibu rw’i Sibuma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">ewe Heshiboni nawe Eliyalehi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">nzobavomeza amarira yanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:9">Kuko impundu zitewe no kwera kw’ivyamwa vyawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:9">n’izitewe no kwimbura kwawe zitacumvikana.<verse eid="ISA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 16:10" />Umunezero n’urweze bikuwe mw’itongo rimera cane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">mu nzabibu ntihazosubira kwumvikana indirimbo canke akamo k’umunezero.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:10">Nta wuzosubira kwengera umuvinyu mu bwato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:10">kuko nahagaritse akamo k’umunezero.<verse eid="ISA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 16:11" />Ni co gituma ncurira intimba Mowabu nkamera nk’umurya w’inanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:11">mu nda yanje hakaririra Kiru-Hareseti.<verse eid="ISA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 16:12" />Ab’i Mowabu nibaja ku gasozi hejuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:12">bazoba biyambagurira ubusa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 16:12">Nibaduga ku dutwe tw’imisozi ngo basenge ibigirwamana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 16:12">bizoba ari ivy’impfagusa.<verse eid="ISA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 16:13" />Iryo ni ryo jambo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavuze kuri Mowabu. <verse eid="ISA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 16:14" />Ariko noneho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuze ati: “Imyaka itatu itarahera, nka kurya umukozi w’umucangero ayiharura, icubahiro ca Mowabu kizokengerwa, co kimwe n’abantu baho. Kandi abazosigara bacitse kw’icumu bazoba ari inkehwa cane, ata co bamaze.”<verse eid="ISA 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ISA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Damasiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 17:1" />Imburi kuri Damasiko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:1">“Ehe raba i Damasiko ntihazokwongera kuba igisagara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:1">hazoba ikirundo c’ivyabomaguritse.<verse eid="ISA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 17:2" />Ibisagara vya Aroweri bizohebwa, bihebewe ibitungwa. Bizorisha vyiryamire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:2">ata muntu n’umwe abikomakoma.<verse eid="ISA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 17:3" />Ibisagara bizitiye vya Efurayimu bizosenyurwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">n’ububasha bw’ubwami bw’i Damasiko buzohera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:3">Amasigarira y’i Siriya azoherengetera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">nk’icubahiro ca Isirayeli,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:3">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="ISA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 17:4" />“Uwo musi icubahiro ca Yakobo kizokabirana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:4">n’ukuvyibuha kwiwe kuzohera.<verse eid="ISA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 17:5" />Bizoba bimeze nka kurya umwimbuzi agenya ingano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:5">akegeraniriza imikama y’ingano mu maboko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:5">canke nk’abashwabura amasaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:5">mu kiyaya ca Refayimu.<verse eid="ISA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 17:6" />Ariko hazosigaramwo uduhumbwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">nk’udusigara ku giti c’umwelayo bamaze gukubitisha inkoni bimbura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:6">hagasigara tubiri canke dutatu mu bushorishori,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">na tune canke dutanu mu mashami yama cane,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:6">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli avuze.<verse eid="ISA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 17:7" />Ico gihe abantu bazohanga amaso Umuremyi wabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:7">maze bahindukirire Uwera wa Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 17:8" />Ntibazoba bagihindukiriza amaso yabo ku bicaniro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:8">vyubatswe n’amaboko yabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:8">kandi ntibazoba bacunamira inkingi za Ashera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:8">canke ngo baturirire ibimota neza ku bicaniro vyubatswe n’intoke zabo.<verse eid="ISA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 17:9" />Uwo musi, ibisagara bizitiye vya Isirayeli bizotabwa, bimere nk’ibisagara vy’Abahiwi n’Abamori, vyatawe igihe Abisirayeli babishikamwo. Hazosigara ari mu gahinga.<verse eid="ISA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 17:10" />Ko wibagiye Imana yo Mukiza wawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:10">ntiwibuke igitandara, ari co bwihisho bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:10">naho warobanuye imbuto nziza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:10">ugatera imizabibu y’imvamahanga,<verse eid="ISA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 17:11" />umusi uzitera zigaca zimera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:11">mu gatondo ugasanga zanaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:11">umwimbu wazo uzobura ku musi w’amagorwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:11">n’umubabaro udakira.<verse eid="ISA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 17:12" />Aragowe amahanga menshi yuzuye ubushangashirwe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:12">Babomborana nk’amazi y’ikiyaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:12">Baragowe abantu bahinda!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:12">Basuma nk’amazi yo mw’isumo rinini.<verse eid="ISA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 17:13" />Naho abantu basuma nk’amazi yo mw’isumo rinini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:13">Imana ibakankamiye barahunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:13">umuyaga ukabagurura nk’umuguruka wo ku mpinga z’umusozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:13">bakaguruka nk’umukungugu wo mu gashururu.<verse eid="ISA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 17:14" />Ku mugoroba haza ibitera ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:14">ariko butaraca bikaba vyaheze!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 17:14">Uwo ni wo mugabane w’abatunyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 17:14">kandi ni yo ngero y’abatwambura.<verse eid="ISA 17:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ISA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Etiyopiya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 18:1" />Uragowe, yewe wa gihugu c’amababa ahinda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:1">kiri impande y’inzuzi za Etiyopiya,<verse eid="ISA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 18:2" />kirungika intumwa zigaca mu kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">zigendera mu bwato bujishwe mu rufunzo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 18:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">Genda, mwa ntumwa zinyaruka cane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">mushikire bariya bantu barebare kandi b’umubiri woroshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">ubwoko butinywa kuva aha gushika kure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:2">ihanga rikomeye, nivuga ururimi rutamenyerewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:2">igihugu kigabanganywa n’inzuzi.<verse eid="ISA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 18:3" />Yemwe bantu bose bo kw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:3">mwebwe mwese muyibako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:3">ibendera niryaduzwa ku musozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:3">murirabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:3">kandi inzamba niyavuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:3">muyumvirize.<verse eid="ISA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 18:4" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ambariye, ati: “Nzoguma nitekerereje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:4">nihweze nibereye iwanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:4">meze nk’ubushuhe buva ku zuba ryaka mu gihe co mu ci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:4">meze nk’ikime co mu gihe c’ubushuhe bwo mw’iyimbura.”<verse eid="ISA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 18:5" />Kuko iyimbura ritaragera, amashurwe amaze guhunguruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:5">akavamwo inzabibu zeze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:5">azotema iminago itama ayitemesheje umuhoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:5">n’amashami yasanzaraye azoyaca ayakureho.<verse eid="ISA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 18:6" />Bose bazotererwa ku misozi baribwe n’ibisiga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:6">hamwe n’inyamaswa zo mw’ishamba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:6">Ibisiga bizobarya ici ryose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:6">ibikoko na vyo bibarye urushana rwose.<verse eid="ISA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 18:7" />Ico gihe amashikanwa azozanirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:7">avuye mu gihugu c’abantu barebare b’umubiri woroshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">avuye mu bantu batinywa uhereye aha ugashika kure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 18:7">ihanga rikomeye rivuga ururimi rutamenyerewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 18:7">igihugu kigabuwe n’inzuzi.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ISA 18:7">Amashikanwa azohora azanwa ku musozi Siyoni, ahitirirwa Izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose.<verse eid="ISA 18:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ISA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Egiputa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 19:1" />Imburi kuri Egiputa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:1">Raba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aje ku gicu kinyaruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:1">aziye Egiputa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:1">Ibigirwamana vyo muri Egiputa bihinze agashitsi imbere yiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:1">kandi imitima y’Abanyegiputa ishongeshejwe n’ubwoba.<verse eid="ISA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 19:2" />Nzoteranya Abanyegiputa basubiranemwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">abavukana bagwane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">umubanyi agwanye uwundi mubanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">igisagara kigwanye ikindi gisagara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:2">n’ubwami bugwanye ubundi bwami.<verse eid="ISA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 19:3" />Abanyegiputa bazocika ivutu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:3">kandi imigambi yabo nzoyihindura ubusa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:3">Bazoja kuraguza ku bigirwamana no ku mpwemu z’abapfuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:3">baje ku bapfumu no ku bakonikoni.<verse eid="ISA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 19:4" />Egiputa nzohagomorerako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:4">umutware w’imburakigongwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:4">kandi umwami w’inkazi ni we azohategeka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:4">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<verse eid="ISA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 19:5" />Amazi yo mu ruzi Nili azokama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:5">n’aho urwo ruzi ruca hazokwuma hagaduke.<verse eid="ISA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 19:6" />Imigende y’uruzi Nili izogaduka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:6">n’imigende yo muri Egiputa izogabanuka ikame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:6">Amarenga n’urufunzo bizokabirana,<verse eid="ISA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 19:7" />mbere n’ibiterwa vyo ku nkombe y’urwo ruzi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:7">N’ibiterwa vyose biharimwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:7">bizokwuma bihere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:7">ntibizosubira kuhaboneka.<verse eid="ISA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 19:8" />Abarovyi bazoboroga bacure intimba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:8">abarobesha igera mu ruzi Nili bose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:8">Abarobesha insenga mu ruzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:8">bazobura ico bari bukore.<verse eid="ISA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 19:9" />Abahingura inyuzi na bo nyene bazomaramara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:9">n’abajisha impuzu zera bazodendebukirwa.<verse eid="ISA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 19:10" />Abajisha impuzu baricurikiriye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:10">abakorera umushahara bazogwara imitima.<verse eid="ISA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 19:11" />Abatware ba Zowani ni ibipfu gusa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">abahanuzi ba Farawo bahanura ivy’ubupfu gusa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:11">Mbega ushobora ute kubwira Farawo uti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">“Ndi umwe mu banyambwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:11">ndi umwigishwa w’abami ba kera”?<verse eid="ISA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 19:12" />Mbega abahanuzi bawe b’incabwenge ubu bari hehe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:12">Nibakwereke bongere bagutahuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:12">ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:12">yateguye bigeramiye Egiputa.<verse eid="ISA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 19:13" />Abatware b’i Zowani babaye ibipfu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:13">n’abaganwa b’i Memfisi barahenzwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:13">Ni bo bari urufatiro mu moko yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:13">none barazimije Egiputa.<verse eid="ISA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 19:14" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabasutsemwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:14">impwemu yo kuzungurirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 19:14">batuma Egiputa hadandabagirana mu vyo bakora vyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:14">nk’uko imborerwa idandabagirana mu vyo yadashwe.<verse eid="ISA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 19:15" />Nta kintu na kimwe muri Egiputa bashoboye gukora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:15">si umutwe canke umurizo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 19:15">si ishami ry’ikigazi canke irenga.<verse eid="ISA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 19:16" />Kuri uwo musi Abanyegiputa bazomera nk’abagore b’abanyantegenke. Bazohindishwa agashitsi n’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ababanguriye ukuboko. <verse eid="ISA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 19:17" />Kandi igihugu c’i Buyuda kizotera ubwoba Abanyegiputa; uwuzobwirwa izina rya Yuda azohinda agashitsi, kubera ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ateguye kugirira Egiputa.<verse eid="ISA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 19:18" />Kuri uwo musi, ibisagara bitanu vyo muri Egiputa bizovuga ururimi rw’Igiheburayo, biyegurira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose. Kimwe muri vyo kizokwitwa Igisagara c’Izuba.<verse eid="ISA 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 19:19" />Uwo musi hazokwubakwa igicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> hagati muri Egiputa, hamwe n’icibutso ku rubibe rwaho. <verse eid="ISA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 19:20" />Bizoba ibimenyetso bishingira intahe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose muri Egiputa. Nibaborogera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kubera agacinyizo, azobarungikira umukiza abarinda, abarokore. <verse eid="ISA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 19:21" />Maze uwo musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokwimenyekanisha ku Banyegiputa, kandi bazomwemera nk’umwami. Bazomusenga bongere bamushikanire ibimazi n’amashikanwa y’ifu. Bazosezeranira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kandi isezerano barishitse. <verse eid="ISA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 19:22" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoteza Egiputa icago; azobakubita yongere abavure. Bazogaruka k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we azobumviriza, abakize.<verse eid="ISA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 19:23" />Kuri uwo musi hazoba inzira yagutse iva muri Egiputa, ija muri Ashuri. Kandi abo muri Ashuri bazogendera abo muri Egiputa n’abo muri Egiputa bazogendera abo muri Ashuri. Abo muri Ashuri n’abo muri Egiputa bazotazirira hamwe Imana. <verse eid="ISA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 19:24" />Muri ico gihe, Isirayeli bazoba bagira gatatu inyuma ya Egiputa na Ashuri, bose bazobera umugisha isi. <verse eid="ISA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 19:25" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose azobahezagira, avuga ati: “Hahiriwe Egiputa, ubwoko bwanje, na Ashuri igikorwa c’amaboko yanje, hamwe na Isirayeli iragi ryanje!”<verse eid="ISA 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ISA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Egiputa na Etiyopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 20:1" />Mu mwaka kizigenza mu ntwaramiheto yarungikwa na Sarugoni, umwami wa Ashuri, gutera muri Ashidodi akahafata, <verse eid="ISA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 20:2" />ni ho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavugisha Yesaya mwene Amozi, amubwira ati: “Niwambure ayo magunira, ukure n’ibirato wambaye.” Na we abigenza gutyo, maze agendagenda ari gusa, ata n’ibirato yambaye.<verse eid="ISA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 20:3" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuga ati: “Nk’uko umusavyi wanje Yesaya amaze imyaka itatu agenda ari gusa, ata n’ibirato yambaye, akabera Abanyegiputa n’Abanyetiyopiya imburi, <verse eid="ISA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 20:4" />ni ko umwami wa Ashuri azotwara Abanyegiputa nk’abanyagano, n’Abanyetiyopiya nk’imbohe, bari gusa, batambaye n’ibirato, ata co bakenyeye, kugira ngo Egiputa hamaramare. <verse eid="ISA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 20:5" />Kandi abari bizigiye Etiyopiya, bakishimira Egiputa, bazotinya, baterwe n’isoni. <verse eid="ISA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 20:6" />Kuri uwo musi, ababa muri iki kiyaya cegereye ikiyaga bazovuga bati: ‘Nimurabe ivyashikiye abo twari twishimiye, abo twari twahungiyeko ngo badukize umwami wa Ashuri. Mbega none tumukira gute?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 20:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ISA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Babiloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 21:1" />Imburi ku bugaragwa bwo ku kiyaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:1">Nk’uko agashururu ko mu gihugu co mu bumanuko gasuriranya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:1">ni ko uwuguteye aje azananye mu bugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:1">avuye mu gihugu giteye ubwoba.<verse eid="ISA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 21:2" />Neretswe ibintu biteye ubwoba:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">Umuhemu ariko arahemuka, umunyazi ariko aranyaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:2">Ewe Elamu, tera! Nawe Medi, ugariza!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:2">Nzorangiza amaborogo yose Babiloni hahora hateza.<verse eid="ISA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 21:3" />Ncitse intege kubera ububabare.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:3">Uburibwe bumfashe nk’umuvyeyi ari ku bise.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:3">Njugumijwe n’ivyo numvise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:3">ivyo mbonye bimpumye amaso.<verse eid="ISA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 21:4" />Umutima wanje urasimbagurika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:4">ubwoba butumye njugumira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:4">Umugoroba nari nipfuje ko ushika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:4">unteye guhinda agashitsi.<verse eid="ISA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 21:5" />Bateguye imeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:5">basasa ibirago,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:5">bararya, baranywa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:5">Nimuhaguruke mwa ntwazangabo mwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:5">musige amavuta inkinzo zanyu.<verse eid="ISA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 21:6" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yambwiye ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:6">“Genda ushireho umuteramyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:6">na we aje arakubwira ivyo abona.<verse eid="ISA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 21:7" />Niyabona imikogote iri kumwe n’amafarasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">canke akabona abagendera ku ndogoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">canke abagendera ku ngamiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:7">yitegereze cane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:7">kandi akobeje.”<verse eid="ISA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 21:8" />Maze wa muteramyi arasemerera ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:8">“Mwami, imisi yose nama mpagaze ku munara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:8">Amajoro yose mba ndi ku kirindiro canje.<verse eid="ISA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 21:9" />None raba haje umugabo ari ku mukogote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">ari kumwe n’umugwi w’amafarasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:9">Wa muteramyi arongera avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">‘Babiloni harasenyutse, harasenyutse!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:9">Ibibumbano vy’ibigirwamana vyabo vyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:9">bisenyukiye hasi biramenaguritse.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 21:10" />Mwa bantu banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:10">musekuriwe ku mbuga nk’ingano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:10">ndababwiye ivyo numvanye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:10">ivyo nakuye ku Mana ya Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 21:11" />Imburi kuri Duma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:11">Hari uwumpamagaye ari i Seyiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:11">ambaza ati: “Yewe muteramyi, ijoro rigeze he?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:11">Yewe muteramyi, ijoro rigeze he?”<verse eid="ISA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 21:12" />Umuteramyi yishura ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:12">“Bugira buce, ariko buca bwongera bwire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:12">Nimba ugomba gusubira kumbaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:12">uze kugaruka umbaze.”<verse eid="ISA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Arabiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 21:13" />Imburi kuri Arabiya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:13">Yemwe mwa ngenzi z’i Dedani mwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:13">nimwinyegeze mu bugaragwa bwa Arabiya,<verse eid="ISA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 21:14" />Yemwe ababa i Tema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:14">nimuzanire amazi abanyotewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:14">abahunga nimubasanganize ivyokurya.<verse eid="ISA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 21:15" />Bariko barahunga inkota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:15">kuko yakuwe mu rwubati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 21:15">n’imiheto ikaba yafowe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 21:15">batewe ubwoba n’intambara.<verse eid="ISA 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 21:16" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yambwiye: “Mu mwaka umwe, nk’uko umukozi akorera impembo ku kwezi awuharura, icubahiro c’i Kedari kizorangira. <verse eid="ISA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 21:17" />Abarashi b’intwari bake ni bo bazosigara i Kedari.” Uko ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli avuze.<verse eid="ISA 21:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ISA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 22:1" />Imburi ku kiyaya co kwerekerwamwo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:1">Mbega Yerusalemu, ufashwe n’ibiki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:1">Ko abantu bawe bose baduze hejuru ku mazu?<verse eid="ISA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 22:2" />Yewe wa gisagara cuzuyemwo urwamwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:2">nawe wa gisagara cuzuye umuvurungano n’ubwibone!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:2">Abantu bawe bapfuye, ntibishwe n’inkota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:2">canke ngo bagwe ku rugamba.<verse eid="ISA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 22:3" />Abatware bawe bose bahungiye rimwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:3">bafashwe ata muheto urinze gukoreshwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:3">Abafashwe bose batwawe icarimwe ngo babe imbohe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:3">naho bagerageje guhunga umwansi akiri kure.<verse eid="ISA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 22:4" />Ni co catumye mvuga nti: “Nimumve i ruhande,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:4">mundeke ndirane umubabaro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:4">Ntimugerageze kumpoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:4">kandi mbona ubwoko bwanje buriko burahona.”<verse eid="ISA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 22:5" />Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, yarashizeho umusi w’imibabaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">w’umuvurungano, ugusiribangwa n’ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">mu kiyaya c’ukwerekerwamwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:5">umusi wo gusangangura inzitiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:5">no kuborogera ku misozi.<verse eid="ISA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 22:6" />Abanyelamu bambaye imyampi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:6">imikogote n’amafarasi yabo birateguye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:6">Kiru yasokoroye inkinzo.<verse eid="ISA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 22:7" />Ibiyaya vyawe vyiza vyuzuye imikogote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:7">n’abagendera ku mafarasi bahagaze ku marembo y’igisagara.<verse eid="ISA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 22:8" />Uhoraho yakuyeho ibikingira i Buyuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:8">maze uwo musi murahindukira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:8">mufata ibigwanisho mwashinguye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:8">mu nzu yitwa Inzu y’Ishamba.<verse eid="ISA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 22:9" />Murabona ko impome z’Igisagara ca Dawidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:9">zasambutse ahatari hake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:9">maze muca muziganya amazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:9">mwuzuza amazi itangi yo hepfo.<verse eid="ISA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 22:10" />Mugenzura amazu y’i Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:10">amwe murayasambura kugira ngo muronke amabuye yo gusanura uruzitiro.<verse eid="ISA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 22:11" />Hagati y’inzitiro z’igisagara mwubakaho itangi y’amazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:11">kugira ngo muziganye amazi yo mw’itangi ya kera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:11">Ariko ntimwigeze muhanga amaso Uwabiremye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:11">canke ngo mwiyumvire ku wabiteguye kuva kera.<verse eid="ISA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 22:12" />Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:12">arabararitse kuri uwo musi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:12">ngo murire mwongere muboroge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:12">ngo mwimoshe inkomvorera mwongere mwambare impuzu z’ikigandaro.<verse eid="ISA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 22:13" />Ariko raba, hari umunezero no kwiginana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">mubaga inka mukica intama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">mwirira inyama, mwinywera umuvinyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:13">Mukavuga muti: “Reka twirire twongere twinywere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:13">kuko ejo tuzopfa.”<verse eid="ISA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 22:14" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose yampishuriye ibi nanje ndiko ndumviriza: “No gushika ku musi muzopfirako, ico caha ntikizoharirwa,” ni ko Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, avuze.<verse eid="ISA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 22:15" />Uku ni ko Umwami, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:15">Genda, ubwire urya muzezwabintu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:15">ari we Shebuna umurongozi w’ibikorwa vyo ku kirimba, umubaze uti:<verse eid="ISA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 22:16" />Uriko ukora iki ngaha; ni nde yaguhaye uruhusha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:16">rwo kwiyimbira imva ngaha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:16">ukayiyimbira ahakirurutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:16">ukiyimbira aho uzohambwa mu gitandara?<verse eid="ISA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 22:17" />“Wiyubare. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azogufatana inkomezi nyinshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:17">agushiburire kure, yewe wa munyenkomezi we.<verse eid="ISA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 22:18" />Azokuzingazinga bwa mupira wo gukina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:18">aguterere mu gihugu cagutse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 22:18">Aho ni ho uzogwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:18">hamwe n’imikogote yawe yatuma wishima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:18">uzoba agatetereza k’inzu ya shobuja.<verse eid="ISA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 22:19" />Nzokwaka ubutware bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 22:19">kandi nzogukura mu kibanza cawe nkumanure.<verse eid="ISA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 22:20" />Kuri uwo musi, nzohamagaza umusavyi wanje Eliyakimu mwene Hilukiya agusubirire. <verse eid="ISA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 22:21" />Nzomwambika ikanzu yawe, ndamukenyeze umukanda, maze ndamuhe ubutware bwawe. Azoba se w’ababa i Yerusalemu hamwe n’ab’inzu ya Yuda. <verse eid="ISA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 22:22" />Nzoshira ku bitugu vyiwe urupfunguruzo rw’inzu ya Dawidi; yuguruye nta wuzokwugara, kandi niyugara nta wuzokwugurura. <verse eid="ISA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 22:23" />Nzomushimangira nk’urumambo ahantu hakomeye; azozana icubahiro ku nzu ya se. <verse eid="ISA 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 22:24" />Icubahiro c’umuryango wiwe cose kizoba kuri we: kizoba ku ruvyaro rwiwe, no gushika ku wo hasi y’abandi bose.”<verse eid="ISA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 22:25" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze ati: “Kuri uwo musi, urumambo rwashimangiwe ahakomeye ruzokurwaho; ruzotemwa rugwe, umutwaro wari uruboheweko ukoroke.” Ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yavuze.<verse eid="ISA 22:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ISA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Tiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 23:1" />Imburi kuri Tiro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Nimuboroge, yemwe mwa mato y’i Tarushishi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">kuko i Tiro hatikiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">amazu n’ivyambu vy’amato vyasanganguwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:1">Bari bakiri mu gihugu ca Kupuro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:1">maze inkuru ibasangaho.<verse eid="ISA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 23:2" />Nimucereze, yemwe bantu bo mw’izinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:2">hamwe namwe badandaza b’i Sidoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:2">mwebwe mwari mutungishijwe n’abatwara ibintu ku kiyaga.<verse eid="ISA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 23:3" />Abatwara ibintu ku mazi menshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:3">bakazana ingano ziva i Shiholi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:3">n’ivyimburwa vy’uruzi Nili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:3">ari vyo vyari bitungishije Tiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:3">hagaca hahinduka isoko y’amahanga.<verse eid="ISA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 23:4" />Maramara yewe Sidoni, hamwe nawe gihome co ku kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:4">kuko ikiyaga kivuze kiti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:4">“Sindigera ntera ibise, kandi sindigera mvyara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:4">Nta bahungu nonkeje, kandi nta bakobwa nareze.”<verse eid="ISA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 23:5" />Inkuru y’i Tiro niyashika muri Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:5">bazobabara cane.<verse eid="ISA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 23:6" />Jabuka ikiyaga ushike i Tarushishi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:6">nimuboroge, yemwe bantu bo kuri iryo zinga!<verse eid="ISA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 23:7" />Mbega iki ni ca gisagara canyu c’umunezero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:7">kimwe kimaze imyaka n’iyindi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:7">ibirenge vyaco vyajanye abaco kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:7">bakaja gutegeka amahanga ya kure?<verse eid="ISA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 23:8" />Mbega ni nde yateguye gutera Tiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:8">kandi ari co gisagara cambika ingori abami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:8">abadandaza baho bakaba ari abaganwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:8">abatunzi baho na bo bakaba ba rurangiranwa mw’isi?<verse eid="ISA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 23:9" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ni we yabiteguye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:9">kugira ngo asubize hasi ubwibone bwose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:9">yongere acishe bugufi abanyacubahiro bo kw’isi bose.<verse eid="ISA 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 23:10" />Rima ku nkengera y’ikiyaga nk’uko Abanyegiputa babigira ku ruzi Nili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:10">yewe mukobwa w’i Tarushishi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:10">kuko ata vyambu bikiriho.<verse eid="ISA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 23:11" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaramvuriye ukuboko kwiwe ku kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:11">ajugumiza ubwami bwaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:11">Yatanze itegeko ryerekeye Foyinike,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:11">ko inzitiro zaho zisenyurwa.<verse eid="ISA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 23:12" />Yavuze ati: “Ntukongere kunezerwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:12">yewe mukobwa Sidoni, kuko usanganguwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:12">Mbere, naho wojabuka ikiyaga ukagera i Kupuro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:12">na ho nyene nta buruhukiro woharonka.”<verse eid="ISA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 23:13" />Tereza amaso ku gihugu c’i Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">abantu baho ntibagiharurwa nk’abariho!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:13">Abanyashuri barahahinduye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">bahahinduye igihugu c’imfyisi zo mu bugaragwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:13">Bahubatse ivyo kwuririrako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">basenyagura ingoro z’abami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:13">igihugu bagisiga ari umusaka.<verse eid="ISA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 23:14" />Nimuboroge yemwe mwa mato y’i Tarushishi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:14">kuko ivyambu vyanyu vyakuweho.<verse eid="ISA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 23:15" />Ico gihe i Tiro hazokwibagirwa imyaka mirongo indwi, imyaka ingana n’iy’ubuzima bw’umwami. Ariko inyuma y’iyo myaka, ibizoba kuri Sidoni bizoba nk’ibiri muri iyi ndirimbo ya maraya:<verse eid="ISA 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 23:16" />“Akira inanga, ugendagende mu gisagara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:16">yewe maraya wibagiwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 23:16">ucurarange, uririmbe indirimbo nyinshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 23:16">kugira ngo usubire wibukwe.”<verse eid="ISA 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 23:17" />Inyuma y’iyo myaka mirongo indwi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azosubira kuvyura Tiro. Ariko hazosubira ku rudandazwa rwaho rwa kera, hasambane n’ubwami bwose bwo kw’isi. <verse eid="ISA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 23:18" />Ariko inyuma y’aho inyungu zaho zose zizokwegurirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ntizizobikwa canke ngo zishirwe ukwazo, kuko zizohabwa abama imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kugira ngo baronke ivyo barya n’ivyo bambara.<verse eid="ISA 23:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ISA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Ukurandurwa kw’isi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 24:1" />Ehe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agira ahindure isi umusaka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:1">Agira ayisambure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:1">asibanganye ubwiza bwayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:1">abayibako bashwiragire:<verse eid="ISA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 24:2" />ibizoba kuri umwe ni vyo bizoba no ku wundi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">yaba umuherezi canke umuntu asanzwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">yaba umukoresha canke umukozi wiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">yaba inabuja canke incoreke yiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">yaba uwushora canke uwugura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">yaba uwugurana canke uwuguranwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">yaba uwugurana yunguka canke uwishura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:2">yaba uwuheraniwe canke uwuheranye.<verse eid="ISA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 24:3" />Isi izocika umusaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:3">inyagwe ibiri kuri yo vyose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:3">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 24:4" />Isi iragandaye, kandi irakabiranye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:4">isi iraburaniwe, irakabiranye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:4">mbere n’amajuru ashiranye na yo.<verse eid="ISA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 24:5" />Isi irahumanye kandi ihumanijwe n’abantu bayibako:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:5">bataye ivyagezwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:5">barenga ku mabwirizwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:5">bica isezerano ry’ibihe vyose.<verse eid="ISA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 24:6" />Ni co gituma umuvumo utongoye isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">abantu bayo bashitsweko n’ingaruka z’ivyo bakoze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:6">Ni co gituma abayibako batongowe bagashira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:6">hasigaye inkehwa gusa.<verse eid="ISA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 24:7" />Umuvinyu mushasha urabuze, n’uruzabibu rurakabiranye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:7">abahorana umunezero barijiriwe.<verse eid="ISA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 24:8" />Umunezero uvuye ku dushako tw’ingoma urahagaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:8">urwamo rw’abanezerewe ruraheze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:8">inanga zihimbaye kwumva zirahagaze.<verse eid="ISA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 24:9" />Ntibazosubira kunywa umuvinyu baririmba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:9">inzoga ihindukiye umururazi abayinywa.<verse eid="ISA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 24:10" />Igisagara c’imivurungano kirasenyutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:10">inzugi z’amazu yose zirugawe.<verse eid="ISA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 24:11" />Baririra mu mabarabara barondera umuvinyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:11">ahari umunezero habaye ukwihebura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:11">amajwi yose y’umunezero akuwe mw’isi.<verse eid="ISA 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 24:12" />Igisagara gisigaye ari umusaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:12">inzugi z’amarembo yaco baziciye ubunywenywe.<verse eid="ISA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 24:13" />Ni ko bizogenda kw’isi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:13">no mu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:13">bizomera kurya igiti c’umwelayo cazungagijwe kimera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:13">canke kurya bimera iyo hasigaye uduhumbwa inzabibu zimaze kwimburwa.<verse eid="ISA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 24:14" />Abazorokoka bazoduza amajwi, bavuze akamo k’umunezero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:14">bave mu buseruko baririmba icubahiro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="ISA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 24:15" />None rero nimuhimbaze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yemwe abo mu buseruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:15">mushire hejuru izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:15">yemwe abo mu mazinga yo mu kiyaga.<verse eid="ISA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 24:16" />Twumvise indirimbo ziva ku mpera z’isi zivuga ziti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">“Icubahiro kibe ic’umwe agororotse!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 24:16" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">Ariko nanje mvuga nti: “Ndageseye, ndageseye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">Ewe jewe ndagowe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:16">Abahemu barahemukiye abandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:16">mbere barahemutse cane.”<verse eid="ISA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 24:17" />Ibiteye ubwoba, urwobo n’umutego birabarindiriye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:17">yemwe bantu bo kw’isi.<verse eid="ISA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 24:18" />Uwuzohunga urwamo rw’ibiteye ubwoba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">azogwa mu rwobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:18">uwuzosimba urwobo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">azogwa mu mutego.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 24:18" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:18">Ingomero zo mw’ijuru ziragomorowe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:18">kandi amatanguriro y’isi aranyiganyize.<verse eid="ISA 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 24:19" />Isi iramenetse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:19">isi irasenyutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:19">iranyiganyijwe cane.<verse eid="ISA 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 24:20" />Isi iradandabagiranye nk’imborerwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:20">inyiganyizwa nk’akazu k’ivyatsi kanyiganyizwa n’umuyaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:20">Iremerewe no gutsindwa n’ubugarariji bwayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:20">ni co gituma itemvye kandi ntizokwongera kuvyuka.<verse eid="ISA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 24:21" />Kuri uwo musi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azohana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:21">ingabo zo hejuru mw’ijuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:21">n’abami bo hasi kw’isi.<verse eid="ISA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 24:22" />Bazokwegeranirizwa hamwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:22">nk’uko imbohe zegeranirizwa mu rwobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:22">bugaranirwe mw’ibohero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:22">maze bazocirwa urubanza haciye igihe kirekire.<verse eid="ISA 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 24:23" />Ukwezi kuzogira isoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:23">izuba na ryo rizomaramara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 24:23">Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose azoganza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:23">ku Musozi Siyoni n’i Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 24:23">ari imbere y’abatware baho kandi ari mu bwiza bwinshi.<verse eid="ISA 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ISA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Ishimwe ni iry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 25:1" />Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni wewe Mana yanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">nzogushira hejuru nongere ntazire izina ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:1">kuko mu bwizigirwa butagira agasembwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">wakoze ibitangaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:1">ivyo wari warateguye kuva kera.<verse eid="ISA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 25:2" />Wahinduye igisagara ibirundo vy’isakamburira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:2">igisagara kizitiriwe ukigira umusaka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:2">Ibirimba vyiza vyo mu mahanga ya kure bikuweho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:2">kandi ntibizosubira kwubakwa.<verse eid="ISA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 25:3" />Ni co gituma ibihugu bikomeye bizokwubaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:3">ibisagara vy’amahanga ateye ubwoba bikagutinya.<verse eid="ISA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 25:4" />Wabereye aboro ubuhungiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">ubuhungiro bw’abakene mu kuburanirwa kwabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">ubabera ubwugamo mu gihuhusi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">n’igitutu mu gihe c’indugumba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:4">Kuko uburake bw’inkozi z’ibibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:4">bumeze nk’igihuhusi cisuka ku gihome,<verse eid="ISA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 25:5" />canke nk’ubushuhe bwo mu bugaragwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:5">Uzibiza urwamo rw’abanyamahanga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:5">nk’uko ubushuhe bugabanurwa n’igitutu kizanywe n’igicu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:5">uko ni ko uzivya n’indirimbo z’inkozi z’ibibi.<verse eid="ISA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 25:6" />Kuri uwu musozi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose azohategurira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:6">abantu bose amazimano aryoshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:6">banywe umuvinyu wa kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:6">barye inyama zinuze bongere banywe n’umuvinyu umiminye neza.<verse eid="ISA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 25:7" />Kuri uwo musozi ni ho azotabagurira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:7">igihuzu co kugandara cipfutswe n’abantu bose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:7">ari wo mwambaro utwikiriye amahanga yose.<verse eid="ISA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 25:8" />Urupfu azorumira ataruhekenye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:8">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji azobahanagura amarira yose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">ayakure ku maso yose;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:8">azokura agakengerwe kose ku bantu biwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:8">iyo bari kw’isi hose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:8">Uko ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 25:9" />Kuri uwo musi ni ho bazovuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:9">“Vy’ukuri iyi ni yo Mana yacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">turayizeye, ni yo yaturokoye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:9">Uwu ni <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, turamwizeye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:9">reka duhimbarwe, tunezerererwe agakiza kiwe.”<verse eid="ISA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 25:10" />Ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kuri kuri uwu musozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:10">ariko Mowabu bazohonyangirwa iwabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:10">nk’uko ivyatsi bihonyangirwa mu nyabarega.<verse eid="ISA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 25:11" />Bazokwaya amaboko bari muri ivyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:11">nk’uko aboga baya amaboko yabo mu kwoga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:11">Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobamara ubwibone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:11">ntazokangwa n’ububangutsi bwabo.<verse eid="ISA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 25:12" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azosenyura inzitiro zanyu ndende,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:12">aziryamike hasi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 25:12">azozihenura zigwe zishike hasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 25:12">mu mukungugu.<verse eid="ISA 25:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ISA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Indirimbo y’ishimwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 26:1" />Kuri uwo musi, iyi ni yo ndirimbo izoririmbwa mu gihugu c’i Buyuda:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:1">Dufise igisagara gikomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:1">Imana iduhaye agakiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:1">ngo kabe inzitiro n’ibihome bidukingira.<verse eid="ISA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 26:2" />Nimwugurure amarembo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:2">kugira ngo ihanga rigororotse ryinjire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:2">ihanga rigumya ukwizera.<verse eid="ISA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 26:3" />Uzozigamira mu mahoro yuzuye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:3">abo bose bashira ivyiyumviro vyabo kuri wewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:3">kuko bakwizigiye!<verse eid="ISA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 26:4" />Mwizigire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ibihe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:4">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ubwiwe ari we gitandara gihoraho.<verse eid="ISA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 26:5" />Acisha bugufi ababa ahantu hakirurutse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">igisagara cishira hejuru agisubiza hasi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:5">arakimanura gushika hasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:5">akakiryamika mu mukungugu.<verse eid="ISA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 26:6" />Kizohonyangwa n’ibirenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:6">ibirenge vy’impahazwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:6">n’ibirenge vy’aboro.<verse eid="ISA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 26:7" />Inzira y’umugororotsi iraramvuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:7">kandi wewe Mugororotsi wenyene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:7">ni wewe utuma inzira y’umugororotsi iringanira.<verse eid="ISA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 26:8" />Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, mu nzira z’ivyagezwe vyawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:8">ni ho tukwitegeye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:8">izina ryawe n’ukuba rurangiranwa kwawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:8">ni vyo imitima yacu ihahamiye.<verse eid="ISA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 26:9" />Umutima wanje uragushaka mw’ijoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">mu gitondo impwemu yanje ikakurondera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:9">Iyo urubanza rwawe ruje kw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:9">ababa kw’isi baca bigiraho ukugororoka.<verse eid="ISA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 26:10" />Ariko abanyakibi n’aho ubagirira ubuntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:10">ntibaca biga ukugororoka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:10">mbere no mu gihugu c’abagororotsi baguma bakora ivyaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:10">ntibigera babona ubukuru bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="ISA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 26:11" />Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ubabanguriye ukuboko kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">ariko ntibanabibona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:11">Reka babone ishaka ufitiye ubwoko bwawe, maze ubamaramaze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:11">rekura umuriro wageneye abansi bawe ubatongore.<verse eid="ISA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 26:12" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni wewe uzoduha amahoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:12">kandi ivyo twashitseko vyose ni wewe wabidukoreye.<verse eid="ISA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 26:13" />Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Mana yacu, abami badutwaye ni benshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:13">ariko izina ryawe ryonyene ni ryo duha icubahiro.<verse eid="ISA 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 26:14" />Barapfuye, ntibakiriho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">impwemu zabo zaragiye, ntizikigaruka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:14">Warabahanye kandi ubashitsa aho batikira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:14">urabazimanganya, ntibasubira kwibukwa.<verse eid="ISA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 26:15" />Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, waratwaguriye igihugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:15">ni wewe wakitwaguriye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:15">Warihesheje icubahiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:15">utwagurira imbibe z’igihugu.<verse eid="ISA 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 26:16" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> we, igihe twari mu vyago twarakurondeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:16">inkoni yawe idushitseko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:16">dusuka amaganya yacu imbere yawe.<verse eid="ISA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 26:17" />Twari tumeze nk’umugore ari ku bise</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:17">aribwa akarizwa n’imibabaro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:17">Natwe ni ko twari tumeze, yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="ISA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 26:18" />Twari twibungenze umwana, turibwa, turi mu mibabaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:18">ariko tuvyara umuyaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:18">Nta gakiza twazaniye isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:18">kandi nta n’ubuzima twazanye muri iyi si.<verse eid="ISA 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 26:19" />Ariko abawe bapfuye bazobaho, yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">imibiri yabo izozuka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Mwebwe abari mu mukungugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">ikangure muririmbe indirimbo z’umunezero.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:19">Kuko ikime canyu kimeze nk’ikime c’agatondo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:19">kandi isi izogarukana abapfuye.<verse eid="ISA 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 26:20" />Nimugende, yemwe mwa bwoko bwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:20">mwinjire mu vyumba mwiyugarane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:20">mwinyegeze gatoya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:20">uburake bwiwe bubanze burengane.<verse eid="ISA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 26:21" />Ehe raba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuye mw’ijuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">ahagurukanywe no guhanira abo kw’isi ivyaha vyabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 26:21">Isi izogaragaza amaraso yayisheshweko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 26:21">ntizosubira gupfuka abishwe bari muri yo.<verse eid="ISA 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ISA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Ugutabarwa kwa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 27:1" />Kuri uwo musi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azohanisha inkota yiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:1">inkota yiwe ikarishe, nini kandi y’ubushobozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:1">agwanye Leviyatani ca kiyoka kinyaruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:1">Leviyatani ca kiyoka cigonyonzora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:1">azokwica ca gisizimwe co mu kiyaga.<verse eid="ISA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 27:2" />Kuri uwo musi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:2">tuzotera indirimbo, turirimbira uruzabibu rwamye cane.<verse eid="ISA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 27:3" />Jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni jewe ndarurinda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:3">nkama ndaruvomera ubudasiba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:3">ndarurinda ijoro n’umurango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:3">kugira ngo ntihagire ikirwonona.<verse eid="ISA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 27:4" />Sinkirushavuriye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:4">Ariko ninarusangamwo imibambangwe n’amahwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:4">nzoja kubitera ndabigwanye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:4">nzobituririra hamwe;<verse eid="ISA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 27:5" />kiretse bimpungiyeko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:5">tugahana isezerano ry’amahoro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:5">Ni ukuri, nibize duhane isezerano ry’amahoro.<verse eid="ISA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 27:6" />Mu misi iza, uruvyaro rwa Yakobo ruzoshinga imizi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:6">Isirayeli azoshurika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:6">kandi azokwiza ivyamwa isi yose.<verse eid="ISA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 27:7" />Mbega <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarakubise Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:7">nk’uko yakubise abamukubise?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:7">Canke yaramwishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:7">nk’uko yishe abamwishe?<verse eid="ISA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 27:8" />Oya, ahubwo yamuhanye buhoro mu kumwirukana mu gihugu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:8">Yamwirukanye mu gihuhusi gikomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:8">nko ku musi umuyaga wo mu buseruko uhuhutirako.<verse eid="ISA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 27:9" />Ng’ibi ibizotuma ivyaha vya Yakobo bitwikirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">kandi ibi ni vyo vyamwa vy’uko ivyaha vyiwe vyakuweho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:9">Amabuye yose yubatse ibicaniro vy’ibigirwamana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">azoyamenagura acike umukungugu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:9">nta nkingi za Ashera canke ibicaniro vyo guturirirako ibimota neza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:9">bizosigara bihagaze muri Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 27:10" />Ibisagara bizitiriwe bizosigara ari imisaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">ari agahinga kahebwe, hameze nk’ubugaragwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:10">Inyana ni ho zizorisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">ziharyame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:10">zirishe ku mashami yaho.<verse eid="ISA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 27:11" />Amashami yaho niyuma azovunagurika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">abagore bayasenye baje kuyacana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 27:11">Kuko ubu bwoko ntibugira ugutahura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">ni co gituma Umuremyi wabo ata mbabazi abugirira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 27:11">Imana yabaremye ntibagirira impuhwe.<verse eid="ISA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 27:12" />Kuri uwo musi, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azosekura ingano, kuva ku ruzi Efutate kugeza ku mugezi wa Egiputa. Namwe Bisirayeli, muzokwegeranywa umwumwe. <verse eid="ISA 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 27:13" />Uwo musi inzamba nini izovuzwa. Abariko barahonera muri Ashuri n’abari barajanywe ari inyagano muri Egiputa bazoza guhimbariza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku musozi wera i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 27:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ISA 28" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyago ku barongozi ba Efurayimu na Yuda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 28:1" />Ubonye ibara wa rugori rw’ubwibone imborerwa za Efurayimu zineganegana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">ubwiza bukayangana bwawe bubaye nk’ishurwe rikabiranye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:1">riri ku mutwe w’ikiyaya kimera cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:1">igisagara ari co bwibone bw’abagwishwa hasi n’umuvinyu!<verse eid="ISA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 28:2" />Ehe raba Imana yifitiye umunyenkomezi w’intwari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:2">Imeze nk’urubura canke igihuhusi gisambura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:2">nk’imyuzure isendanisha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:2">Izobakubitisha hasi inkomezi nyishi.<verse eid="ISA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 28:3" />Maze urugori rw’ubwibone imborerwa za Efurayimu zineganegana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:3">ruzohonyangirwa hasi.<verse eid="ISA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 28:4" />Iryo shurwe rikabiranye, ryahorana ubwiza n’icubahiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">riri ku mutwe w’ikiyaya kimera cane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:4">rizomera nk’insukoni zihishiye imbere y’iyimbura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">Iyo abantu bazibonye, baca bazamura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:4">bakazitamira.<verse eid="ISA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 28:5" />Kuri uwo musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:5">azoba urugori rw’ubwiza bwinshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:5">urugori rwiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:5">ku masigarira y’ubwoko bwiwe.<verse eid="ISA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 28:6" />Azobera impwemu y’ukugororoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:6">uwicaye aca imanza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:6">yongere abere isoko ry’inkomezi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:6">abasubiza urugamba inyuma y’amarembo.<verse eid="ISA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 28:7" />Ariko Isirayeli na we adandabagiranishwa n’umuvinyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">ibiboreza biramuzungagije.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">Abaherezi n’abavugishwa badandabagiranishijwe n’ibiboreza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">bazengerejwe n’umuvinyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:7">bazungagijwe n’inzoga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">Iyo bariko barerekwa inzozi baradandabagirana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:7">bagatsitagurika iyo bafata ingingo.<verse eid="ISA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 28:8" />Imeza zabo zuzuyeko ivyo badashwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:8">umwanda ukwiragiye hose.<verse eid="ISA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 28:9" />Barabazanya bati: “Mbega Yesaya yigira iki mu kugerageza kutwigisha?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:9">Ni ba nde ariko arabwira ayo majambo yiwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:9">Tubaye abana bagicuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:9">canke bakiva kw’ibere rya ba nyina?<verse eid="ISA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 28:10" />Kuko ivyiwe ari:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">Kora ibi, kora birya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">itegeko ry’iki ni iri, itegeko rya kirya ni rirya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:10">dukeya aha, dukeya harya.”<verse eid="ISA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 28:11" />Aho ni vyiza ko biri uko, akanwa k’abanyamahanga, n’indimi zitazwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:11">ni vyo Imana izovuganiramwo n’aba bantu.<verse eid="ISA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 28:12" />Abo yari yarababwiye ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:12">“Iki ni co kibanza co kuruhukiramwo, abarushe nibaruhuke”;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:12">kandi ati: “Ubu ni bwo buruhukiro;”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:12">ariko ntibamwumviye.<verse eid="ISA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 28:13" />Ni co gituma kuri bo, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryahindutse, rizoba:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">kora ibi, kora birya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">itegeko ni iri kuri iki, ni iri kuri kirya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">dukeya aha, dukeya harya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:13">kugira ngo nibatambuka bagwire umugongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:13">bakomereke, bagwe mu mutego maze bafatwe.<verse eid="ISA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 28:14" />None rero mwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mwa bacokoranyi mwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:14">muganje i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 28:15" />Mwirata muvuga muti: “Twagiranye isezerano n’urupfu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">kandi imva twarumvikanye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:15">Icago gikukumura nicahaca,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">ntikizodushikako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:15">kuko twarironkeye ubuhungiro mu binyoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:15">ububeshi ni bwo bwihisho bwacu.”<verse eid="ISA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 28:16" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:16">“Raba ndashira ibuye i Siyoni, ibuye ryageragejwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">ibuye ry’igiciro rigumya imfuruka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:16">Uwuryizera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:16">ntazokwigera anyiganyiga.<verse eid="ISA 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 28:17" />Guca imanza zibereye ni vyo nzogira igipimo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:17">kandi ubugororotsi ni bwo nzogira karisho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:17">urubura ruzosambura ubuhungiro bwanyu, ari vyo binyoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:17">kandi amazi azokwuzura ubwihisho bwanyu.<verse eid="ISA 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 28:18" />Isezerano mwagiraniye n’urupfu rizokurwaho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:18">umwumvikano mwumvikanye n’imva ntuzoramba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:18">Umwuzure ukomeye niwahaca,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:18">uzobakubita hasi.<verse eid="ISA 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 28:19" />Uwo mwuzure, uko uje kwose, uzokwama ubatwara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">uko bukeye, ku murango no mw’ijoro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">uzobatwara.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 28:19" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:19">Kandi gutahura ubu butumwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:19">bizobatera guhinda agashitsi kenshi.<verse eid="ISA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 28:20" />Uburiri ni bugufi, ntimuzoronka aho murambiriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:20">n’uburengeti ni buto, ntimushobora kubwipfuka ngo bubakwire.<verse eid="ISA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 28:21" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azohaguruka nk’uko yahagurutse ku musozi Perazimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:21">arake nk’uko yarakiye ikiyaya c’i Gibeyoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:21">akore igikorwa ciwe c’agatangaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:21">igikorwa kitamenyerewe.<verse eid="ISA 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 28:22" />Nuko rero nimugeze ngaho ugushinyagura kwanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:22">ahandi hoho ibihano birongerekana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:22">Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose yambwiye ivy’agatikizo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:22">ako yateguriye igihugu cose.<verse eid="ISA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 28:23" />Nimuntege amatwi munyumve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:23">nimwumvirize ivyo ndiko ndavuga.<verse eid="ISA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 28:24" />Mbega umurimyi iyo ariko ararima aho agomba guteragira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:24">yama ariko ararima gusa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:24">Yama ariko ararima ategura ubusize?<verse eid="ISA 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 28:25" />Iyo amaze gutegura neza aho yarimye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">ntaheza akamija imbuto, akabiba izitwa kumino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:25">akabiba ingano mu kibanza cazo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">akabiba izitwa sayiri uko zibibwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:25">akabiba n’izitwa kusemati uko zibibwa?<verse eid="ISA 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 28:26" />Imana yiwe ni yo imwigisha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:26">ikamwereka ingene abikora neza.<verse eid="ISA 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 28:27" />Uburo ntibabusekuza umuhini usongoye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:27">kumino ntibazisekuza ibigata vy’imikogote</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:27">Uburo bakabukubitisha ikibano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:27">kumino bakayikubitisha inkoni.<verse eid="ISA 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 28:28" />Ingano barazisya bakazicumbamwo umutsima.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:28">Nta muntu yama ariko arazisya adaheza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 28:28">Amapine y’umukogote usekura yoshobora gukoreshwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:28">ariko nta wukoresha ifarasi mu gusekura ingano.<verse eid="ISA 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 28:29" />Ubwo bumenyi bwose buva k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:29">we mujenama w’igitangaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 28:29">n’ubwenge bw’agahebuza.<verse eid="ISA 28:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="ISA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyago ku gisagara ca Dawidi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 29:1" />Uzobona ibara yewe Ariyeli, Ariyeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:1">igisagara Dawidi yabayemwo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:1">Ku mwaka ku mwaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:1">nimwigirire imisi mikuru y’urutavanako,<verse eid="ISA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 29:2" />Ariko nzoza nugarize Ariyeli;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:2">hazoba amarira no gucura intimba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:2">Kuko Yerusalemu hazoba ico izina Ariyeli risigura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:2">ni igicaniro cuzuyeko amaraso.<verse eid="ISA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 29:3" />Nzokwugariza impande zose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:3">nkuziguze ibirindiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:3">nkurundire ibirundo vyo kwuririrako kugira ngo ndakugwanye.<verse eid="ISA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 29:4" />Nzokumanura hasi, usigare uvugira mw’ivu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">amajambo yawe uyadebagure ava mu mukungugu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:4">Ijwi ryawe rizokwumvikana nk’iry’umuzimu riva mw’ivu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:4">ryongorere riva mu mukungugu.<verse eid="ISA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 29:5" />Ariko mu kanya isase, abansi banyu naho ari benshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:5">bazocika umukungugu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:5">n’ingabo zabo ziteye ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:5">zizoba nk’umuguruka ugururwa n’umuyaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:5">Buno nyene, mu kanya isase,<verse eid="ISA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 29:6" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose azoza kugutabara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:6">azanye inkuba na nyamugigima hamwe n’ukwasana gukomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:6">n’agashururu, n’igihuhusi hamwe n’imbeya z’umuriro utongora.<verse eid="ISA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 29:7" />Ingabo z’amahanga yose agwanya igisagara Ariyeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:7">zikagiterana n’inzitiro zaho zikagikikuza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:7">zizokamangana nk’indoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:7">canke ukwerekwa kwo mw’ijoro.<verse eid="ISA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 29:8" />Kurya uwushonje arota ariko ararya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">ariko yavyuka agasanga agishonje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:8">Kurya uwunyotewe arota ariko aranywa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">ariko yavyuka agasanga akinyotewe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:8">Uko ni ko bizomera ku ngabo z’amahanga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:8">zigwanya umusozi Siyoni.<verse eid="ISA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 29:9" />Banza muhagarare mutangare!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">Muhumirize amaso, mube impumyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:9">Muborerwe mutanyoye umuvinyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:9">mudandabagirane mutanyoye ibiboreza.<verse eid="ISA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 29:10" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abasutseko uruhumyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:10">ahumishije amaso yanyu ari bo bavugishwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:10">atwikiriye imitwe yanyu ari bo ba kamenyi banyu.<verse eid="ISA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 29:11" />Kuko uku kwerekwa kwose kwababereye nk’amajambo yo mu gitabu kimatanishijwe ishashara. Mugihaye uwushobora gusoma mukamubwira muti: “Turakwinginze udusomere,” yobabwira ati: “Sinoshobora gusoma kuko kiramatanije.” <verse eid="ISA 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 29:12" />Mugihaye uwutazi gusoma na we mukamubwira muti: “Turakwinginze udusomere,” yobishura ati: “Sinzi gusoma.”<verse eid="ISA 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 29:13" />Imana ivuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:13">“Aba bantu baza aho ndi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">banyubahisha iminwa yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">ariko imitima yabo iri kure yanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:13">Ugusenga kwabo nta kindi kurimwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:13">atari ivyo bigishijwe n’amategeko y’abana b’abantu.<verse eid="ISA 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 29:14" />None rero ngomba nsubire ntangaze aba bantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">nkore ibitangaza bidasanzwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:14">ubwenge bw’abanyabwenge buzokamangana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:14">n’ubumenyi bw’abiyita ko bazi vyinshi buzohindurwa ubusa.”<verse eid="ISA 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 29:15" />Bazobona ibara abamanuka kure i kuzimu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">ngo banyegeze imigambi yabo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:15">bagakora ibikorwa vyabo bikinze umwijima kandi bibwira bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:15">“Hari uwutubona? Ni nde azomenya ivyo dukora?”<verse eid="ISA 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 29:16" />Ibintu murabicurika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">nk’aho womenga umubumvyi mwamunganishije n’ibumba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:16">Mbega icabumbwe cobwira uwakibumvye kiti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">“Ntiwambumvye?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:16">Canke inkono yobwira umubumvyi iti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:16">“Ntuzi kubumba?”<verse eid="ISA 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 29:17" />Hasigaye igihe gito, Libani hagacika itongo rimera cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:17">ahahora hamera cane na ho hagiye kuba ishamba.<verse eid="ISA 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 29:18" />Kuri uwo musi ibipfamatwi bizokwumva amajambo yo muri ca gitabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:18">amaso y’impumyi azobona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:18">ave mu muzitanya no mu mwijima.<verse eid="ISA 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 29:19" />Abaciye bugufi bazosubira kandi kunezererwa mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:19">aboro bazonezerererwa Uwera wa Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 29:20" />Abateye ubwoba bazokamangana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:20">abashinyagura bazonyika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:20">kandi abashinze ijisho ivyo kugira nabi bazorandurwa,<verse eid="ISA 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 29:21" />bakoresha amajambo ngo batsindishe abantu mu manza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:21">bagatega imitego abacamanza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:21">kandi mu gukoresha ivyabona vy’ibinyoma uwari gutsinda mu rubanza ntatsinda.<verse eid="ISA 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 29:22" />None rero, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, uwacunguye Aburahamu, abwiye abakomoka kuri Yakobo ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:22">“Bene Yakobo ntibazokwongera kumaramara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:22">kandi mu maso habo ntihazosubira kwijirirwa.<verse eid="ISA 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 29:23" />Kuko nibabona abana babo hagati muri bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">ari bo gikorwa c’amaboko yanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 29:23">bose bazomenya ko izina ryanje ari iryera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">Bazokwemera ukwera kw’Uwera wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:23">batamarirwe batangarira Imana ya Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 29:24" />Abo imitima yazimiye bazomenya ukuri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 29:24">n’abidodomba bazokwemera kwigishwa.”<verse eid="ISA 29:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="ISA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Ibara kw’ihanga ry’intagondwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 30:1" />“Muzobona ibara mwa bana badakurwa kw’ijambo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:1">“mugira imigabo ihushanye n’ugushaka kwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">mukagirana amasezerano n’abandi bantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">mugabo atavuye kuri Mpwemu wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:1">mukirundaniriza ivyaha ku bindi.<verse eid="ISA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 30:2" />Mwebwe mumanuka muri Egiputa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:2">mutangishije inama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:2">mukarondera ubutabazi no gukingirwa kuri Farawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:2">mu gitutu ca Egiputa akaba ari ho murondera ubuhungiro.<verse eid="ISA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 30:3" />Ariko kwizigira guhungira kwa Farawo bizobabera agatetereza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:3">kandi igitutu ca Egiputa kizobamaramaza.<verse eid="ISA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 30:4" />Naho bafise abatware bari i Zowani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:4">intumwa zabo zikaba zigeze i Hanesi,<verse eid="ISA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 30:5" />bose bazomaramara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">kuko bazosanga bizigiye abantu b’imburakimazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:5">ata co babafasha kandi ata n’akarusho na kamwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:5">atari ukubateza isoni n’ibiteterwe gusa.”<verse eid="ISA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 30:6" />Imburi ku bikoko vy’i Negebu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">Mu gihugu c’amakuba n’imibabaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">kibamwo intambwe z’ingabo n’iz’ingore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">kikabamwo inzoka z’ubumara bukaze n’iziguruka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">izo ntumwa ni ho zaciye zitwaye ubutunzi ku migongo y’indogoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:6">n’ivy’agaciro ku mapfupfu y’ingamiya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:6">kandi ivyo vyose babirungitse mu gihugu ata co kizobamarira,<verse eid="ISA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 30:7" />muri Egiputa, kidashobora kubakingira na gatoya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:7">Ni co gituma nahahaye izina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:7">rivuga ngo Rahabu w’imburakimazi.<verse eid="ISA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 30:8" />Nuko nimugende muvyandike ku bisate vy’amabuye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:8">muvyandike mu gitabu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:8">kugira ngo mu misi izoza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:8">bizobabere ivyabona bizokwamaho.<verse eid="ISA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 30:9" />Kuko aba bantu ni abagarariji, abana babesha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:9">batagomba kwumvira ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yihanikiririza.<verse eid="ISA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 30:10" />Babwira aberekwa bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">“Ntihagire ico musubira kwerekwa!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:10">Bakabwira abavugishwa bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">“Ntihagire ikintu na kimwe c’ukugororoka musubira kutubwira!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:10">Tubwire ibiryohera amatwi yacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:10">nimuvugishwe ibinyoma!<verse eid="ISA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 30:11" />Va muri iyo nzira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:11">iyo nzira reka kuyicamwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:11">hanyuma mureke kuduhangara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:11">mutubwira ivy’uwo Wera wa Isirayeli.”<verse eid="ISA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 30:12" />Ni co gituma Uwera wa Isirayeli avuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:12">“Ko mwanse kwumva ubwo butumwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:12">mukizera agahahazo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:12">mukishimikiza n’ibinyoma,<verse eid="ISA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 30:13" />iki caha kizobabera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:13">nk’igihome kirekire, case imigaga, kandi gihengamye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:13">kigiye gusenyuka mu kanya gato.<verse eid="ISA 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 30:14" />Kizosenyuka kivunguke kurya kw’inkono imenetse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">imenaguwe ata mbabazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:14">gushika aho ata n’uworonka n’urujo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">rwo kurahurirako amakara yaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:14">canke urwo kudahisha amazi mw’iriba.”<verse eid="ISA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 30:15" />Ng’ibi ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, Uwera wa Isirayeli, avuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:15">“Mu kwihana no mu gutekana ni ho hari agakiza kanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:15">mu gutekana no mu kwizigira ni ho hari inkomezi zanyu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:15">Ariko ntimwabishatse.<verse eid="ISA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 30:16" />Mwishuye muti: ‘Oya! Tuzohunga turi ku mafarasi.’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">Kandi koko muzohunga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:16">Mwavuze muti: ‘Tuzogendera ku mafarasi anyaruka.’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:16">Kubera ivyo ababahiga na bo nyene bazoba banyaruka cane!<verse eid="ISA 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 30:17" />Abantu igihumbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">bazokinagizwa n’umuntu umwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:17">abantu batanu bazobatera ubwoba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">muhunge mwese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:17">gushika musigaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">mumeze nk’igiti c’ibendera kigaragara gishinze ku musozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:17">canke ibendera rishinze ku gasozi.”<verse eid="ISA 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 30:18" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aripfuza kubagirira imbabazi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:18">ku bw’ivyo azohaguruka kugira ngo abereke impuhwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:18">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari Imana y’ukugororoka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:18">Hahiriwe abamwiteze.<verse eid="ISA 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 30:19" />Yemwe bantu b’i Siyoni, namwe ababa i Yerusalemu, ntimugisubira kurira. Azobagirira imbabazi nimwamuririra. Niyamara kubumva, azoca abishura. <verse eid="ISA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 30:20" />Naho Imana ibagaburiye ivyokurya vy’amakuba n’amazi y’imibabaro, umwigisha wanyu ntazosubira guhishwa, muzomwibonera imbonankubone. <verse eid="ISA 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 30:21" />Naho mwohengamira i buryo canke i bubamfu, amatwi yanyu azokwumva ijwi ryiwe inyuma yanyu, ribabwira riti: “Inzira ni iyi, nibe ari yo mucamwo.” <verse eid="ISA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 30:22" />Maze muzomenagura ibishushanyo vyanyu mwometseko ifeza, hamwe n’ibibumbano mwometseko inzahabu. Muzobishibura nk’uwushibura ibiteye ishishi, muvuga muti: “Hogi, vaho wa mwanda we!”<verse eid="ISA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 30:23" />Azosubira abarungikire imvura imeze ivyo mwarimye, kandi ivyo muzokwimbura bizoba vyiza, kandi vy’umusesekara. Ico gihe inka zanyu zizorisha mu matongo yagutse. <verse eid="ISA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 30:24" />Inka n’indogoba zirima zizorya ivyatsi birunze umunyu, vyanikishijwe ikanya n’igipahu. <verse eid="ISA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 30:25" />Ku musi w’agatikizo gahambaye, igihe iminara izosiduka, imigende y’amazi izotemba ku mitumba no ku misozi yose. <verse eid="ISA 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 30:26" />Ukwezi kuzokayangana nk’izuba, ugukayangana kw’izuba kuzokwigwiza incuro indwi, kungane n’umuco w’imisi indwi, umusi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azopfuka ibisebe vy’abantu biwe, akabakiza inguma yabateye.<verse eid="ISA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 30:27" />Ehe izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rije rivuye kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:27">rirurumbamwo uburake bwiwe, ritwikiriwe n’umwotsi mwinshi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:27">iminwa yiwe yuzuye uburakari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:27">ururimi rwiwe ni umuriro utongora.<verse eid="ISA 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 30:28" />Impwemu ziwe zimeze nk’umukuba w’amazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">uduga ukagera mw’izosi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:28">Anyiganyije amahanga ayagosoresheje agatikizo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">ayambitse umujiginya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:28">ayakwegera mu mahonero.<verse eid="ISA 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 30:29" />Namwe muzoririmba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">nk’abigina umusi mukuru wera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:29">Imitima yanyu izohimbarwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">nko mu gihe abantu baduga bavuza imyironge</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:29">baja ku musozi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:29">baja ku Gitandara ca Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 30:30" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azotuma abantu bumva ijwi ryiwe ry’icubahiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:30">atume babona ukuboko kwiwe kumanuka mu burake bwinshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:30">kuzananye n’umuriro utongora, n’umuyaga w’igihuhusi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:30">hamwe n’imituragaro n’urubura.<verse eid="ISA 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 30:31" />Abashuri nibumva ijwi ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bazocika ivutu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:31">Azobakubitisha inkoni yiwe.<verse eid="ISA 30:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 30:32" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> niyakubita inkoni imwe nk’uko yabitegekanije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:32">izojana n’umudiho w’ingoma n’inanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:32">mu gihe azoba ariko arabagwanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:32">abakubitisha ukuboko kwiwe.<verse eid="ISA 30:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 30:33" />Tofeti harateguye uhereye kera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">hateguriwe umwami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:33">Ikinogo co gutuririramwo caraguwe kiba kinini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">n’inkwi zo gucana ziragwizwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 30:33">impwemu z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">zimeze nk’amazuku yaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 30:33">ni zo zizidometse.<verse eid="ISA 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="ISA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Ibara ku bizigira Egiputa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 31:1" />Bazobona ibara abamanuka muri Egiputa kurondera ugutabarwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">bakizera amafarasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">bakizera ubwinshi bw’imikogote</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">n’inkomezi z’abagendera ku mafarasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:1">aho guhanga amaso Uwera wa Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:1">canke ngo barondere ugutabarwa kuva k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="ISA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 31:2" />Ariko rero <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> na we arazi ubwenge, azobateza ivyago,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:2">kandi ntazokwivuguruza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:2">Azohagurukira inzu y’inkozi z’ibibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:2">hamwe n’abatabara inkozi z’ibibi.<verse eid="ISA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 31:3" />Kuko Abanyegiputa ari abantu buntu, atari Imana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">amafarasi yabo na yo akaba ibintu vy’umubiri gusa atari impwemu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:3">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> niyaramvura ukuboko kwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">umutabazi azotsitara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">uwutabawe azogwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:3">bompi bazohonera hamwe.<verse eid="ISA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 31:4" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yambwiye ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">“Nk’uko intare yivuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">kandi nk’uko intare ikomeye irohera ku co yafashe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">abungere bagakorana ngo bayigwanye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">ariko ntiterwe ubwoba n’urwamo rwabo n’induru yabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:4">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose azomanurwa no kugwanira ku musozi Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:4">n’ahakirurutse cane hawo.<verse eid="ISA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 31:5" />Nk’uko ibisiga bisanza amababa, hejuru y’ivyari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:5">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose azokingira Yerusalemu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:5">azohakingira yongere aharokore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:5">azoca hejuru yaho ahakize.<verse eid="ISA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 31:6" />Yemwe Bisirayeli, enda nimugaruke kuri Umwe mwagarariza. <verse eid="ISA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 31:7" />Igihe kizogera, aho muzota ibigirwamana vy’ifeza n’ivy’inzahabu amaboko yanyu yuzuye ivyaha yakoze.<verse eid="ISA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 31:8" />Ashuri hazorandurwa n’inkota itari iy’abantu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">inkota itari iy’abantu buntu ni yo izobarigita.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:8">Bazohunga imbere y’iyo nkota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:8">kandi imikangara yabo izogirwa abagurano.<verse eid="ISA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 31:9" />Ahantu hakomeye binyegeza hazosenyuka kubera ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">abakuru mu ntambara nibabona amabendera y’intambara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">bazota umutwe.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 31:9">Uko ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">uwufise umuriro wiwe i Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 31:9">akagira n’itanure i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 31:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="ISA 32" />
  <para style="s1">Ubwami bugororotse</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 32:1" />Ehe raba, hagiye kwima umwami agororotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:1">kandi abatware biwe bazoganzanya ubugororotsi.<verse eid="ISA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 32:2" />Umwumwe wese muri bo azomera nk’ahantu ho kwikinga umuyaga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">canke aho guhungira igihuhusi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:2">yongere abe nk’imbizi y’amazi mu bugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:2">canke nk’igitutu kiva ku gitandara kinini mu gihugu kigadutse.<verse eid="ISA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 32:3" />Maze amaso y’ababona ntazosubira guhumiriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:3">nayo amatwi y’abumva azokwumviriza.<verse eid="ISA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 32:4" />Imitima ihuha izogira ubwenge n’ugutahura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:4">n’indimi z’abagigimiza zizovuga zirongorotse.<verse eid="ISA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 32:5" />Abantu b’ibipfu ntibazoba bacitwa intwari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:5">n’indyarya ntizizohabwa icubahiro.<verse eid="ISA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 32:6" />Kuko ibipfu bivuga ivy’ubupfu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">imitima yavyo yagondamiye ku bibi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">Bagendera mu kutubaha Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">bagakwiragiza ibinyoma k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:6">bima indya uwushonje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:6">uwunyotewe bakamwima amazi.<verse eid="ISA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 32:7" />Inzira z’indyadya ziragoramanze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:7">barementaniriza ibinyoma umukene</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:7">kugira ngo bamuranduze ibinyoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:7">naho umukene yoba avuga ibitunganye.<verse eid="ISA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 32:8" />Ariko inyankamugayo zigira imigabo myiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:8">kandi mu bikorwa vyabo vy’inyankamugayo barashikama.<verse eid="ISA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abagore b’i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 32:9" />Mwa bagore mwe mwidibamiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:9">nimuve hasi munyumvirize,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:9">namwe bakobwa mwumva mutekaniwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:9">nimwumve ivyo mvuga,<verse eid="ISA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 32:10" />Mu gihe kirenga gatoya umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:10">mwebwe mwumva ko mukingiwe muzojugumira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:10">Inzabibu zanyu ntizizokwama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:10">iyimbura ryazo ntirizokwigera ribaho.<verse eid="ISA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 32:11" />Nimuhinde agashitsi, yemwe bagore mwidibamiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:11">muhagarike imitima namwe bakobwa mwumva mutekaniwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:11">Nimwambure imyambaro yanyu nziza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:11">mukenyere amagunira.<verse eid="ISA 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 32:12" />Nimwikubite mu gikiriza, ku bw’imirima mwakunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:12">n’inzabibu zahora zama cane,<verse eid="ISA 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 32:13" />mubabazwe n’igihugu c’abantu banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:13">camezemwo amahwa n’imikere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:13">Muborogere amazu meza ahimbaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:13">hamwe n’ibisagara vy’umunezero.<verse eid="ISA 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 32:14" />Kuko ikirimba c’umwami n’igisagara bizotabwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:14">igisagara cuzuyemwo urwamo gihebwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 32:14">Ahari agasozi n’umunara w’inderetsi hazotabwa ibihe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:14">hahinduke ikirimbiro ry’indogoba n’uburagiro bw’ibitungwa,<verse eid="ISA 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 32:15" />gushika aho Mpwemu azodusukwako avuye mw’ijuru.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:15">Ni ho ubugaragwa buzocika isi imera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:15">umurima umera na wo ukamera nk’ishamba.<verse eid="ISA 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 32:16" />Ubutungane bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buzoba mu bugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:16">ubugororotsi na bwo bube kw’isi imera.<verse eid="ISA 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 32:17" />Inkurikizi y’ubwo bugororotsi izoba amahoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:17">bizotuma haba ugutekana n’ukwizerana ibihe vyose.<verse eid="ISA 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 32:18" />Abantu banje bazoba ahantu hari amahoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:18">mu mazu y’umutekano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:18">aho ata kizobakokoma baruhutse.<verse eid="ISA 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 32:19" />Naho urubura rwohonya ishamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:19">igisagara kigasenyukira hasi cose,<verse eid="ISA 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 32:20" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azohezagira ubwoko bwiwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:20">Bazobiba bimbure umusesekara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 32:20">ibitungwa vyanyu bizorisha ahatotahaye.<verse eid="ISA 32:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="ISA 33" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyago no gutabarwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 33:1" />Uzobona ibara yewe wa muranduzi we,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">wewe utarigera urandurwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">Uzobona ibara yewe muryarukanyi we,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">wewe utarigera uryarukwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">Niwamara kurandura abandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">nawe uzorandurwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:1">kandi niwamara guheza guhemukira abandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:1">nawe uzohemukirwa.<verse eid="ISA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 33:2" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, tugirire ubuntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:2">ni wewe twamye twiteze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:2">Utubere inkomezi uko bukeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:2">utubere n’agakiza mu bihe vy’amagorwa.<verse eid="ISA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 33:3" />Iyo abansi bumvise ugukankama kwawe, bose barahunga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:3">kandi iyo uhagurutse, amahanga arashwiragira.<verse eid="ISA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 33:4" />Uwabanyaga, yemwe mahanga, abaye nk’umurima uciwemwo n’inzige,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:4">nk’uko ikigwi c’inzige cona ni ko ivyabo bizonyagwa.<verse eid="ISA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 33:5" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari hejuru ya vyose, ari mw’ijuru.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:5">Azokwuzuza Siyoni ubutungane n’ukugororoka vyiwe.<verse eid="ISA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 33:6" />Ico gihe azobabara urufatiro rw’ukuri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:6">ububiko bw’ubutunzi bw’agakiza, ubwenge n’ubumenyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:6">ukwubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni rwo rupfunguruzo rw’ubwo butunzi.<verse eid="ISA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 33:7" />Ehe raba intwari zabo zizoborogera mw’ibarabara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:7">n’intumwa zabo z’amahoro zirirane umubabaro.<verse eid="ISA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 33:8" />Amabarabara manini aragaragara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">nta ngenzi zikiyacamwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:8">Amasezerano y’amahoro bagize bayarenzeko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">basuzuguye abayashingira intahe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:8">nta muntu n’umwe bubaha.<verse eid="ISA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 33:9" />Ehe raba igihugu kiragandaye kandi kiragadutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:9">Libani hatewe n’isoni kandi harakabiranye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:9">Sharoni habaye nko muri Araba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:9">Bashani na Karumeli hahunguruye amababi yaho.<verse eid="ISA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 33:10" />“Ubu rero ngira mpaguruke,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:10">“ubu rero nzoshirwa hejuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:10">ubu rero nzokwerekana ubukuru n’ubushobozi vyanje.<verse eid="ISA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 33:11" />Mutwara inda y’umuguruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:11">mukavyara ibishingwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:11">impwemu zanyu ni zo zihinduka umuriro ubatongora.<verse eid="ISA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 33:12" />Amahanga azoturirwa gushika abe umunyota;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:12">nka kurya amahwa atemwa agatererwa mu muriro.”<verse eid="ISA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 33:13" />Yemwe abari kure, nimwumve ivyo nakoze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:13">namwe abari hafi, mwemere ko ndi umunyenkomezi!<verse eid="ISA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 33:14" />Abanyavyaha b’i Siyoni batewe n’ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">ukujugumira guteye abatubaha Imana:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:14">“Ni nde muri twebwe yoshobora kubana n’uwo muriro utongora?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:14">Ni nde muri twebwe yoshobora kubana n’ugutongora kw’ibihe vyose?”<verse eid="ISA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 33:15" />Nibagendera mu kugororoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">bakavuga ukuri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:15">bagata kure ubugunge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">bakarinda amaboko yabo kwakira ibiturire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:15">bakazibira amatwi yabo ntiyumve inama z’abicanyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:15">bagahumiriza amaso yabo bakayabuza gukwegwa n’ibibi.<verse eid="ISA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 33:16" />Abo ni bo bazoba ahataramutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:16">bikingirije umusozi nk’igihome.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:16">Bazohabwa umutsima wo kurya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:16">kandi ntibazobura amazi yo kunywa.<verse eid="ISA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 33:17" />Amaso yanyu azobona umwami mu bwiza bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:17">abone n’igihugu ciwe ciramvuye gushika kure.<verse eid="ISA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 33:18" />Ni ho muzokwibaza ku bihe vyari biteye ubwoba vyaheze muti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:18">“Mbega wa mukuru yaganza ingabo ari hehe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:18">Umwe yadutoza ikori we yaroye he?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:18">Wa mukuru akomeye mu ngabo yari ajejwe iminara ari he?”<verse eid="ISA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 33:19" />Ntimuzosubira kubona na rimwe abo bantu bari buzuye ubwibone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:19">bavuga imvugo itumvikana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:19">mu rurimi rw’abanyamahanga mudatahura.<verse eid="ISA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 33:20" />Nimurabe i Siyoni, umugwa wakorerwamwo imisi mikuru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">amaso yanyu azobona Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">hameze nk’uburuhukiro bw’amahoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">ihema ritazokwigera rishingurwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:20">imambo zaryo ntizizokwigera zishingurwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:20">nta n’umugozi waryo n’umwe uzocika.<verse eid="ISA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 33:21" />Ni ho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azotubera Umunyenkomezi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">Hazoba ari ahantu h’inzuzi nini n’imigezi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:21">Nta bwato busozwa buzozicamwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:21">nta n’amato akomeye azohaca.<verse eid="ISA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 33:22" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we mucamaza wacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:22">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we atanga amategeko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:22">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we Mwami wacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:22">kandi ni we azodukiza.<verse eid="ISA 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 33:23" />Imigozi yawe ifata amato iradohotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">ntiboshe neza ku giti c’igitambara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">igitambara na co ntikibamvye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 33:23">Hanyuma ivy’agaciro vyanyazwe bizogaburwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:23">mbere n’abacumbagira bazogira ivyo banyaze.<verse eid="ISA 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 33:24" />Mu baba i Siyoni nta wuzovuga ati: “Ndagwaye”;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 33:24">kandi ivyaha vy’abahaba vyose bizoharirwa.<verse eid="ISA 33:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="ISA 34" />
  <para style="s1">Urubanza ku mahanga</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 34:1" />Yemwe mwa mahanga mwe, nimwegere mwumvirize;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:1">nimutege amatwi mwa bantu mwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:1">Isi n’ibiri muri yo vyose nivyumve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:1">isi yose n’ibiyivamwo vyose.<verse eid="ISA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 34:2" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arakiye amahanga yose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:2">uburake bwiwe buri ku ngabo z’ayo mahanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:2">Azobatikiza abaherengeteze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:2">azobarekurira ku babasogota.<verse eid="ISA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 34:3" />Imivyimba yabo izokwandagara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:3">umunuko w’ibiziga uzokwira igihugu cose;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:3">imisozi izotemba amaraso yabo.<verse eid="ISA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 34:4" />Inyenyeri zizozima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">ijuru ryizinge nk’umuzingo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:4">Ivyaka vyo mu kirere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">bizokoragurika nk’amababi y’umuzabibu yumye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:4">canke nk’insukoni zihunguruka ziva ku giti.<verse eid="ISA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 34:5" />Inkota yanje imaze kunywa ikaborerwa mu majuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:5">izoshunguruka igwe kuri Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:5">ubwoko naciriye urwo kuranduka.<verse eid="ISA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 34:6" />Inkota y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yoze mu maraso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">yuzuye ibinure:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:6">amaraso y’intama n’impene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">hamwe n’ibinure vyo mu mafyigo y’amapfizi y’intama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:6">Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatanze ibimazi i Bozira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:6">akongera akica benshi muri Edomu.<verse eid="ISA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 34:7" />Imbogo zitembana na bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:7">hamwe n’ibimasa n’amapfizi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:7">Igihugu cabo kizoborerwa amaraso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:7">umukungugu waho na wo umirwe n’ibinure.<verse eid="ISA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 34:8" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> afise umusi w’ukwihora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:8">n’umwaka wo kwishuza, ivyo Siyoni hakorewe.<verse eid="ISA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 34:9" />Imigezi ya Edomu izohinduka nk’ikaburimbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:9">umukungugu waho uhinduke nk’ibizuku vyaka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:9">Igihugu cose kizoba nk’ikaburimbi yaka!<verse eid="ISA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 34:10" />Kizokwaka ku murango no mw’ijoro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:10">umwotsi waco uzopfunduka ibihe vyose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:10">Igihugu kizocika ubugaragwa imyaka n’iyindi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:10">nta n’uwuzosubira kugicamwo.<verse eid="ISA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 34:11" />Ibihuna n’ibigendabunyovu ni vyo bizohiganzira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">Ibihuna bininibinini n’ibikona ni vyo bizoharika.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:11">Imana izopimisha Edomu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">umugozi w’imivurungano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:11">na karisho ari ko gatikizo.<verse eid="ISA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 34:12" />Abubahwa baho ntibazoba bacitwa ko bafise ubwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:12">abaganwa baho bazoba bacitse ubusa.<verse eid="ISA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 34:13" />Ibirimba vyaho bizomeramwo ivyatsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:13">inzitiro zaho zimereko ibisuru n’ibitovu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:13">Hazohinduka ihuriro ry’imbwebwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:13">aho ibisiga vyitwa imbuni vyibera.<verse eid="ISA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 34:14" />Inyamaswa zo mu bugaragwa zizohahurira n’imfyisi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">n’impene zo mw’ishamba zizohagira ihuriro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:14">Ibihuna bizoja kuharuhukira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:14">biharonke inzu zo kwiberamwo.<verse eid="ISA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 34:15" />Aho ni ho ibihuna bizokwarika bihate amagi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:15">bibundikire amagi avemwo imiswi, hanyuma biyiteho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:15">ico gihe izoba iri mu gitutu c’amababa yavyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:15">Aho kandi ni ho ibinyakabaka bizokoranira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:15">kimwekimwe na kigenzi caco.<verse eid="ISA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 34:16" />Nimusesangure mu gitabu c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, musome ivyanditsemwo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:16">Nta na kimwe muri ivyo bikoko n’ivyo bisiga kizohara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">nta na kimwe kizobura kigenzi caco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:16">kuko akanwa k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari ko kabitegetse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:16">Mpwemu wiwe na we akaba ari we avyegeranya.<verse eid="ISA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 34:17" />Yakoresheje ubupfindo mu kugena ah’umwe wese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:17">ukuboko kwiwe kuhabagaburira ku rugero.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 34:17">Bazohegukira ibihe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 34:17">uko urunganwe ruzogenda rukurikirana n’urundi.<verse eid="ISA 34:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="ISA 35" />
  <para style="s1">Umunezero w’abacunguwe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 35:1" />Ubugaragwa n’isi igadutse bizonezerwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:1">inyovu yumye inezerwe kandi ishurike</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:1">nk’amashurwe yitwa narasisi. <verse eid="ISA 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 35:2" />Hazokwuzura amashurwe menshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">higinagure n’indirimbo z’umunezero.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">Hazohabwa ubwiza bw’i Libani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">hahabwe n’igikundiro c’i Karumeli n’i Sharoni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:2">Abaho bose bazobona ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:2">n’ubukuru bw’Imana yacu.<verse eid="ISA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 35:3" />Nimukomeze amaboko adendebukiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:3">mukomeze n’amavi areganutse,<verse eid="ISA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 35:4" />mubwire abafise imitima yuzuye ubwoba muti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:4">“Nimukomere, ntimutinye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">Imana yanyu iraje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:4">izanywe no kubahora;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:4">ije ifise ingero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:4">izanywe no kubakiza.”<verse eid="ISA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 35:5" />Maze amaso y’impumyi azohumuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:5">amatwi y’ibipfamatwi yuguruke.<verse eid="ISA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 35:6" />Ibimuga bizosimba nk’ingeregere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:6">indimi z’ibiragi ziririmbe indirimbo z’umunezero.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:6">Amasoko y’amazi azodudubiza mu bugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:6">n’inzuzi zizosendanisha ahagadutse.<verse eid="ISA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 35:7" />Ahari umusenyi uturira hazohinduka ikidengeri c’amazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:7">n’isi igadutse izodudubiza amazi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:7">Ahahora ari ihuriro n’ubwihisho bw’imfyisi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:7">hazomera ubwatsi butotahaye, amarenga hamwe n’urufunzo.<verse eid="ISA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 35:8" />Hazobayo ibarabara ryagutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">rizokwitwa Inzira y’Ukwera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">izoba iy’abagendera mu nzira z’Imana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:8">Abahumanye ntibazoyicamwo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:8">ibipfu ntibizoyihonyoramwo.<verse eid="ISA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 35:9" />Nta ntare zizoyicamwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:9">eka nta n’ikindi gikoko kiryana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:9">kizoharangwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:9">Abacunguwe bonyene ni bo bazoyicamwo.<verse eid="ISA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 35:10" />Abacunguwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bazogaruka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">bazokwinjira i Siyoni baririmba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">umunezero udashira ni wo uzoba urugori ku mitwe yabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 35:10">Akamwemwe n’umunezero bizobuzura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 35:10">kandi umubabaro no gusuhuza umutima bizohunga.<verse eid="ISA 35:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="ISA 36" />
  <para style="s1">Senakeribu atera ubwoba Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 36:1" />Mu mwaka ugira icumi na kane umwami Hezekiya ari ku ngoma, Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri atera ibisagara bizitijwe inzitiro z’amabuye vyose vy’i Buyuda, arabifata. <verse eid="ISA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 36:2" />Maze umwami w’i Ashuri arungika umukuru w’ikambi n’ingabo nyinshi cane, bava i Lakishi baja i Yerusalemu aho umwami Hezekiya yari ari. Maze uwo mukuru ageze ku mugende utwara amazi mu rugomero rwo haruguru, kw’ibarabara rija kw’Itongo ry’Umumesuzi, ahagararaho. <verse eid="ISA 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 36:3" />Eliyakimu mwene Hilukiya umukuru w’ikirimba, na Shebuna umunyamabanga w’umwami, na Yowa mwene Asafu umwanditsi, baba ari bo baja guhura na we.<verse eid="ISA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 36:4" />Maze umukuru w’ingabo za Ashuri ababwira ati: “Mubwire Hezekiya muti:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="ISA 36:4">‘Umwami ahambaye, ari we mwami w’i Ashuri avuze ngo: Mbega wishimirije iki? <verse eid="ISA 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 36:5" />Uvuga ngo ufise ubuhinga bwo kugwana ukagira n’ingabo nyinshi; ariko ivyo ni amajambo gusa ata co amaze. Mbe wishimirije nde yotuma ungarariza? <verse eid="ISA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 36:6" />Mbega wishimiye Egiputa? Rirya renga rivunitse ricumita mu kiganza uwo wese aryishimikije! Uko ni ko Farawo umwami wa Egiputa ameze ku bamwizigira bose. <verse eid="ISA 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 36:7" />Niwaba na ho ugira uti: “Twishimikije <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu,” mbega si wewe nyene Hezekiya wayisamburiye ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo vyo ku misozi hamwe n’ibicaniro, ukabwira Ubuyuda na Yerusalemu uti: “Muzohora musengera imbere y’iki gicaniro honyene”?<verse eid="ISA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 36:8" />None rero, ingo muhige na databuja, umwami w’i Ashuri. Nanje ndaguha amafarasi ibihumbi bibiri, nimba unafise abashobora kuyagenderako! <verse eid="ISA 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 36:9" />Mbega none wewe, woshobora gute kwirukana intwazangabo naho yoba ari imwe yo mu ngabo za databuja zo hanyuma y’izindi, naho wozanana n’imikogote n’abagwanira ku mafarasi b’Abanyegiputa? <verse eid="ISA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 36:10" />Turetse n’ivyo, mbe wibaza ko twaje gutera no gusambura iki gihugu, ata co <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatubwiye? <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ubwiwe ni we yambwiye kuza gutera iki gihugu no kugisangangura.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 36:11" />Maze Eliyakimu, Shebuna na Yowa babwira uwo mukuru bati: “Turakwinginze twebwe abasavyi bawe utubwire mu Carameya, kuko tucumva. Ntubandanye uvuga mu Giheburayo abantu bose bari ku ruzitiro bavyumva.”<verse eid="ISA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 36:12" />Ariko uwo mukuru w’ingabo abishura ati: “Mbega mwibaza ko databuja yarungikiye ubutumwa shobuja wenyene? N’abo bari ku ruzitiro nibavyumve kuko nimutishikana, tuzobugariza mwicwe n’inzara n’inyota gushika aho murya umwanda mukuru wanyu, munywe n’umwanda mutoya wanyu.”<verse eid="ISA 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 36:13" />Maze uwo mukuru w’ingabo arahaguruka avuga n’ijwi rirenga mu Giheburayo ati: “Nimwumve amajambo y’umwami ahambaye, ari we mwami w’i Ashuri! <verse eid="ISA 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 36:14" />Avuze ngo: Ntimwemere ko Hezekiya abahenda. Ntashobora kubakiza na gatoya. <verse eid="ISA 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 36:15" />Ntahave abahenda ngo mwizere <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ababwira ngo: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azodukiza, ntazokwemera ko iki gisagara kigwa mu maboko y’umwami w’i Ashuri.’<verse eid="ISA 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 36:16" />Ntimwumvirize Hezekiya. Ibi ni vyo umwami w’i Ashuri abamenyesheje: Nimurondere amahoro mu kwishikana iwanje. Ni ho umwe wese muri mwebwe azorya ku nzabibu no ku nsukoni ziwe, akanywa no ku mazi y’iriba ryiwe, <verse eid="ISA 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 36:17" />gushika aho nzobatwarira mu gihugu kimeze nk’iki c’iwanyu, igihugu kirimwo ingano n’umuvinyu mushasha, igihugu cuzuye indya n’imizabibu.<verse eid="ISA 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 36:18" />Ntimwemere ko Hezekiya abazimiza, niyababwira ati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoturokora.’ Mbega hari imana z’ihanga na rimwe zigeze zirokora igihugu cazo mu kuboko kw’umwami w’i Ashuri? <verse eid="ISA 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 36:19" />Mbega imana z’i Hamati n’i Arupadi ziri hehe? Iz’i Sefaruvayimu ziri hehe? Mbega zarakijije Samariya mu maboko yanje? <verse eid="ISA 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 36:20" />Mbega mu mana zose z’ivyo bihugu, ni izihe zashoboye kubikiza ukuboko kwanje? None <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we yokiza Yerusalemu mu maboko yanje?”<verse eid="ISA 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 36:21" />Ariko abari ngaho baguma banumye, ntihagira ico bishura, kuko umwami yari yabihanikirije ati: “Ntihagire na kimwe mumwishura.”<verse eid="ISA 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 36:22" />Maze Eliyakimu mwene Hilukiya uwari ajejwe ikirimba, na Shebuna umunyamabanga, hamwe na Yowa mwene Asafu umwanditsi, basubira kwa Hezekiya, bitaburiyeko impuzu, bamubwira ivyo wa mukuru w’ingabo yavuze vyose.<verse eid="ISA 36:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="ISA 37" />
  <para style="s1">Ugutabarwa kwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 37:1" />Umwami Hezekiya avyumvise yitaburirako impuzu, yambara amagunira, aja mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="ISA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 37:2" />Aca arungika Eliyakimu umukuru w’ikirimba, Shebuna umunyamabanga hamwe n’abaherezi bakurira abandi, baja kuraba umuvugishwa Yesaya mwene Amozi, kandi bose bagenda bambaye amagunira. <verse eid="ISA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 37:3" />Baramubwira bati: “Umwami Hezekiya avuze ati: Uwu ni umusi w’amagorwa, ibihano n’ibiteterwe, tumeze nka kurya umwana ageze kuvuka ariko nyina akabura inkomezi zo kumuvyara. <verse eid="ISA 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 37:4" />Kumbure <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe yokwumva amajambo y’uwo mukuru w’ingabo, ayo yarungikanywe na shebuja umwami w’i Ashuri, yo gucokora Imana nzima; maze Uhoraho Imana yawe akabimuhanira. None rero udusengere twebwe abagisigaye.”<verse eid="ISA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 37:5" />Abatware b’umwami Hezekiya baja kwa Yesaya, <verse eid="ISA 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 37:6" />na we aca ababwira ati: “Gende mubwire shobuja muti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Ntimugire ubwoba kubera ivyo mwumvise, ari yo majambo yo kuntuka y’umwami w’i Ashuri. <verse eid="ISA 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 37:7" />Umviriza! Ngiye kumushiramwo impwemu izotuma yumva inkuru z’ibihuha, azoca afata ingingo yo gusubira mu gihugu ciwe, aho nzotuma yicwa n’inkota.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 37:8" />Wa mukuru w’ingabo yumvise ko umwami w’i Ashuri yavuye i Lakishi, aca ahamagara ingabo ziwe baja kuraba umwami, basanga ariko agwanira i Libuna.<verse eid="ISA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 37:9" />Ico gihe nyene Senakeribu aca aronka inkuru zimubwira ko Tiruhaka umwami wa Etiyopiya azananye n’ingabo ziwe baje kumutera. Imbere yo gusubira inyuma, asigira ubutumwa Hezekiya, avuga ati: <verse eid="ISA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 37:10" />“Mubwire Hezekiya umwami w’i Buyuda muti: Iyo Mana wishimiye ntiguhende ngo izobuza ko Yerusalemu hafatwa n’umwami w’i Ashuri. <verse eid="ISA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 37:11" />Ndazi ko wumvise ivyo abami b’i Ashuri bakoreye ayandi mahanga, ingene babaranduye bakabamara. None wibaza ko wewe uzorokoka? <verse eid="ISA 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 37:12" />Mbega imana z’ayo mahanga yatikijwe na ba sogokuruza zarayakingiye? Za mana za Gozani, Harani, Rezefu n’abantu bo muri Edeni baba i Teli Asari, zarashoboye kubakiza? <verse eid="ISA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 37:13" />Mbega umwami w’i Hamati ari hehe canke umwami w’i Arupadi? Abami b’ibisagara vya Sefaruvayimu, Hena na Iwa bari hehe?”<verse eid="ISA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hezekiya yambaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 37:14" />Maze Hezekiya yakira ikete ahawe n’intumwa ararisoma, aca aduga mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, arizingururira imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="ISA 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 37:15" />Asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuga ati: <verse eid="ISA 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 37:16" />“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, Mana ya Isirayeli, wewe wicaye ku ntebe y’inganji hagati y’abakerubi, ni wewe Mana wenyene mu bwami bwose bwo kw’isi. Ni wewe waremye ijuru n’isi. <verse eid="ISA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 37:17" />Tega ugutwi Mana yanje, wumve. Utereze inyonga zawe urabe, ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; wumve amajambo Senakeribu yarungitse yo gucokora Imana nzima.<verse eid="ISA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 37:18" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> we, ni ivy’ukuri ko abami b’i Ashuri batikije ayo moko yose n’ibihugu vyayo. <verse eid="ISA 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 37:19" />Bataye imana zabo mu muriro barazitikiza, kuko zitari imana, vyari ibiti n’amabuye, vyakozwe n’amaboko y’abana b’abantu. <verse eid="ISA 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 37:20" />None rero <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mana yacu, dukize udukure mu maboko yiwe, kugira ngo ubwami bwose bwo kw’isi buzomenye ko wewe wenyene, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ari wewe Mana.”<verse eid="ISA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesaya avugishwa ivyo gutabarwa kwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 37:21" />Yesaya mwene Amozi arungikira ubutumwa Hezekiya avuga ati: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli avuze: Numvise ugusenga kwawe ku vyerekeye Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri. <verse eid="ISA 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 37:22" />Aya ni yo majambo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amurungikiye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:22">Umukobwa w’i Siyoni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:22">aragukengereye kandi aragutwenze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:22">Umukobwa w’i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:22">akuzungurije umutwe akuraba ingene uhunga.<verse eid="ISA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 37:23" />Mbega wibaza ko uwo watutse ukongera ukamucokora ari nde?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">Ni nde warengeje urwamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:23">ukamurabisha amaso yawe y’agakengerwe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:23">Ni Uwera wa Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 37:24" />Watumye intumwa zawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">ziza kuntuka jewe Imana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Uravuga uti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">‘Naduganye imikogote yanje myinshi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">nshika hejuru ku misozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">ndetse nshika no kw’isonga rya Libani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Niciye amasederi asumvya ayandi uburebure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">n’ubujwari busumvya ubundi ubwiza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:24">Narahagendagenze nshika no mu bibanza vyaho vya kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:24">ngenzura n’amashamba yaho atotahaye cane.<verse eid="ISA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 37:25" />Nimvye amariba mu yandi mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">nywa n’amazi yaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:25">Mponyangisha ibirenge vyanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:25">inzuzi za Egiputa, gushika aho zikama.’<verse eid="ISA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 37:26" />Mbega ntiwari bwavyumve?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">Ivyo vyose ni jewe nagenye ko bizoba kuva kera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:26">Nabiteguye kera cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">none ubu ndabishikije,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:26">ntuma ufata ibisagara bifise inzitiro zikomeye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:26">ubihindura ibirundo vy’amabuye.<verse eid="ISA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 37:27" />Abantu bo muri vyo wabamaze amanyama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">bacika ivutu, baramaramara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">Bameze nk’ivyatsi vyo mu gahinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">nk’ubwatsi bukimera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:27">Bameze nk’utwatsi twimeza ku nzu hejuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:27">dukabirana tutarakura.<verse eid="ISA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 37:28" />Ariko ndakuzi neza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:28">ndazi aho uri, ndazi amaja n’amaza yawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:28">ndazi n’ingene wandakiye.<verse eid="ISA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 37:29" />None rero ko wandakiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">amajambo yawe atagira indero agashika mu matwi yanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">nzogutungira igera mu zuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:29">ndagushire umunyororo mu kanwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">ndagusubize inyuma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:29">uciye mu nzira wazananye.<verse eid="ISA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 37:30" />Yewe Hezekiya, iki ni co kimenyetso uhawe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:30">Uwu mwaka uzorya ivyimejeje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">umwaka ukurikira uzorya ibizonaga kuri vyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:30">Ariko ku mwaka ugira gatatu, uzobiba wimbure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:30">utere imizabibu, urye ku vyamwa vyayo.<verse eid="ISA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 37:31" />Nayo amasigarira y’abacitse kw’icumu yo mu muryango wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:31">azokwongera amere nk’igiti gishora imizi mu kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:31">maze hejuru amashami na yo akama ivyamwa.<verse eid="ISA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 37:32" />Kuko i Yerusalemu hazokwamuka amasigarira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:32">no ku musozi Siyoni have abacitse kw’icumu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:32">Ishaka ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:32">ni ryo rizoshitsa ivyo.<verse eid="ISA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 37:33" />Ku bw’ivyo, uku ni ko, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ku mwami w’i Ashuri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:33">Ntazokwinjira mu gisagara c’i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">canke ngo araseyo umwampi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 37:33">Ntazokwegera inzitiro yitwaje inkinzo yiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:33">canke ngo azubakeko ivyo kwuririrako ngo ahatere.<verse eid="ISA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 37:34" />Inzira yazananye ni yo izomusubiza inyuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:34">ntazokwinjira iki gisagara,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:34">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ISA 37:35" />“Nzogwanira iki gisagara ndakirokore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 37:35">ku bwanje no ku bw’umusavyi wanje Dawidi.”<verse eid="ISA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ISA 37:36" />Maze umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> araza, atera insago z’Abashuri, yica ingabo ibihumbi ijana na mirongo umunani na bitanu. Abantu bavyutse mu gitondo basanga imivyimba irambikanze ahantu hose. <verse eid="ISA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ISA 37:37" />Maze Senakeribu umwami w’i Ashuri aca asubira inyuma, aja kuba i Ninewe agumayo.<verse eid="ISA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ISA 37:38" />Umusi umwe, Senakeribu ari mu ngoro ya Nisuroki imana yiwe ariko arasenga, abahungu biwe Adurameleki na Sharezeri baraza bamwicisha inkota, bahungira mu gihugu c’i Ararati. Umuhungu wiwe Esaruhadoni aca amusubirira ku ngoma.<verse eid="ISA 37:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="ISA 38" />
  <para style="s1">Ingwara ya Hezekiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 38:1" />Muri iyo misi, Hezekiya aragwara, ashika ku mpfiro. Umuvugishwa Yesaya mwene Amozi aja kumuraba, amubwira ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ngo: ‘Tunganya ivyo mu rugo rwawe, kuko ugiye gupfa, ntuzokira.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 38:2" />Maze Hezekiya aca ahindukiriza amaso ku ruhome, asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, <verse eid="ISA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 38:3" />avuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> we, ibuka ingene nagendeye imbere yawe mu bwizigirwa nkagukorera nguhaye umutima wanje wose, ngakora ivyo ubona ko ari vyiza mu nyonga zawe.” Hezekiya ararira cane.<verse eid="ISA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 38:4" />Maze ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> riza kuri Yesaya, <verse eid="ISA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 38:5" />riti: “Genda ubwire Hezekiya uti: uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya sogokuruza Dawidi avuze: ‘Numvise ugusenga kwawe, kandi nabonye n’amarira yawe; ndakwongeye iyindi myaka cumi n’itanu yo kubaho. <verse eid="ISA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 38:6" />Kandi iki gisagara nzogikura mu maboko y’umwami w’i Ashuri. Iki gisagara nzokigwanira.<verse eid="ISA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 38:7" />Iki ni co kimenyetso cemeza ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoshitsa ivyo asezeranye: <verse eid="ISA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 38:8" />Nzosubiza inyuma amatambwe cumi; igitutu cazanywe n’izuba, mpereye ku ngazi ya Ahazi.’ ” Ca gitutu gisubira inyuma amatambwe cumi.<verse eid="ISA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 38:9" />Aya ni yo majambo Hezekiya, umwami w’i Buyuda yanditse, amaze gukira ingwara yari agwaye.<verse eid="ISA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 38:10" />Naravuze nti: “Nari ngeze hagati mu myaka y’ukubaho kwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:10">none ngiye kwinjira mu marembo y’urupfu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:10">Imyaka nari nsigaje kubaho ndayinyazwe.”<verse eid="ISA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 38:11" />Naravuze nti: “Sinzosubira kubona <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">nkiri kw’isi y’abazima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:11">sinzosubira kubonana n’abantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:11">canke ngo mbane n’ababa muri iyi si.<verse eid="ISA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 38:12" />Ubuzima bwanje bunkuweko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">nk’ihema ry’umwungere rigururwa n’umuyaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:12">Ubuzima bwanje ndabuzinze nk’uko umujishi azinga impuzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">agira acacurire ku kijishiro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:12">Imbere y’uko bwira, uzoba wancacuye.<verse eid="ISA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 38:13" />Narindiriye nihanganye gushika mu bucagucagu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">ariko uvunagura amagufa yanje yose nk’intare;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:13">imbere y’uko bwira, uzoba wandangije.<verse eid="ISA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 38:14" />Mvuza induru ingana n’iy’intamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">mboroga nk’inuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:14">Amaso yanje aruhishwa no kurangamiza mw’ijuru ndagutakira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:14">Ewe Mana, ntabara unkize.”<verse eid="ISA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 38:15" />Mvuge iki kindi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">Yavuganye nanje, kandi ni yo nyene yakoze ibi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:15">Nzogenda niyoroheje imyaka yanje yose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:15">ku bw’umubabaro uri mu mutima wanje.<verse eid="ISA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 38:16" />Ewe Mana, ibi ni vyo bibeshaho abantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:16">kandi impwemu yanje ni ho ironkera ubugingo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:16">Wansubije amagara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:16">unyemerera kubaho.<verse eid="ISA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 38:17" />Koko, vyari bibereye ko nca muri iyo mibabaro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">Mu rukundo rwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">ntiwemeye ko nja mu rwobo rwo kurandurwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:17">ivyaha vyanje vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:17">wabisize inyuma yawe.<verse eid="ISA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 38:18" />Kuko abari mu mva badashobora kugutazira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:18">kandi abapfuye badashobora kukuririmbira ishimwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:18">abamanuka epfo i kuzimu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:18">ntibaba bacizera ubwizigirwa bwawe.<verse eid="ISA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 38:19" />Abazima bonyene ni bo bashobora kugutazira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:19">nk’uko ndiko ndabikora uwu musi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:19">Abavyeyi biganira abana babo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:19">ivy’ubwizigirwa bwawe.<verse eid="ISA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 38:20" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni wewe uzonkiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:20">nanje nzokuririmbira ishimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 38:20">ngucurarangire inanga ibihe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 38:20">ndi mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="ISA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 38:21" />Yesaya yari yavuze ati: “Nimutegure akarobe kabumvye mu nsukoni, mugatembagaze ku kivyimba, aca akira.”<verse eid="ISA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 38:22" />Hezekiya abaza ati: “Ni ikihe kimenyetso cemeza ko nzosubira kuduga mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?”<verse eid="ISA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="ISA 39" />
  <para style="s1">Intumwa zavuye i Babiloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 39:1" />Muri ico gihe nyene, Merodaki-Baladani mwene Baladani, umwami w’i Babiloni, arungikira Hezekiya amakete yo kumusuhuza hamwe n’utuganuke, kuko yari yumvise ivyo kugwara no gukira kwiwe. <verse eid="ISA 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 39:2" />Hezekiya yakira neza abazanye ubwo butumwa, abereka mu nzu hose n’ivyari mu bubiko vyose: ifeza, inzahabu, ibimota neza, amavuta, abereka n’imyambaro y’intambara, hamwe n’ibindi vyose vyari mu bubiko bwiwe. Nta na kimwe cari ku kirimba canke mu bwami bwose ataberetse.<verse eid="ISA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 39:3" />Umuvugishwa Yesaya aragenda abaza umwami Hezekiya ati: “Abo bantu bakubwiye iki, kandi baje bava he?” Hezekiya amwishura ati: “Baje iwanje bavuye mu gihugu ca kure; baje bava i Babiloni.”<verse eid="ISA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 39:4" />Yesaya aramubaza ati: “Babonye iki ku kirimba iwawe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ISA 39:4">Hezekiya amwishura ati: “Babonye ibintu vyose biri mu ngoro yanje. Nta na kimwe c’ubutunzi bwanje ntaberetse.”<verse eid="ISA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 39:5" />Yesaya abwira Hezekiya ati: “Niwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose: <verse eid="ISA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 39:6" />Hazogera igihe aho ibiri muri iyi ngoro vyose, ivyo ba sogokuruza bawe begeranije gushika uwu musi, bizotwarwa i Babiloni. Nta na kimwe kizosigara, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="ISA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 39:7" />Kandi bamwe bo mu ruvyaro rwawe, abana bawe bwite, bazogukomokako, bazotwarwa, bagirwe inkone ku kirimba c’umwami w’i Babiloni.”<verse eid="ISA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 39:8" />Hezekiya amwishura ati: “Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uvuze ni ryiza.” Aho rero ni kubera yibwira mu mutima ati: “Kazima mu gihe nzoba nkiriho hazoba hari amahoro.”<verse eid="ISA 39:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="ISA 40" />
  <para style="s1">Guhumuriza ubwoko bw’Imana</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 40:1" />Nimuhumurize, nimuhumurize abantu banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:1">ni ko Imana yanyu ivuze.<verse eid="ISA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 40:2" />Nimuvuge ibihumuriza imitima y’ab’i Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">mubabwire ko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">imisi yaho y’imibabaro iheze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">ko ivyaha vyabo bihariwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:2">ko nabahaniye incuro zibiri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:2">ivyaha vyose bakoze.<verse eid="ISA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 40:3" />Hari ijwi ry’uwusemerera mu bugaragwa ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:3">“Nimutegurire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aho aca,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:3">mugorore inzira agenderamwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:3">mutegurire Imana yacu inzira yagutse.<verse eid="ISA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 40:4" />Imyonga yose izokwuzuzwa iringanire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">imisozi n’udutumba vyose bisenwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:4">n’inzira zisivye zizosiburwa, ziringanizwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:4">ahakirurutse hagirwe itaba.<verse eid="ISA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 40:5" />Ubwiza bw’Imana buzohishurwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:5">kandi abantu bose bazobubona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:5">Akanwa k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni ko kabivuze.”<verse eid="ISA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 40:6" />Ijwi riravuze riti: “Semerera.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">Nanje ndavuga nti: “Nsemerere mvuga iki?”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 40:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:6">“Semerera uvuge ko abantu bose bameze nk’ivyatsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:6">kandi ko ubwiza bwabo bumeze nk’amashurwe yo ku misozi.<verse eid="ISA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 40:7" />Ubwatsi buruma, amashurwe agakabirana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:7">iyo impwemu z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> zibiciyeko.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:7">Ukwo ni ko abantu bameze.<verse eid="ISA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 40:8" />Ivyatsi biruma, amashurwe agakabirana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:8">ariko ijambo ry’Imana rizokwama rihangamye ibihe vyose.”<verse eid="ISA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 40:9" />Wewe uzanye inkuru nziza kuri Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">duga ku musozi hejuru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Wewe uzanye inkuru nziza kuri Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">semerera n’ijwi rirenga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:9">Semerera ntutinye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">ubwire ibisagara vy’i Buyuda uti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:9">“Imana yawe iraje!”<verse eid="ISA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 40:10" />Ehe raba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji azananye ubushobozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">kandi azoganzisha ukuboko kwiwe kw’inkomezi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:10">Ehe aje azanye ingero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:10">kandi impera ziwe zimwitangiye imbere.<verse eid="ISA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 40:11" />Azoragira ibitungwa vyiwe nk’umwungere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">imyagazi azoyikikira mu maboko yiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:11">ayiyegereza ku mutima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:11">maze izonsa azoziyobora azengenga.<verse eid="ISA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 40:12" />Mbega ni nde yageze amazi yo mu biyaga?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">Ni nde yageze ubunini bw’ijuru n’intambwe z’intoke ziwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:12">Ni nde yegeranirije umukungugu wo kw’isi mu giseke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">canke agapima imisozi ku kiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:12">n’imitumba ku munzane?<verse eid="ISA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 40:13" />Ni nde yotahura ubwenge bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:13">akayibera umwigisha canke umujenama?<verse eid="ISA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 40:14" />Ni nde <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yagishije inama kugira ngo umuhe impanuro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">kandi ni nde yamwigishije inzira iroranye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:14">Ni nde yamwigishije ubwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:14">canke ngo amurongore mu nzira y’ugutahura?<verse eid="ISA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 40:15" />Imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, amahanga ameze nk’ima ry’amazi mu ndobo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">ameze nk’umukungugu ku munzane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:15">Agera izinga nk’aho ari umukungugu utumuka.<verse eid="ISA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 40:16" />Ibiti vy’i Libani ntibikwiye ku gicaniro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:16">n’ibikoko vyaho ntibikwiye ku kimazi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abereye.<verse eid="ISA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 40:17" />Imbere yiwe amahanga yose ni ubusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:17">nta co amaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:17">ni ubusa gusa.<verse eid="ISA 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 40:18" />None ni nde twogereranya n’Imana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:18">Ni ikihe kigereranyo twoyigereranya?<verse eid="ISA 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 40:19" />Mbega yogereranywa n’ivyakozwe n’amaboko y’abantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">bikomekwako inzahabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:19">bigasharizwa n’ifeza?<verse eid="ISA 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 40:20" />Umukene adashobora kuronka ishikanwa nk’iryo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:20">yironderera ikigegene c’igiti kitazobungwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:20">akarondera umubaji w’umuhinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:20">akamushingira igishushanyo kitazotemba.<verse eid="ISA 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 40:21" />Ntimwari mubizi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:21">Ntimwari bwavyumve?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:21">Ntimwabibwiwe kuva mu ntango?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:21">Ntimwari mwarabitahuye kuva isi itararemwa?<verse eid="ISA 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 40:22" />Imana ni yo yicaye ku ntebe y’ubwami hejuru y’umuzingi w’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">kandi ababa kw’isi baboneka nk’inzige.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:22">Amajuru iyasanza nk’igitambara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:22">ikayagira kurya kw’ihema ryo kubamwo.<verse eid="ISA 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 40:23" />Abaganwa bo mw’isi ibahindura ubusa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:23">abatwara iyi si ikabahindura abatagira ico bamaze.<verse eid="ISA 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 40:24" />Baba bakigenwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">batarafata ivyicaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">batarashinga imizi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:24">igaca abahuha impwemu bagakabirana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:24">hanyuma umuyaga w’agashururu ukabagurura nk’umuguruka.<verse eid="ISA 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 40:25" />“Mbega ni nde mwongereranya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:25">Ni nde angana nanje?” ni ko Uwera abaza.<verse eid="ISA 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 40:26" />Unamura amaso murabe kw’ijuru:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">ni nde yaremye ivyo mubona vyose?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">Ni we yashizeho inyenyeri zose, imwe ku yindi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">imwe yose ayihamagara mw’izina.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:26">Kubera ubushobozi bwiwe bwinshi n’inkomezi ziwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:26">nta n’imwe ibuzemwo.<verse eid="ISA 40:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 40:27" />Ni kuki widodomba, ewe Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">kandi ni kuki, ewe Isirayeli, uvuga uti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:27">“Inzira zanje zinyegejwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:27">Imana yirengagije urubanza rwanje”?<verse eid="ISA 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 40:28" />Ntimwari mubizi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">Ntimwari bwavyumve?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni Imana y’ibihe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">ni we muremyi w’isi iyo iva ikagera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:28">Ntazorambirwa canke ngo adendebukirwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:28">ubwenge bwiwe ntibutahurwa n’abantu.<verse eid="ISA 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 40:29" />Ni we yongera inkomezi abacitse intege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:29">akongerereza inguvu abanyantegenke.<verse eid="ISA 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 40:30" />Mbere n’imisore iracika intege ikaruha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:30">abakiri bato baradandabagirana bagatemba,<verse eid="ISA 40:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 40:31" />ariko abizigiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">bazokwama bongerwa inkomezi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 40:31">Bazoguruka mu kirere nk’abagurukisha amababa y’inkona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">bazokwiruka ntibaruhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 40:31">bazogenda ntibacike intege.<verse eid="ISA 40:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="ISA 41" />
  <para style="s1">Umufasha wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 41:1" />“Nimucereze imbere yanje, mwa mazinga mwe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">Amahanga niyongerwe inkomezi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:1">Muyareke aze imbere avuge!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:1">Naze duhurire imbere y’intahe.<verse eid="ISA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 41:2" />Ni nde yahagurukije uwo ava mu buseruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">akamuhamagaza ubugororotsi ngo aze ku gikorwa ciwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Amuhereza amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">kandi abami abacishije bugufi imbere yiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:2">Bose abahinduje umukungugu inkota yiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:2">umuheto wiwe ubagize ibishingwe bigururwa n’umuyaga.<verse eid="ISA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 41:3" />Arabakinagiza, akabacamwo ntagire ico aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:3">agaca mu nzira ibirenge vyiwe bitigeze bicamwo na rimwe.<verse eid="ISA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 41:4" />Ni nde yabikoze kandi akabishitsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">mu guhamagara urunganwe uhereye mu ntango?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:4">Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:4">uwa mbere n’uwa nyuma. Ni jewe.”<verse eid="ISA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 41:5" />Amazinga yarabibonye aratinya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:5">impera z’isi zihinda agashitsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:5">Abo ku mpera z’isi baraza begera hafi,<verse eid="ISA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 41:6" />baterana intege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:6">umwe wese abwira mugenziwe ati: “Komera!”<verse eid="ISA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 41:7" />Uwucura ivyuma atera intege uwucura inzahabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">uwusena akoresheje inyundo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">agatera intege uwuri kw’ihondero.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:7">Bakavuga bati: “Ni igikorwa ciza cane.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">Bagaheza bagafatisha imisumari ca kigirwamana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:7">kugira ngo ntikinyiganyige.<verse eid="ISA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 41:8" />“Ariko wewe Isirayeli, umusavyi wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:8">Yakobo, uwo natoranije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:8">yemwe ruvyaro rwa Aburahamu, umukunzi wanje,<verse eid="ISA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 41:9" />nabazanye ndabakuye ku mpera z’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">ndabahamagara ndabakuye mu mfuruka zayo za kure.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:9">Naravuze nti: ‘Uri umusavyi wanje’;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:9">naragutoranije kandi sinagutaye.<verse eid="ISA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 41:10" />Nuko ntutinye kuko ndi kumwe nawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">ntuhagarike umutima, ndi Imana yawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:10">Nzogukomeza, nzogutabara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:10">nzokuzigamisha ukuboko kwanje kw’i buryo.<verse eid="ISA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 41:11" />Abakurakiye bose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:11">bazomaramara, bateterwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:11">abakugwanya na bo bazohinduka ubusa, ndetse bazohona.<verse eid="ISA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 41:12" />Naho worondera abo bakugwanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:12">nta bo uzobona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:12">Abagutera ngo bakugwanye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:12">bazohinduka ubusa.<verse eid="ISA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 41:13" />Kuko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:13">ni jewe ngufashe ukuboko kw’i buryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:13">nkakubwira nti: Ntutinye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:13">nzogutabara.<verse eid="ISA 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 41:14" />Ntutinye, ewe Yakobo, wa musiba we,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">hanga ritoya rya Isirayeli, ntuhagarike umutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:14">kuko jewe ubwanje nzogutabara,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:14">Umucunguzi wawe, Uwera wa Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 41:15" />“Ehe raba nzokugira igisekuzo gishasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">gifise amenyo menshi akarishe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:15">Uzosekura imisozi uyisavye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:15">imitumba uyihindure umukungugu.<verse eid="ISA 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 41:16" />Uzobagosora umuyaga na wo ubagurure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">agashururu kabashwiragize.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:16">Ariko uzonezerererwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:16">hamwe n’ubwiza bw’uwera wa Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 41:17" />Abakene n’aboro barondera amazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">ariko nta ho bayaronka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">indimi zabo zigatuwe n’inyota.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:17">Ariko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nzobishura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:17">jewe Imana ya Isirayeli, sinzobaheba.<verse eid="ISA 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 41:18" />Nzotembesha inzuzi ku misozi igadutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">ntobore amariba mu biyaya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:18">Ubugaragwa nzobuhindura ibidengeri vy’amazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:18">isi yumye na yo ndayihindure amasoko y’amazi.<verse eid="ISA 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 41:19" />Mu bugaragwa nzotera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:19">amasederi n’akasiya, imiriteli na elayo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:19">Nzomeza amapinusi kw’isi yahebwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:19">meze firu n’akajwari vyose hamwe,<verse eid="ISA 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 41:20" />kugira ngo abantu babone ivyo bitangaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">hanyuma batahure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:20">ko ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari kwo kwabikoze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:20">ko Uwera wa Isirayeli ari we yabiremye.”<verse eid="ISA 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 41:21" />“Nimushinge urubanza rwanyu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:21">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:21">“Nimuzane ibirego vyanyu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:21">ni ko Umwami wa Yakobo avuze.<verse eid="ISA 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 41:22" />“Nimutubwire, mwebwe bigirwamana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">mutubwire ibizoba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">Nimutubwire ibintu vya kera ingene vyari bimeze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">natwe tuvyiyumvireko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:22">tumenye n’iherezo ryavyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:22">Canke nimutubwire ibigira bibe,<verse eid="ISA 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 41:23" />tubwire ibiri muri kazoza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">kugira ngo noneho tumenye ko muri imana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:23">Gira ico mukoze, caba ciza canke caba kibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:23">kugira ngo tubitangarire, duhinde agashitsi.<verse eid="ISA 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 41:24" />Ariko si vyo, kuko muri hanyuma y’ubusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:24">n’ibikorwa vyanyu nta co bimaze.<verse eid="ISA 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 41:25" />Ariko hari uwo nahagurukije avuye mu buraruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">aje ava mu buseruko, yambaza izina ryanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:25">Azohonyanga abatware nk’uwuhonyanga ubudongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:25">canke nk’umubumvyi akata ibumba.<verse eid="ISA 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 41:26" />Ni nde yabivuze bikiri mu ntango, kugira ngo tubimenye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">Ni nde yabivuze bitaraba, kugira ngo tuvuge tuti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">‘Vya bintu vyari ivy’ukuri’?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 41:26">Nta n’umwe yigeze abivuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">nta n’uwabivuzeko imbere y’igihe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:26">nta n’uwigeze yumva ko ijambo rivuye kuri mwebwe.<verse eid="ISA 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 41:27" />Ni jewe nabwiye Siyoni ubwa mbere nti: ‘Ehe ng’abo.’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:27">Kandi ni jewe narungitse i Yerusalemu uwo kuhabwira inkuru nziza.<verse eid="ISA 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 41:28" />Nararavye muri mwebwe mbura n’umwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:28">nta na kimwe mu bigirwamana gishobora gutanga impanuro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:28">Nta na kimwe gishobora kumpa inyishu ndabibajije.<verse eid="ISA 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 41:29" />Raba vyose ni ibintu ata co bimaze.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:29">N’ibikorwa vyavyo ni ubusa gusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 41:29">ishusho yavyo ni umuyaga kandi ni ikiyoberane.<verse eid="ISA 41:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="ISA 42" />
  <para style="s1">Umukozi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 42:1" />Ng’uwu umukozi wanje, uwo nshigikiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">uwo natoranije nkamunezererwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:1">Namushizeko Mpwemu wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:1">na we azokwereka amahanga ivy’ubutungane.<verse eid="ISA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 42:2" />Ntazoyogora canke ngo avuze urwamo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:2">canke ngo yumvikanishe ijwi ryiwe mu mabarabara.<verse eid="ISA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 42:3" />Ntazohohosha irenga rivunitse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:3">kandi n’urumuri rwaka buhoro ntazoruzimya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:3">mu bwizigirwa, azoshitsa ubutungane mu bantu.<verse eid="ISA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 42:4" />Ntazocika intege kandi ntazodendebukirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:4">kugeza aho azoshikiriza ukugororoka kw’isi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:4">Mu nyigisho ziwe ni ho amazinga ya kure azoshira ivyizigiro.”<verse eid="ISA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 42:5" />Ng’ibi ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:5">uwaremye amajuru akayasanza hejuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">uwaguye isi n’ibiyimerako vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">agaha impwemu abantu bose bayibako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:5">n’ubuzima abayigenderako:<verse eid="ISA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 42:6" />“Jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni jewe nabahamagaye ngo mwerekane ubugororotsi bwanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">nzobafata ukuboko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:6">Nzokuzigama, nzotuma ubaho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">kugira ngo ubere isezerano abantu banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:6">n’umuco abanyamahanga,<verse eid="ISA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 42:7" />kugira ngo uhumure amaso y’umpumyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:7">ubohore imbohe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:7">ukure mu mwijima ababohewe mu mabohero.”<verse eid="ISA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 42:8" />“Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, iryo ni ryo zina ryanje!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:8">Icubahiro canje sinzogiha uwundi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:8">kandi amashimwe yanje sinzoyahebera ibigirwamana.<verse eid="ISA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 42:9" />Ehe raba ivya mbere birashitse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:9">n’ibishasha ndabibamenyesheje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:9">imbere y’uko bija ahabona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:9">ndabibabwiye.”<verse eid="ISA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Indirimbo yo guhimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 42:10" />Nimuririmbire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> indirimbo nsha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">mumuririmbire uhereye ku mpera z’isi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:10">Nimumuririmbire yemwe abagendera mu kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">namwe ibikibamwo mwese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:10">namwe mwa mazinga, n’abayabamwo mwese.<verse eid="ISA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 42:11" />Ubugaragwa n’ibisagara vyabwo nibiduze amajwi yavyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">n’aho Kedari aba hanezerwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:11">Ababa i Sela nibaririmbe indirimbo y’umunezero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:11">baririmbire ku mpinga z’imisozi!<verse eid="ISA 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 42:12" />Nibahe icubahiro <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:12">bamutazirire mu mazinga yabo.<verse eid="ISA 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 42:13" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azotabara nk’umunyenkomezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:13">agire ishaka nk’intwari ku rugamba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:13">azokwiha akamo k’intambara n’ijwi rirenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:13">kandi azonesha abansi biwe.<verse eid="ISA 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 42:14" />Azovuga ati: “Kuva kera naracereje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">naratekereje, ndiyumanganya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:14">Ariko ubu ho ndataka cane nk’umugore ari ku bise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:14">ndasemerera, ndaniha kandi ndahemagirika.<verse eid="ISA 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 42:15" />Nzorandura imisozi n’imitumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:15">ntume n’ibimera vyaho vyose vyuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:15">Inzuzi nini nzozihindura ahagadutse zibe nk’amazinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:15">ibidengeri na vyo ndabikamye.<verse eid="ISA 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 42:16" />Impumyi nzozirongora mu nzira zitigeze zimenya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">ndazicishe mu tuyira zitari zimenyereye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Mpindure imbere yabo umwijima ucike umuco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">kandi nzogorora inzira zabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:16">Ivyo ni vyo nzokora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:16">kandi sinzobaheba.<verse eid="ISA 42:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 42:17" />Ariko abishimira ibigirwamana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:17">bakabwira ibishushanyo bati: ‘Muri imana zacu,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:17">bazomaramara cane.<verse eid="ISA 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukutiga kwa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 42:18" />Nimwumve, yemwe bipfamatwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:18">namwe mwa mpumyi, nimurabe kandi mubone!<verse eid="ISA 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 42:19" />Hari iyindi mpumyi atari abantu banje, abasavyi banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">canke hari igipfamatwi kimeze nk’intumwa natumye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:19">Ni nde mpumyi ingana n’abo dufitaniye isezerano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:19">canke impumyi ingana n’umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?<verse eid="ISA 42:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 42:20" />Mwabonye vyinshi, ariko ntimwabishirako umutima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:20">amatwi yanyu yari yuguruye, ariko nta na kimwe mwumvise.”<verse eid="ISA 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 42:21" />Vyarahimbaye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:21">kubera ukugororoka kwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:21">ko atanga Ivyagezwe bihambaye kandi bitunganye.<verse eid="ISA 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 42:22" />Ariko ubu ni ubwoko bwasahuwe, buranyagwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">bose bafashwe n’imitego yo mu vyobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">banyegejwe mu mabohero.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">Bajanywe nk’inyagano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">habura n’umwe wo kubatabara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:22">baranyazwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:22">habura n’umwe yovuga ati: “Basubize iwabo.”<verse eid="ISA 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 42:23" />Ibi ni nde abitega amatwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:23">agashira umutima ku vya kazoza?<verse eid="ISA 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 42:24" />Ni nde yatanze aba Yakobo ngo batwarwe nk’abaja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">aba Isirayeli akabaha ababanyaga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">Mbega si <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">uwo twacumuyeko?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:24">Vyababayeko kuko batagendeye mu nzira ziwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:24">canke ngo bakurikize Ivyagezwe vyiwe.<verse eid="ISA 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 42:25" />Ni co catumye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abasukako uburake bwiwe bw’inkazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">n’intambara zikomeye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 42:25">Zibahindukira kuba imbeya, ariko ntibigeze batahura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 42:25">zirabatongora ariko ntibazishirako n’umutima.<verse eid="ISA 42:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="ISA 43" />
  <para style="s1">Umukiza wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 43:1" />Ariko noneho, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">Uwakuremye, ewe Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">akakubumba, yewe Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:1">aravuze ati: “Ntutinye kuko nakurokoye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:1">naguhamagaye mw’izina; uri uwanje.<verse eid="ISA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 43:2" />Niwaca mu mazi menshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">nzoba ndi kumwe nawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:2">niwaca mu nzuzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">ntizizokurengera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:2">Niwaca mu muriro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">ntuzosha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:2">imbeya ntizizogutongora.<verse eid="ISA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 43:3" />Kuko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">Uwera wa Isirayeli, Umukiza wawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:3">Natanze Egiputa nk’incungu yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:3">Etiyopiya na Seba ndahatanga mu gishingo cawe.<verse eid="ISA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 43:4" />Kuko uri uw’agaciro, ukaba umwubahwa mu nyonga zanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">kandi kubera ko nagukunze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:4">nzotanga abantu ku bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:4">n’amahanga ku bw’ubuzima bwawe.<verse eid="ISA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 43:5" />Ntutinye kuko ndi kumwe nawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:5">nzokoranya abana bawe ndabakuye mu buseruko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:5">ndabegeranye bavuye mu burengero.<verse eid="ISA 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 43:6" />Nzobwira uburaruko nti: ‘Barekure!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">Ubumanuko na bwo ndabubwire nti: ‘Ntubafate.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:6">Nzanira abahungu banje bavuye kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:6">n’abakobwa banje bavuye ku mpera z’isi;<verse eid="ISA 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 43:7" />munzanire uwo wese yitirirwa izina ryanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:7">uwo naremye mu bwiza bwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:7">uwo nibumbiye, nkamurema.”<verse eid="ISA 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 43:8" />Sohora abafise amaso ariko batabona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:8">bakagira amatwi ariko ntibumve.<verse eid="ISA 43:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 43:9" />Amahanga yose nakoranywe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">n’abantu bose bahurire hamwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Ni ikihe mu bigirwamana vyabo cari carabivuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">kikatumenyesha ivyabayeho?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:9">Nibazane ivyabona vyerekana ko bari mu kuri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:9">kugira ngo abandi nibavyumviriza bavuge bati: “Ni ivy’ukuri.”<verse eid="ISA 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 43:10" />“Ni mwebwe vyabona vyanje, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">mukaba n’abasavyi banje natoranije,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">kugira ngo mumenye mwongere munyizere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">mwongere mutahure ko ndi Imana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:10">Imbere yanje nta mana yigeze ibaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:10">kandi inyuma yanje nta yindi izohaba.<verse eid="ISA 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 43:11" />Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> jenyene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:11">kandi uretse jewe, nta wundi mukiza ariho.<verse eid="ISA 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 43:12" />Ni jewe nabahishuriye ivy’agakiza, ndabakiza ndongera ndabitangaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:12">ni jewe, si imana z’inyamahanga ziri muri mwebwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:12">Ni mwebwe vyabona vyanje ko ndi Imana,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 43:13" />“Uhereye ibihe vyose, ndi Imana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:13">Nta wushobora kunkura mu kuboko ico mfashe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:13">Ngize ico nkoze, ni nde yogihindura?”<verse eid="ISA 43:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imana igirira ubuntu Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 43:14" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">Umucunguzi wanyu, Uwera wa Isirayeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:14">“Ku bwanyu nzotuma intumwa i Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">Abanyababiloni bose ndabamanure ari impunzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:14">bahunge bakoresheje arya mato bishimira.<verse eid="ISA 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 43:15" />Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Uwera wanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:15">umuremyi wa Isirayeli, Umwami wanyu.”<verse eid="ISA 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 43:16" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:16">we yaciye inzira mu kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:16">agaca inzira mu mazi menshi,<verse eid="ISA 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 43:17" />agasohora imikogote n’amafarasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">ingabo n’abagwanyi b’abahizi bagakorana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:17">maze bakagwa hamwe, ntibongere kuvyuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:17">bakazima nk’uko urumuri ruzima:<verse eid="ISA 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 43:18" />“Nimwibagire ivyabaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:18">ntimwumire kuri kahise.<verse eid="ISA 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 43:19" />Ehe ngiye gukora ikintu gishasha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">Raba kimaze no kugaragara; mbega nta co mubona?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:19">Ngiye guca inzira mu bugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:19">ntembeshe inzuzi ahagadutse.<verse eid="ISA 43:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 43:20" />Ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba biranyubaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">imbwebwe n’ibihuna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">bizonyubaha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:20">kuko nzobiha amazi mu bugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:20">kugira ngo mpe abantu banje ico banywa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:20">abo natoranije,<verse eid="ISA 43:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 43:21" />abantu niremeye ubwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:21">kugira ngo bavuge ishimwe ryanje.<verse eid="ISA 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 43:22" />Ariko ntiwigeze umpamagara, yewe Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:22">ahubwo waranzinutswe, wewe Isirayeli!<verse eid="ISA 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 43:23" />Ntiwanshikaniye intama zawe nk’amashikanwa yo guturira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">canke ngo unyubahishe ibimazi vyawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:23">Sinakuremereje kunzanira amashikanwa y’ifu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:23">canke ngo nkurambire nkwaka ibimota neza iyo bituriwe.<verse eid="ISA 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 43:24" />Nta bimota neza wigeze unzanira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">canke ngo umpaze ibinure vy’ibimazi vyawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 43:24">Ariko wewe wandemereje ivyaha vyawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:24">umvunisha ibicumuro vyawe.<verse eid="ISA 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 43:25" />Ariko jewe nyene, ni jewe mpanagura ibicumuro vyawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:25">ku bw’izina ryanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:25">kandi sinzosubira kuvyibuka.<verse eid="ISA 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 43:26" />Nyibutsa ivya kera, maze tuburane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:26">Shinga urubanza rwawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:26">maze wiregure.<verse eid="ISA 43:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 43:27" />Umuvyeyi wawe wa mbere yakoze icaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:27">abarongozi bawe na bo barangararije.<verse eid="ISA 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 43:28" />Ni co gituma nanje nzotuma abaherezi bawe bakengerwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:28">Yakobo nkamurekurirako ukurandurwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 43:28">Isirayeli nkamuhindura ikimaramare.<verse eid="ISA 43:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="ISA 44" />
  <para style="s1">Isirayeli yatoranijwe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 44:1" />Ariko noneho niwumve yewe Yakobo umusavyi wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:1">Isirayeli, uwo natoranije.<verse eid="ISA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 44:2" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">uwakuremye, akakuremera mu nda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">akaba ari we azonagutabara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:2">ntutinye, yewe Yakobo, umukozi wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:2">Yeshuruni, uwo natoranije.<verse eid="ISA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 44:3" />Kuko nzosuka amazi kw’isi igadutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">ntembeshe imigende kw’isi yumye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:3">Nzosuka Mpwemu wanje ku ruvyaro rwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:3">n’umugisha ku bagukomokako.<verse eid="ISA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 44:4" />Bazokura nk’ubwatsi buvomererwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:4">nk’ibiti vy’imilebeni biri i ruhande y’umugezi.<verse eid="ISA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 44:5" />Umwe azovuga ati: ‘Jewe ndi uw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>’;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">uwundi na we azokwiyitirira izina rya Yakobo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:5">uwundi na we azokwandika mu kiganza ciwe ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">‘Ndi uw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>’;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:5">hanyuma yiyitirire izina rya Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu kibanza c’ibigirwamana</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 44:6" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">Umwami n’Umucunguzi wa Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:6">Ndi uwa mbere nkaba n’uwa nyuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:6">nta yindi Mana ibaho atari jewe.<verse eid="ISA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 44:7" />Ni nde wundi ahwanye nanje? Naze abimenyeshe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">Naze abivuge abishire imbere yanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:7">ambwire ivyabaye kuva nkirema abantu banje ba kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">avuge n’ibizoza.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:7">Ni koko naze avuge ibizoba.<verse eid="ISA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 44:8" />Ntimujugumire, ntimugire ubwoba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Sinari nabibabwiye, nkabibamenyesha kera bitaraba?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:8">Muri ivyabona vyanje. Nta yindi Mana ihari atari jewe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:8">Haba na mba, nta rundi Rutare; nta rundi nzi.”<verse eid="ISA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 44:9" />Abakora ibishushanyo bose nta co bamaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:9">n’ivyo baha agaciro vyose nta co bimaze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:9">Ababivugira bose ni impumyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:9">ni imburabwenge, bazoteterwa.<verse eid="ISA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 44:10" />Ababaza ibishushanyo canke bakabumba ibigirwamana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:10">bazobikuramwo iki?<verse eid="ISA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 44:11" />Ababikora n’ababifatanya na bo bazomaramara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:11">ababikora ni abantu buntu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:11">Bose nibakoranire hamwe, bahagarare;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:11">bazokwicwa n’ubwoba, isoni zibicire hamwe.<verse eid="ISA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 44:12" />Umucuzi afata ico acurisha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">akagishusha mu makara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:12">agahingura ikigirwamana akoresheje inyundo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">akagiha imero n’inkomezi z’amaboko yiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:12">Agasonza agaca acika intege,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:12">atanyoye amazi akaraba.<verse eid="ISA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 44:13" />Umubaji w’ibishushanyo apimisha umugozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">agashira ibimenyetso ku gishushanyo n’ikaramu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:13">akibazisha imbazo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">akagipima cose n’icuma gipima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:13">Akagishushanyamwo ishusho y’umuntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">mu bwiza bwiwe bwose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:13">maze akagishira mu kanyabugoro.<verse eid="ISA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 44:14" />Yicira isederi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:14">canke agahitamwo ikindi giti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:14">Arakireka kigakurira hagati y’ibindi biti vyo mw’ishamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:14">canke agatera pinusi, hanyuma imvura ikakimeza,<verse eid="ISA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 44:15" />mu nyuma kikazoba inkwi zo gucana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">umuntu akagikurako inkwi zo kwota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">canke izo gucumba umutsima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:15">Ariko agikoramwo n’igishushanyo akagisenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:15">akagikoramwo ikigirwamana akacikubita imbere.<verse eid="ISA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 44:16" />Igice kimwe caco agicanisha umuriro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:16">akagitekesha ivyokurya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:16">akacotsako inyama, akarya agahaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:16">Arongera akota, hanyuma akavuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:16">“Ahwi! Ndasusurutse, ndonse umucanwa.”<verse eid="ISA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 44:17" />Igisigaye akagikoramwo imana, ikigirwamana ciwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:17">akacunamira, akagisenga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:17">Akagisenga akibwira ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:17">“Ndokora; ni wewe mana yanje.”<verse eid="ISA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 44:18" />Nta co bazi, nta co batahura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:18">amaso yabo aratwikiriwe kugira ngo ntabone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:18">ubwenge bwabo buracuramye kugira ngo ntibutahure.<verse eid="ISA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 44:19" />Nta n’umwe yiyumvira, nta n’uwutahura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">ngo avuge ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:19">“Igice kimwe nagicanye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">nacumbiye ku makara yaco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">nongera notsa inyama ndazirya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:19">Mbega none igice gisigaye nogikoramwo imana?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:19">Mbega nokwunamira ikigegene c’igiti?”<verse eid="ISA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 44:20" />Uwo muntu arya umunyota, ayobejwe n’umutima wibesha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:20">Ntashobora kwikiza, canke ngo avuge ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:20">“Mbega burya iki mfise mu ntoke si ikinyoma?”<verse eid="ISA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 44:21" />“Niwibuke ivyo bintu, yewe Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:21">uvyibuke nawe Isirayeli umusavyi wanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:21">Ni jewe nakuremye, uri umusavyi wanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:21">yewe Isirayeli, sinzokwibagira.<verse eid="ISA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 44:22" />Neyuye ivyaha vyawe nk’uko igicu ceyuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:22">ivyaha vyawe ndabikuraho nk’igipfungu co mu gatondo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:22">Nimungarukeko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:22">kuko ni jewe nabacunguye.”<verse eid="ISA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 44:23" />Ririmbana umunezero mwa majuru mwe, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari we yakoze ibi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">Semerera wa kuzimu we.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">Nimuturagare muririmbe mwa mitumba mwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">namwe mashamba hamwe n’ibiti vyose biri muri mwebwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:23">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarokoye Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:23">akerekanira icubahiro ciwe muri Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalemu hasubira kuba abantu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 44:24" />“Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">Umucunguzi wawe, uwakubumbiye mu nda:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 44:24" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:24">Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">uwaremye ibintu vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">uwabamvye ijuru wenyene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:24">akagaranzura isi wenyene.<verse eid="ISA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 44:25" />Ni jewe mpinyuza ibimenyetso vy’abavugishwa b’ibinyoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">abapfumu nkabahindura ubusa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:25">nsubiza inyuma abanyabwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:25">ubwenge bwabo nkabuhindura ubupfu.<verse eid="ISA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 44:26" />Ni jewe nshitsa amajambo y’abasavyi banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">n’ivy’intumwa zanje zavugishijwe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 44:26" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:26">I Yerusalemu ndahavugako nti: ‘Hazosubira kuba abantu,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">ibisagara vy’i Buyuda na vyo nti: ‘Bizosubira kwubakwa,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:26">imisaka yaho nkayivugaka nti: ‘Nzohasanura.’<verse eid="ISA 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 44:27" />Mbwira ibiyaga binini nti: ‘Kama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:27">kandi n’inzuzi zawe nzozikamya.’<verse eid="ISA 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 44:28" />Ndavuga kuri Kuro nti: ‘Ni umusavyi wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">azoshitsa ivyo nshaka vyose;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 44:28">azotegeka ati: “Yerusalemu nihubakwe,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 44:28">avuge ati: “Amatanguriro y’Ingoro nashirweho.” ’<verse eid="ISA 44:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="ISA 45" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 45:1" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwiye uwo yitoranirije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">Kuro, uwo afashe ukuboko kw’i buryo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">kugira ngo aneshe amahanga ari imbere yiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">ateko anyage abami ibigwanisho vyabo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:1">uwo yugururiye imiryango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:1">n’amarembo ntasubire kwugarwa:<verse eid="ISA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 45:2" />Nzokuja imbere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:2">ndinganize imitumba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:2">menagure inzugi z’imyakaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:2">ncagagure n’ivyugazo vy’ivyuma.<verse eid="ISA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 45:3" />Nzoguha ubutunzi buri mu mwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">hamwe n’ubuhishijwe ahinyegeje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:3">kugira ngo umenye ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:3">Imana ya Isirayeli, uwaguhamagaye mw’izina.<verse eid="ISA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 45:4" />Ku bw’umusavyi wanje Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">na Isirayeli uwo natoranije,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:4">naguhamagaye mw’izina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">ndaguha izina ry’icubahiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:4">naho kugeza ubu utanzi.<verse eid="ISA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 45:5" />Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nta wundi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:5">nta yindi Mana ihari atari jewe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:5">Nzogukomeza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:5">naho utaramenya,<verse eid="ISA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 45:6" />kugira ngo kuva iyo izuba riserukira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:6">kugeza n’iyo rirengera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:6">abantu bose bamenye ko ata yindi Mana atari jewe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:6">Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nta wundi ariho atari jewe.<verse eid="ISA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 45:7" />Ni jewe ndema umuco n’umwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:7">nkazana amahoro n’ivyago;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:7">ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nkora ivyo vyose.<verse eid="ISA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 45:8" />Mwa majuru mwe, cuncubura imvura y’ukugororoka kwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">ibicu nibiyirekure ishike hasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">Isi na yo niyuguruke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">agakiza gatutuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:8">ukugororoka kuyimereko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:8">ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> naremye ivyo.<verse eid="ISA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 45:9" />Bazobona ibara abaharira bagatongana n’Umuremyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">kandi ari injo gusa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">mu zindi njo zo kw’isi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Mbega ibumba ryobaza umubumvyi riti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">‘Ugomba kubumba iki?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:9">Canke icabumbwe covuga kiti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:9">‘Umubumvyi nta maboko agira?’<verse eid="ISA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 45:10" />Azobona ibara uwubaza se ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:10">‘Ni igiki wavyaye?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:10">canke akabaza nyina ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:10">‘Ni igiki wibarutse?’<verse eid="ISA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 45:11" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">Uwera wa Isirayeli akaba n’Umuremyi wawe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:11">Ku bijanye n’ibizoba hanyuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">mbega murambaza ivyerekeye abana banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:11">canke murampa amategeko ku bikorwa vy’amaboko yanje?<verse eid="ISA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 45:12" />Ni jewe naremye isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:12">ndema n’abantu bo kuyibako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:12">Amaboko yanje ni yo yabamvye ijuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:12">kandi ni jewe ntegeka ingabo z’inyenyeri.<verse eid="ISA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 45:13" />Nzohagurutsa Kuro mu kugororoka kwanje:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">nzogorora inzira ziwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Azonsanurira igisagara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">arekure abantu banje banyazwe bidegemvye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:13">Ivyo ntazobikora ngo ahabwe impera canke agashimwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:13">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.”<verse eid="ISA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 45:14" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">“Ivyimburwa vyo muri Egiputa n’ibidandazwa vyo muri Etiyopiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">hamwe n’abagabo barebare b’Abasabeya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">bazoza iwawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">kandi bazoba abawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">bazogendera inyuma yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">bagukurikira baboshwe n’iminyororo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">Bazokwikubita imbere yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">bagutakambire bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:14">‘Ni ukuri <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari kumwe nawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">ni we Mana wenyene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:14">nta yindi mana iriho.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 45:15" />Ni ukuri, uri Imana yamye yihisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:15">Imana, mukiza wa Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 45:16" />Abakora ibigirwamana bose bazokwicwa n’isoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:16">bazomaramarira hamwe.<verse eid="ISA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 45:17" />Ariko Isirayeli azorokorwa n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:17">amuhe agakiza katazovaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:17">ntazosubira kumaramara canke ngo ateterwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:17">gushika ibihe bitazoshira.<verse eid="ISA 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 45:18" />Kuko uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">uwaremye isi n’ijuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">akaba ari we Mana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">ni we yaremye isi arayibumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">arayikomeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">ntiyayiremeye kuba iyigaragara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">ahubwo ni ukugira ngo abantu bayibeko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">uwo ni we avuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:18">“Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:18">atari jewe nta wundi.<verse eid="ISA 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 45:19" />Sinavugiye mw’ibanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">nihishije mw’isi y’umwijima;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">sinabwiye uruvyaro rwa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">nti: ‘Nimundondere ariko ntimuzombona.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:19">Jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mvuga ukuri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:19">nabamenyesheje ibigororotse.<verse eid="ISA 45:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 45:20" />Nimukorane mwese muze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">egerana, yemwe abacitse kw’icumu bo mu mahanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:20">Ibipfu, ni abarerura ibigirwamana bibajwe mu biti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:20">bagasenga imana zidashobora kubakiza.<verse eid="ISA 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 45:21" />Nimuvyamamaze mubishikirize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">nimwegerane mugire inama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Ni nde yamenyekanishije ivyo kuva kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">akabivuga muri kahise ka kera?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Mbega si jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">Kandi nta yindi Mana iriho atari jewe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:21">Imana igororotse kandi ikiza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:21">nta yindi atari jewe.<verse eid="ISA 45:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 45:22" />Nimungarukeko ndabakize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:22">yemwe mpera z’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:22">kuko ari jewe Mana, kandi akaba ata yindi mana ibaho.<verse eid="ISA 45:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 45:23" />Indahiro ni jewe nyene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">akanwa kanje kabivuganye ubwizigirwa bwose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">kavuga ijambo ritazovaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:23">Amavi yose azompfukamira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:23">kandi indimi zose zizorahira izina ryanje.<verse eid="ISA 45:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 45:24" />Abantu bazokwatura bati: ‘Ni k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> wenyene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:24">turonka gutabarwa n’inkomezi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 45:24">Abari bamufitiye uburake bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:24">bazomwegera maze bamaramare.<verse eid="ISA 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 45:25" />Ariko abakomoka kuri Isirayeli bose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:25">bazoronka ugutabarwa k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 45:25">kandi bazokwirata kuba muri we.<verse eid="ISA 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="ISA 46" />
  <para style="s1">Imana z’i Babiloni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 46:1" />Beli harapfukamye; Nebo harubamye hasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:1">ibigirwamana vyaho bihekwa n’ibikoko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:1">Ibigirwamana vyahindutse umutwaro uremereye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:1">umutwaro uvuna ibikoko biremerewe.<verse eid="ISA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 46:2" />Ivyo bigirwamana birunama bikunamira hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:2">uretse ko izo mana zidashobora kwikingira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:2">ahubwo zijanywe nk’iminyago.<verse eid="ISA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 46:3" />Nimunyumve yemwe abakomoka kuri Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">namwe masigarira y’abantu ba Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:3">abo nahetse kuva mukivuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:3">nkabaterura kuva mukiva mu nda.<verse eid="ISA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 46:4" />Mbere no gushika mu myaka yanyu y’ubusaza mukamera imvi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">nguma ndi wa wundi, kandi nzoguma ndabashigikiye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:4">Ni jewe nabaremye, no kubaterura nzobaterura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:4">nzobashigikira kandi nzobarokora.<verse eid="ISA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 46:5" />Mbega mwongereranya na nde canke uwo mwovuga ko tungana ni nde?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:5">Ni nde mwibaza ko dusa ku buryo mwotugereranya?<verse eid="ISA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 46:6" />Bamwe bakura inzahabu mu masaho yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">abandi bagapima ifeza zabo ku minzane;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:6">bagaca bahamagara umucuzi w’inzahabu agacuramwo imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:6">hanyuma bakayunamira bongera bayisenga.<verse eid="ISA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 46:7" />Bakayiterura bakayishira ku bitugu, bakayijana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">bakayihagarika mu kibanza bayiteguriye, ikaguma aho nyene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">Aho bayiteretse ntihava.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:7">Naho umuntu yosemerera gute, ntiyitaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:7">ntimukiza amagorwa.<verse eid="ISA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 46:8" />Nimwibuke ivyo, mubigumize mu mitwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:8">nimubishireko umutima mwa bagarariji mwe.<verse eid="ISA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 46:9" />Nimwibuke ibintu vya mbere; ivyabaye hakaba haciye igihe kirekire;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:9">ndi Imana, kandi nta yindi iriho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:9">Ni jewe Mana, kandi nta yindi ingana nanje.<verse eid="ISA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 46:10" />Ibintu bikiri mu ntango menyesha iherezo ryavyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:10">mpereye mu bihe vya kera, menyesha ibizoba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:10">Nkavuga nti: imigambi yanje izokomera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:10">kandi nzokora ico nzoshaka cose.<verse eid="ISA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 46:11" />Nzohamagara igisiga c’amerwe co mu buseruko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">ari we mugabo azoza gushitsa imigambi yanje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:11">ivyo navuze ko nzoshitsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:11">n’ivyo nateguye ko nzokora.<verse eid="ISA 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 46:12" />Nimunyumve yemwe abafise imitima ikomantaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:12">yemwe abagerereye kure y’ukugororoka kwanje.<verse eid="ISA 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 46:13" />Negereje hafi ukugororoka kwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">ntikuri kure na gatoya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">kandi agakiza kanje ntikazoteba kuza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 46:13">Nzoha agakiza Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 46:13">Isirayeli ndayihe ubwiza bwanje.<verse eid="ISA 46:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="ISA 47" />
  <para style="s1">Babiloni hasenyuka</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 47:1" />Manuka wicare mu mukungungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">yewe mukobwa w’i Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">icara hasi, uve ku ntebe y’ubwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">wa gisagara we; mwamikazi w’Abakaludaya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:1">Ntuzosubira kwitwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:1">ko uteye igomwe canke ko uhimbaye.<verse eid="ISA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 47:2" />Fata ingasiro usye uronke ifu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:2">twikurura mu maso hawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:2">Duza ikanzu yawe, amaguru aboneke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:2">kugira ngo ushobore kujabuka inzuzi.<verse eid="ISA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 47:3" />Ubwambure bwawe buzoja ahabona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:3">maze umaramare.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:3">Nzokwihora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:3">kandi nta n’umwe nzosigaza.<verse eid="ISA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 47:4" />Umucunguzi wacu, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ni ryo zina ryiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:4">ni we Uwera wa Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 47:5" />“Icara ucereze, uje mu mwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:5">wa gisagara we, mwamikazi w’Abakaludaya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:5">kuko utazongera kwitwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:5">umwamikazi w’ubwami.<verse eid="ISA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 47:6" />Narakiye abantu banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">nsuzugura iragi ryanje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">ndabarekurira mu maboko yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">nawe ntiwabagirira n’imbabazi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:6">N’abasaza bo muri bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:6">wabaremeka imitwaro iremereye.<verse eid="ISA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 47:7" />Waravuga uti: ‘Nzokwama nganza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">nzoba umwamikazi ibihe vyose!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:7">Ariko ntiwigeze wiyumvira kuri vyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:7">ntiwigeze wibaza ku bizoba.<verse eid="ISA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 47:8" />None rero niwumve ibi, yewe muntu ukunda kwinezereza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">ukiyumvira ko uri ahantu hatekanye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">ukibwira uti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">‘Ni jewe gusa, impande yanje nta wundi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:8">Sinzokwigera mba umupfakazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:8">canke ngo mbure abana banje.’<verse eid="ISA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 47:9" />Ivyo vyompi bizogushikira mu kanya gato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">ndetse ku musi umwe:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">kubura abana no gupfakara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:9">N’aho wujuje abapfumu n’abanyamareba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">ivyo bizogushikako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:9">bifise ububi bwavyo bwose.<verse eid="ISA 47:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 47:10" />Wishimikije ububisha bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">wibwira uti: ‘Nta wumbona.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:10">Ubwenge bwawe n’ubumenyi bwawe vyarakuyobeje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">aho wibwira uti: ‘Ndikwije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:10">nta wundi nkeneye.’<verse eid="ISA 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 47:11" />Ivyago bizokuzako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">kandi ntuzomenya ingene uvyigobotoramwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">Amakuba azokugwako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">kandi nta mpongano uzoronka ubitangira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:11">ivyago bizogushikira giturumbuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:11">utanavyiteze.<verse eid="ISA 47:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 47:12" />Nuko rero komeza ayo mareba yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">wirundanirize abapfumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">ivyo watanguye ukiri umwana muto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:12">Kumbure bizogira ico bikumarira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:12">hagire abo utera ubwoba.<verse eid="ISA 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 47:13" />Inama zose bakugiriye zarakuruhije.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">Hamagara abapfumu bawe baragurisha ivy’inyenyeri baze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:13">abazi kuraba inyenyeri bakubwira ibizoba ukwezi ku kwezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:13">baze bagukize ibigiye kugushikira.<verse eid="ISA 47:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 47:14" />Ariko bazomera nk’umuguruka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">umuriro uzobarigita.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:14">Ntibazoshobora kwikiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">ububasha bw’imbeya z’umuriro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:14">Uwo muriro ntuzoba ari amakara yo kwota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:14">canke icotezo co kwicara i ruhande.<verse eid="ISA 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 47:15" />Uko ni ko abo waruhiye kuva kera bazokubera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">n’abo mwadandazanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">mugakorana uhereye mu buto bwawe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 47:15">bose babandanya kugendera mu makosa yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 47:15">nta n’umwe muri bo ashobora kugukiza.<verse eid="ISA 47:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="ISA 48" />
  <para style="s1">Ukugarariza kwa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 48:1" />Umviriza, mwebwe abakomoka ku nzu ya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">mwebwe mwitirirwa izina rya Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">mukava mu muryango wa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:1">mwebwe murahira mw’izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">mukambaza Imana ya Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:1">ariko ntimubikore mu kuri mu bugororotsi,<verse eid="ISA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 48:2" />mwiyita abo mu gisagara cera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">mukavuga ko mwisunga Imana ya Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:2">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ni ryo zina ryiwe.<verse eid="ISA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 48:3" />Ivyabayeho kera, nabivuze imbere y’igihe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">akanwa kanje karabitangaza, ndabimenyekanisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:3">ndabikora ako kanya, birashika.<verse eid="ISA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 48:4" />Nari nzi ko udakurwa kw’ijambo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">izosi ryawe rikomeye nk’icuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:4">uruhanga rwawe na rwo rukomeye nk’umwakaka.<verse eid="ISA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 48:5" />Ni co gituma nababwiye ivyo bintu kuva kera cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">ndabibatangariza bitaraba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:5">kugira ngo ntimuzovuge muti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">‘Ibigirwamana vyanje ni vyo vyabikoze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">ibishushanyo nabaje mu biti hamwe n’imana nacuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:5">ni vyo vyabitegetse biraba.’<verse eid="ISA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 48:6" />Ivyo mwaravyumvise, nimuvyihweze vyose.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">Mbega ntimuvyemera?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 48:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:6">Uhereye ubu ngira ndababwire ibintu bishasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:6">canke ibihishijwe mutigeze mumenya.<verse eid="ISA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 48:7" />Biremwe ubu nyene, si ivya kera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">ntimwigeze muvyumva imbere y’uwu musi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:7">Kugira ngo ntimuvuge ngo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:7">‘Ni vyo, nabimenye kuva kera!’<verse eid="ISA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 48:8" />Nta vyo mwigeze mwumva kandi nta vyo mwigeze mutahura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">kuko uhereye kera amatwi yanyu atari bwazibuke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:8">Nari nzi neza ingene muri abanyabinyoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:8">mwiswe abagarariji kuva mukivuka.<verse eid="ISA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 48:9" />Ku bw’izina ryanje narabangiriye kubasukako uburake bwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:9">kandi ku bw’ishimwe ryanje narabihanganiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:9">ndeka kubakuraho rwose.<verse eid="ISA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 48:10" />Ehe raba, narakuvugutiye, naho atari kurya kw’ifeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:10">nagupimiye mw’itanure ry’ukugeragezwa.<verse eid="ISA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 48:11" />Ku bw’izina ryanje, kandi ku bw’izina ryanje nyene, ndabikoze.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:11">Mbega nokwemera gucokorwa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:11">Icubahiro canje sinzogiha uwundi muntu n’umwe.<verse eid="ISA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukwidegemvya kwa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 48:12" />Nyumviriza, ewe Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:12">nawe Isirayeli, uwo nahamagaye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:12">ndi we;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:12">ndi uwa mbere nkaba n’uwa nyuma.<verse eid="ISA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 48:13" />Amaboko yanje ni yo yashizeho amatanguriro y’isi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">kandi ukuboko kwanje kw’i buryo ni kwo kwagaranzuye ijuru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:13">iyo ndabihamagaye, biritaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:13">bikazira icarimwe.<verse eid="ISA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 48:14" />Mwese nimutororokane mwumve,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">mbega hari ikigirwamana cigeze kibabwira ibi bitaraba?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:14">Uwo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yihitiyemwo ngo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">azoshitsa umugambi wiwe kuri Babiloni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:14">ukuboko kwiwe kuzogwanya Abanyababiloni.<verse eid="ISA 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 48:15" />Jewe, jewe nyene ubwanje naravuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:15">ni vyo, naramuhamagaye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:15">Kandi nzomuzana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:15">azoshitsa neza igikorwa namutumye.<verse eid="ISA 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 48:16" />Nimunyegere mwumve!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">Kuva ku vyo natanguriyeko kuvuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">nta na rimwe nigeze mvuga nyegeje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">kandi igihe vyaba vyose, nari ngaha.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 48:16" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:16">None ehe raba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji yantumye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:16">andungikanye Mpwemu wiwe.<verse eid="ISA 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 48:17" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">umucunguzi wanyu, Uwera wa Isirayeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:17">“Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">akwigisha ibibereye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:17">akakurongorera mu nzira ukwiye gucamwo.<verse eid="ISA 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 48:18" />Iyo wumvira amabwirizwa yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:18">amahoro yawe yotemvye nk’uruzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:18">n’ukugororoka kwawe kwonganye n’imipfunda y’ikiyaga.<verse eid="ISA 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 48:19" />Uruvyaro rwawe rwonganye n’umusenyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:19">abana bawe bakangana n’amahonda mu kigega;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:19">izina ryabo ntiryokwibagiranywe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:19">kandi ntiryozimanganye imbere yanje.”<verse eid="ISA 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 48:20" />Nimusohoke muve i Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">muhunge Abakaludaya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">Nimusemerere mubivugane umunezero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">mubimenyekanishe hose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:20">muvyamamaze gushika ku mpera z’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:20">muvuga muti: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yacunguye, Yakobo umusavyi wiwe.”<verse eid="ISA 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 48:21" />Igihe yabarongorera mu bugaragwa ntibishwe n’inyota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">yabatembeshereje amazi ava mu gitandara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 48:21">Yasatuye ikibuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 48:21">amazi aradudubiza.<verse eid="ISA 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 48:22" />“Ariko nta mahoro ku munyavyaha,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="ISA 49" />
  <para style="s1">Umukozi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 49:1" />Nimunyumvirize yemwe ababa mu mazinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">mwumve ibi yemwe ababa mu mahanga ya kure.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:1">Ntarabaho, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarampamagaye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:1">yampaye izina nkiri mu nda ya mama.<verse eid="ISA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 49:2" />Akanwa kanje yakagize nk’inkota ikarishe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">ampisha mu gitutu c’ukuboko kwiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:2">Yangize nk’umwampi usongoye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:2">anzigamira mu mutana wiwe.<verse eid="ISA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 49:3" />Yarambwiye ati: “Uri umusavyi wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:3">Isirayeli, ni ho nzokwerekanira ubwiza bwanje butangaje.”<verse eid="ISA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 49:4" />Ariko ndavuga nti: “Nakoreye ubusa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">inkomezi zanje zapfuye ubusa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:4">Ariko ico ntegerezwa kuronka, kiri mu kuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:4">kandi impera yanje ifiswe n’Imana yanje.”<verse eid="ISA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 49:5" />None rero <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">uwambumbiye mu nda ya mama, kugira ngo nzomubere umukozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">ngo nzomugarukanire Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">nongere ndamwegeranirizeko Abisirayeli;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:5">natewe iteka mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:5">kandi Imana yanje yambereye inkomezi;<verse eid="ISA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 49:6" />avuga ati: “Ni ikintu gitoya cane kuba uri umukozi wanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">ukanagura imiryango ya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">ukagarukana Abisirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:6">umuco ku Banyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:6">kugira ngo uzoshikane agakiza ku mpera z’isi.”<verse eid="ISA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 49:7" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">Umucunguzi, akaba n’Uwera wa Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">abwira uwo abantu basuzugura, akankwa n’amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">akaba umuja w’abatware, ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">“Abami bazokubona bahaguruke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">abaganwa na bo bakubone bakwunamire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:7">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Uwera wa Isirayeli ari umwizigirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:7">akaba ari we yagutoranije.”<verse eid="ISA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukunagurwa kwa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 49:8" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">“Igihe canje co kugira neza, nzokwishura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">kandi no ku musi wo gukirizwako, nzogutabara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:8">Nzokuzigama ndakugire uko ngomba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">ube isezerano hagati yanje n’abantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:8">usubize igihugu uko cahora, ugisubize beneco,<verse eid="ISA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 49:9" />ubwire abari mu mabohero uti: ‘Sohoka,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">n’abari mu mwijima uti: ‘Nimuje ahabona!’</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 49:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:9">Bazoba intama zanje zirisha ahatotahaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:9">zironka ubwatsi ku misozi itahora imera.<verse eid="ISA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 49:10" />Ntibazokwongera gusonza canke ngo banyoterwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">kandi ntibazokwicwa n’ubushuhe canke izuba ryo mu bugaragwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:10">Kuko uwubagiriye impuhwe azobaja imbere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:10">abajane ku masoko y’amazi.<verse eid="ISA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 49:11" />Imitumba yanje yose nzoyihindura amabarabara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:11">kandi amabarabara yose azokwagurwa.<verse eid="ISA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 49:12" />Ehe raba bazoza bavuye kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:12">bamwe bazova mu buraruko, abandi bave mu burengero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:12">abandi bazanana mu bumanuko, ari ho muri Egiputa.”<verse eid="ISA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 49:13" />Nimuririmbe mwa majuru mwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">unezerwe nawe wa si we;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">muturagare muririmbe yemwe mitumba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:13">Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aremesheje abantu biwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:13">akagirira impuhwe abari mu mibabaro.<verse eid="ISA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 49:14" />Ariko Siyoni aravuga ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarantaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:14">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaranyibagiye.”<verse eid="ISA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 49:15" />Mbega umuvyeyi yokwibagira umwana yonsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">akareka kugirira impuhwe uwo yavyaye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:15">Naho we yomwibagira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:15">jewe sinzokwibagira.<verse eid="ISA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 49:16" />Ehe raba nakwanditse mu biganza vyanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:16">kandi inzitiro zawe ndazihozako amaso.<verse eid="ISA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 49:17" />Abana bawe bazogaruka vuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:17">maze abagusambuye bazokuvako bagende.<verse eid="ISA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 49:18" />Unamura amaso yawe urabe:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">abana bawe barakoranye, baje aho uri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:18">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuze ati: “Ndarahiye ukubaho kwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">uzobambara bose nk’ibisharizo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:18">kurya kw’ibisharizo vy’umugeni.<verse eid="ISA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 49:19" />N’aho wageshejwe, ugasigara uri akahebwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">mbere igihugu cawe kigasigara ari amatongo yahebwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:19">abawe bazokwagirwa vyanke ko bagukwirwamwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:19">abagutabagura na bo baje kure yawe.<verse eid="ISA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 49:20" />Abana bavukiye mu kinyago bazogaruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:20">bavuge wumva,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:20">bati: ‘Iki gihugu ntikidukwiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:20">ntitugira aho twubaka.’<verse eid="ISA 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 49:21" />Nawe uzokwibaza mu mutima uti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">‘Aba ni nde yabamvyariye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">Ko nari naranyazwe abanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">ata vyizigiro vyo kuronka abandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">ndi inyagano, ndi igicibwa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:21">None abo ni nde yabareze?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:21">Ko nari jenyene, abo bo bari he?’ ”<verse eid="ISA 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 49:22" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">“Ehe nzokwakura abanyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">nshingire ibendera amoko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:22">bazozana abahungu bawe babateruye mu maboko yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:22">abakobwa bawe babazane ku bitugu vyabo.<verse eid="ISA 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 49:23" />Abami bazokubera abarezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">abamikazi na bo bakwonkereze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Bazokwikubita imbere bubamye hasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">baguhanagure umukungugu wo ku birenge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:23">Nawe uzomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:23">kandi ko abanyiteze batazomaramara.”<verse eid="ISA 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 49:24" />Mbega hari uwaka umugwanyi ivyo yanyaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:24">canke abo yafashe nk’inyagano hari uwobatabara?<verse eid="ISA 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 49:25" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">“Ni vyo, inyagano zizokurwa mu maboko y’abahizi mu ntambara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">kandi abateye ubwoba bazonyagwa ivyabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:25">Nzogwanya abakugwanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:25">kandi abana bawe nzobarokora.<verse eid="ISA 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 49:26" />Abagutwaza umukazo nzobarisha inyama zabo ubwabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">ndabanyweshe amaraso yabo ubwabo nk’uwunywa umuvinyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 49:26">Maze abantu bose bazomenya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kandi ko ndi Umukiza wanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 49:26">Umucunguzi wanyu, Inyenkomezi ya Yakobo.”<verse eid="ISA 49:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50" />
  <para style="s1">Icaha ca Isirayeli n’ukwumvira kw’umukozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 50:1" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">ati: “Mbega ikete ryo kwahukana na nyoko, riri hehe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">iryo namuhaye ndamwirukanye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">Canke uwo mfitiye umwenda ni nde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">nkaba naramubagurishijeko?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:1">Kubera ivyaha vyanyu mwaragurishijwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:1">kandi ibigabitanyo vyanyu ni vyo vyatumye nyoko yirukanwa!<verse eid="ISA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 50:2" />Igihe naza, ni kubera iki ata n’umwe nahasanze?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Kandi igihe nahamagara ni kubera iki ata n’umwe yanyitavye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Mbega ukuboko kwanje kwabaye kugufi, kunanirwa kubatabara?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">Mbega singira inkomezi zo kubacungura?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">Nkankamiye ikiyaga kiragaduka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">ahatemba inzuzi ndahahindura ubugaragwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:2">amafi yaho akabora, kubera kubura amazi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:2">akicwa n’inyota.<verse eid="ISA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 50:3" />Ijuru ndaryambika umwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:3">nkaripfuka amagunira.”<verse eid="ISA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 50:4" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji yampaye amajambo yiwe y’ubwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">kugira ngo nshobore kuremesha abadendebukiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:4">Yama anzindura imisi yose mu gitondo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:4">amatwi yanje akayakangurira kwumviriza nk’umwigishwa.<verse eid="ISA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 50:5" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji yanyuguruye amatwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:5">kandi sinamugararije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:5">canke ngo nsubire inyuma.<verse eid="ISA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6" />Nategeye umugongo abankubita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:6">abanshikura ubwanwa sinabima imisaya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:6">Abamvuma n’abancokora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:6">sinabanyegeje mu maso hanje.<verse eid="ISA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 50:7" />Kubera yuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji amfasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">sinzoteterwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:7">Ni co gituma mu maso hanje hakomera hakamera nk’ibuye ry’isare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:7">kandi ndazi ko ntazomaramara.<verse eid="ISA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 50:8" />Uwuncira urubanza rw’ukuri ari hafi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">None ni nde azonyagiriza icaha?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">Naze duhangane!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:8">Ni nde afise ico anyagiriza?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:8">Nashike imbere yanje duhangane.<verse eid="ISA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 50:9" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ni we amfasha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">Ni nde azoncira urubanza akavuga ko ntsinzwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:9">Bose bazosaza nk’impuzu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:9">inyo zizobarya zibamare.<verse eid="ISA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 50:10" />Ni nde muri mwebwe yubaha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">akumvira ijambo ry’umukozi wiwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">Uwugendera mu mwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">atagira umuco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:10">niyizigire izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:10">kandi yishimikize Imana yiwe.<verse eid="ISA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 50:11" />Yemwe abacana ibimuri mwese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">mukironderera umuco wo kubamurikira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">nimugendere mu muco w’umuriro wanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">no mu bimuri mwadometse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 50:11">Ivyo muzoronka mu kuboko kwanje ni ibi:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 50:11">muzoryamana umubabaro.<verse eid="ISA 50:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="ISA 51" />
  <para style="s1">Agakiza kadashira ka Siyoni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 51:1" />“Nimuntege amatwi, yemwe abakurikirana ukugororoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">namwe abarondera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:1">Nimwitegereze igitandara mwasatuweko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:1">n’icobo mwimbwemwo.<verse eid="ISA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 51:2" />Nimurabe sogokuruza Aburahamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">na Sara yabavyaye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:2">Igihe namuhamagara yari wenyene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:2">hanyuma ndamuhezagira, ndamugwiza.<verse eid="ISA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 51:3" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nta gukeka azohumuriza Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">kandi azorabana impuhwe imisaka yaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">ubugaragwa bwaho azobugira nka Edeni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">n’isi itamera yaho azoyigira nk’itongo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:3">I Siyoni hazorangwa umunezero n’agahimbare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:3">amashimwe n’amajwi y’indirimbo.<verse eid="ISA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 51:4" />Nimunyumve yemwe bantu banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:4">ntega ugutwi wa hanga ryanje we:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:4">Icagezwe kizova muri jewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:4">kandi uguca iziroranye kwanje kuzobera amahanga umuco.<verse eid="ISA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 51:5" />Ubugororotsi bwanje buriko buraza bwihuta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">agakiza kanje kari mu nzira kaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">kandi ukuboko kwanje kuzozanira amahanga ubutungane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:5">Amazinga azonyitegana igishika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:5">andindire yizigiye ukuboko kwanje.<verse eid="ISA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 51:6" />Nimwunamure amaso yanyu murabe amajuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">murabe no kw’isi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">amajuru azokamangana nk’umwotsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">isi na yo ihere nk’impuzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">abayibako na bo bazopfa nk’imibu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:6">Ariko agakiza kanje kazokwamaho ibihe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:6">kandi ubugororotsi bwanje ntibuzogira iherezo.<verse eid="ISA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 51:7" />Nimunyumve yemwe abazi ivy’ukugororoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">namwe mwashize imitima yanyu ku nyigisho zanje:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:7">Ntimutinye ivyo abantu bapfa babagiriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:7">canke ngo murandurwe imitima n’ivyo babatuka.<verse eid="ISA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 51:8" />Kuko imiswa izobarya ibamare nk’uko imara impuzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">n’inyo zizobarya nk’uko zirya ubwoya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:8">Ariko ukugororoka kwanje kuzokwamaho ibihe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:8">kandi agakiza kanje kazokwamaho uko urunganwe ruzokurikirana n’urundi.”<verse eid="ISA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 51:9" />Kanguka, kanguka wa kuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">wambare inkomezi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">Kanguka nko mu misi yaheze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">nko mu runganwe rw’aba kera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:9">Mbega si wewe waciye ubunywenywe Rahabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:9">ugasogota ca gisizimwe?<verse eid="ISA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 51:10" />Mbega si wewe wakamije ikiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:10">n’amazi yo mw’ibenga rinini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:10">ugaca inzira i bwina mu kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:10">kugira ngo abo wicunguriye bashobore kujabuka?<verse eid="ISA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 51:11" />Abacunguwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bazogaruka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">bazokwinjira i Siyoni baririmba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">umunezero udashira ni wo uzoba urugori ku mitwe yabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:11">Akamwemwe n’umunezero bizobuzura, kandi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:11">umubabaro no gusuhuza umutima bizohunga.<verse eid="ISA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 51:12" />“Jewe ubwanje ni jewe ndabahumuriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:12">none uri nde, wewe utinya umuntu apfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:12">utinya umwana w’umuntu ameze nk’ubwatsi,<verse eid="ISA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 51:13" />ukibagira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Umuremyi wawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">uwagaranzuye amajuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">agashiraho amatanguriro y’isi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">ku buryo umusi ku wundi ubayeho uri mu bwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">utinya uburake bw’uwugucinyiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:13">kandi agerewe kuranduka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:13">Mbega none uburake bw’uwucinyiza buri hehe?<verse eid="ISA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 51:14" />Abo wagize imbohe bagiye kubohorwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:14">ntibazogwa mu vyobo barimwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:14">kandi ntibazokwicwa n’inzara.<verse eid="ISA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 51:15" />Kuko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:15">ntera ikiyaga gusuriranya, imipfunda ikabomborana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:15">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose, ni ryo zina ryanje.<verse eid="ISA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 51:16" />Nashize amajambo yanje mu kanwa kawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">ngutwikiriza igitutu c’ukuboko kwanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:16">jewe nashize amajuru mu kibanza cayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">nshiraho amatanguriro y’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:16">nkabwira Siyoni nti: ‘Muri abantu banje.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Igikombe c’uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 51:17" />Kanguka, kanguka!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">Haguruka, yewe Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:17">wewe wanywereye ku gikombe kiri mu kuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">igikombe c’uburake bwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:17">ukaciranguza gushika kw’ima rya nyuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:17">ca gikombe gituma abantu bazungurirwa.<verse eid="ISA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 51:18" />Mu bana yavyaye bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:18">nta wurimwo wo kumuja imbere ngo amurongore</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:18">mu bana yareze bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:18">nta wurimwo wo kumufata ukuboko.<verse eid="ISA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 51:19" />Ibi vyago bigwijwe kabiri bije kuri wewe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">mbega ni nde azokuremesha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:19">Gusamburwa no kurandurwa, inzara n’inkota.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:19">Ni nde azoguhoza?<verse eid="ISA 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 51:20" />Abana bawe bararabiranye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">barambaraye mu mahwane yose y’inzira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">bameze nk’impongo yafashwe n’umutego.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:20">Buzuweko n’uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:20">ari kwo guhana kw’Imana yawe.<verse eid="ISA 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 51:21" />Kubera ivyo, nimwumve ibi, mwebwe mubabaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:21">mwebwe muborewe ariko mutaborewe umuvinyu.<verse eid="ISA 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 51:22" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">Imana yanyu igwanira abantu bayo, avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">“Ehe raba, nkuye mu kuboko kwawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">igikombe catuma udandabagirana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:22">ico gikombe ni co burake bwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:22">ntuzosubira kukinywerako.<verse eid="ISA 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 51:23" />Nzogishira mu biganza vy’ababacinyiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">bamwe bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">‘Rambarara hasi tuguceko.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 51:23">Maze umugongo wawe ukawugira nk’imbuga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 51:23">canke nk’inzira yo gucako.”<verse eid="ISA 51:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="ISA 52" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 52:1" />Ikangure, ikangure, yewe Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">wambare inkomezi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">Niwambare imyambaro yawe y’ubwiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">Yerusalemu, umugwa wera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:1">Kuko ata batakebwe canke abahumanye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:1">bazosubira kukwinjiramwo.<verse eid="ISA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 52:2" />Ikunkumure umukungugu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:2">uhaguruke, wicare ku ntebe y’ubwami, ewe Yerusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:2">Iyambure iminyororo mw’izosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:2">yewe mukobwa w’i Siyoni, wagizwe imbohe.<verse eid="ISA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 52:3" />Kuko uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:3">“Mwaguzwe ubusa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:3">muzocungurwa ata mahera atanzwe.”<verse eid="ISA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 52:4" />Kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:4">“Ubwa mbere, abantu banje babanje kumanukanwa muri Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:4">mu nyuma bacinyizwa na Ashuri.<verse eid="ISA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 52:5" />None ibi na vyo ni ibiki? Ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:5">Ko abantu banje basubiriye kujanwa nk’inyagano ata gituma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">kandi abatware bakanshinyaguriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:5">Kandi ku murango no mw’ijoro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:5">izina ryanje rikama ritukwa?”<verse eid="ISA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 52:6" />“Ni co gituma abantu banje bazomenya izina ryanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:6">ni co gituma kuri uwo musi bazomenya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:6">ko ari jewe nabivuze imbere y’igihe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:6">Ni vyo, koko ni jewe.”<verse eid="ISA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 52:7" />Ese ukuntu ibirenge vy’abazanye inkuru nziza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">ari vyiza ku misozi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">bakamamaza ivy’amahoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">bakazana inkuru nziza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">bakamamaza ivy’agakiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:7">bakabwira Siyoni bati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:7">“Imana yawe iraganje!”<verse eid="ISA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 52:8" />Umviriza! Abateramyi bawe badugije amajwi yabo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:8">bose hamwe barafatanije kuririmba indirimbo z’umunezero.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:8">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> niyagaruka i Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:8">bazovyibonera n’amaso yabo.<verse eid="ISA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 52:9" />Turika muririmbire hamwe indirimbo z’umunezero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:9">yemwe mwa misaka mwe y’i Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:9">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahojeje abantu biwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:9">kandi acunguye Yerusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 52:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 52:10" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yerekanye ububasha bwiwe n’ukwera kwiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:10">imbere y’amahanga yose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:10">kandi impera z’isi zose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:10">zizobona agakiza k’Imana yacu.<verse eid="ISA 52:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 52:11" />Nimugende, nimugende, musohoke muveyo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">Ntihagire igihumanye mukorako!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:11">Muveyo, mutunganye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:11">yemwe abatwaye ibikoresho vyo mu nzu y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="ISA 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 52:12" />Ariko ntimuzoveyo mwiruka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">mumeze nk’abahunga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:12">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba ari imbere yanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:12">Imana ya Isirayeli izoba ari igihome kibakingira.<verse eid="ISA 52:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukubabazwa n’icubahiro c’umukozi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 52:13" />Ehe raba umusavyi wanje azokorana ubwenge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:13">azokuzwa, ashirwe hejuru, ahabwe icubahiro cinshi.<verse eid="ISA 52:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 52:14" />Kandi nk’uko benshi bamutangariye bamubonye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:14">kuko mu maso hiwe hari hononekaye, hadasa n’ah’abantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:14">n’ishusho yiwe yononekaye idasa n’iy’abantu,<verse eid="ISA 52:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 52:15" />ni uko azokweza amahanga menshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">kandi abami ntibazokura ururimi mu kanwa imbere yiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 52:15">Kuko ivyo batabwiwe bazovyibonera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 52:15">kandi ivyo batigeze bumva, bazobitahura.<verse eid="ISA 52:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 53:1" />Ni nde yizeye ubutumwa bwacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:1">kandi ni ba nde <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yahishuriye ukuboko kwiwe kw’ubushobozi?<verse eid="ISA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 53:2" />Yakuriye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ameze nk’igiterwa kigoyagoya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">ameze nk’agati kamera kava mw’isi yumye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:2">Ntiyari afise ubwiza canke ishusho ikayangana ngo bitume abantu bamwirukira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:2">nta co twamubonako cotumye tumwipfuza.<verse eid="ISA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3" />Yarasuzugurwa, agakumirwa n’abantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">yari umunyamibabaro, yari azi kubabazwa ico ari co.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:3">Yari ameze nk’umuntu abandi batagomba kuraba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:3">yarakengerewe, natwe nta gaciro twamuhaye.<verse eid="ISA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4" />Ariko ni ukuri imibabaro yacu ni yo yishizeko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">imibabaro yacu ni yo yikoreye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:4">Ariko twibajije ko yahanywe n’Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:4">ko yakubiswe na yo, kandi akababazwa.<verse eid="ISA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5" />Ariko ivyaha vyacu ni vyo yacumitiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">yajanjaguriwe ibigabitanyo vyacu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:5">igihano kiduhesha amahoro cabaye kuri we,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:5">kandi ibikomere vyiwe ni vyo bidukiza.<verse eid="ISA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 53:6" />Twese twari tumeze nk’intama zizimiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:6">umwe wese akajana inzira yiwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:6">maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amushirako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:6">ibigabitanyo vyacu twese.<verse eid="ISA 53:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7" />Yarahahajwe, arababazwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">ariko ntiyakuyeko umunwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:7">amera kurya kw’umwagazi w’intama ujanwa kubagwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">atekereza nk’intama imbere y’uwuyimwa ubwoya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:7">ntiyigera akurako umunwa.<verse eid="ISA 53:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 53:8" />Agacinyizo n’urubanza rw’akarenganyo ni vyo vyatumye akurwaho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:8">Mbega, hoba hari n’umwe wo mu runganwe rwiwe yabihakanye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:8">Kuko yaciwe mw’isi y’abazima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:8">yicirwa ivyaha vy’abantu banje.<verse eid="ISA 53:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9" />Yahambwe hamwe n’inkozi z’ibibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">asangira imva n’umutunzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:9">n’aho ata kibi yakoze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:9">kandi ata bugunge bwari mu kanwa kiwe.<verse eid="ISA 53:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 53:10" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we yashimye kumujanjagura, amuteza imibabaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">kandi naho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatumye ubuzima bwiwe buba ikimazi c’indishi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:10">azobona uruvyaro rwiwe, kandi azoramba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:10">imigambi y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yose izoshitswa n’ukuboko kwiwe.<verse eid="ISA 53:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 53:11" />Amaze kubabazwa, azobona umuco w’ubugingo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">azobona ivyamwa vy’imibabaro yiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">kandi azohimbarwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:11">Kubera ubwenge bwiwe, umusavyi wanje agororoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">azoshikana benshi ku kugororoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:11">kandi azokwishirako ukugabitanya kwabo.<verse eid="ISA 53:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12" />Ni co gituma nzomuha gutorana hamwe n’abahambaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">agabure iminyago n’abanyenkomezi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">kuko yatanze ubuzima bwiwe gushika n’aho yemera gupfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">agaharurwa nk’umwe mu bagarariji.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 53:12">Yikoreye ivyaha vya benshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 53:12">yongera asabira abanyabicumuro.<verse eid="ISA 53:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="ISA 54" />
  <para style="s1">Icubahiro ca Siyoni mu gihe kizoza</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 54:1" />“Ririmba, ewe mugore w’ingumba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">wewe utigeze uvyara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">turika uririmbe usemererane umunezero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">wewe utigeze utera igise;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:1">kuko abana b’intabwa ari bo benshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">gusumba ab’abafise abagabo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:1">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 54:2" />“Agura ikibanza c’ihema ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">wagure n’amahema yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">ntugarukire hafi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:2">Wungure imigozi yaryo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:2">ukomeze imambo zaryo.<verse eid="ISA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 54:3" />Kuko uzokwira hose i buryo n’i bubamfu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:3">uruvyaro rwawe ruzokwegukira amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:3">babe mu bisagara vyahebwe.<verse eid="ISA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 54:4" />Ntutinye, kuko ntuzosubira guteterwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">Kandi ntutinye kumaramara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">kuko isoni ntizizokwongera kukwica.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:4">Ahubwo uzokwibagira ibimaramare vyo mu buto bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:4">n’agakengerwe ko mu bupfakazi bwawe ntuzokibuka.<verse eid="ISA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 54:5" />Kuko Umuremyi wawe ari we azoba umugabo wawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose ni ryo zina ryiwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:5">Uwera wa Isirayeli ni we Mucunguzi wawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:5">yitwa Imana y’isi yose.<verse eid="ISA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 54:6" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokwiyegereza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">nk’umugore yahebwe yuzuye amaganya mu mutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:6">nk’umugore yarongowe akiri muto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:6">hanyuma akirukanwa, ni ko Imana yawe ivuze.<verse eid="ISA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 54:7" />Naragutaye igihe gito,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:7">ariko nzokwiyegerezanya imbabazi nyinshi nkugarukane.<verse eid="ISA 54:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 54:8" />Kubera ishavu ryinshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">nakunyegeje mu maso hanje kumara igihe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:8">ariko mu bugwaneza bwamaho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">nzokugirira impuhwe,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:8">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Umucunguzi wawe avuze.<verse eid="ISA 54:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 54:9" />“Ivyo bimbereye nko mu misi ya Nowa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">aho narahira ko umwuzure utazosubira kurengera isi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:9">N’ubu ndarahiye ko ntazosubira kukurakira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:9">sinzosubira kuguhana.<verse eid="ISA 54:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 54:10" />Naho imisozi yonyiganyiga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">imitumba ikavaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:10">urukundo ngukunda ntiruzokwigera runyiganyiga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">canke ngo isezerano ryanje ry’amahoro riveho,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:10">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agufitiye imbabazi avuze.<verse eid="ISA 54:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 54:11" />“Yewe wa gisagara gihahajwe, ukazungagizwa n’igihuhusi ukabura kiremesha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">nzokwubakisha amabuye y’agaciro yitwa turikwaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:11">kandi amatanguriro yawe ndayubakishe amabuye yitwa lapisi lazuli.<verse eid="ISA 54:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 54:12" />Iminara yawe nzoyubakisha amabuye aca ibibatsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:12">amarembo yawe nzoyubakisha amabuye y’agaciro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:12">inzitiro zawe ndazubakishe utubuye dukayangana.<verse eid="ISA 54:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 54:13" />Abana bawe bose bazokwigishwa n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:13">kandi bazogira amahoro asesekaye.<verse eid="ISA 54:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 54:14" />Nzogukomereza mu bugororotsi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:14">Ugutwazwa amanyama kuzoba kure yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">ntuzogira ico utinya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:14">Ibiteye ubwoba bizoshirwa kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:14">ntibizokwegera.<verse eid="ISA 54:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 54:15" />Nihagira uwugutera, si jewe nzoba ndamurungitse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:15">kandi uwuzogutera wese azoza akwisabe.<verse eid="ISA 54:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 54:16" />Ehe raba ni jewe naremye umucuzi avugutira amakara akaba urubeya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">hanyuma agacura ikigwanisho uko ashatse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:16">kandi umuranduzi ni jewe namuremeye kurandura.<verse eid="ISA 54:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 54:17" />Ariko nta kigwanisho cacuriwe kukugwanya kizogira ico kikugira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">kandi uzotsinda uwo wese azoguhagurukira ngo akuburanye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 54:17">Uwo ni wo mugabane w’abasavyi b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">kandi ni kwo kugororoka kwabo kuva kuri jewe,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 54:17">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 54:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="ISA 55" />
  <para style="s1">Uwunyotewe naze</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 55:1" />Nimuze yemwe abafise inyota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">nimuze mwironkere amazi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">na mwebwe mudafise amahera nimuze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">nimuze, musume kandi murye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:1">Nimuze, mugure umuvinyu n’amata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:1">ata mahera, ata kiguzi.<verse eid="ISA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 55:2" />Ni kuki muta amahera yanyu ku bitari indya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">mukaruhira ibitabahaza?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:2">Nimunyumvirize kugira ngo mubone kurya ivyiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:2">ni ho muzonezerererwa ivyokurya biryoshe.<verse eid="ISA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 55:3" />Nimutege amatwi, muze aho ndi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">mwumvirize, kugira ngo mubone kubaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:3">Nzogirana namwe isezerano ry’intahava,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:3">ari ryo sezerano ry’urukundo rudahera nasezeraniye Dawidi.<verse eid="ISA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 55:4" />Ehe raba, namugize icabona co gushingira intahe abantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:4">ndamugira umutware wo kubarongora.<verse eid="ISA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 55:5" />Ni ukuri nawe uzotegeka amahanga utazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">kandi amahanga utigeze umenya azokwihuta aza aho uri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:5">abitewe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">Uwera wa Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:5">kuko azoba yakwambitse ubwiza.<verse eid="ISA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 55:6" />Nimurondere <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bigishoboka ko mumubona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:6">mumuhamagare akiri hafi.<verse eid="ISA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 55:7" />Umunyakibi nareke inzira ziwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">umunyavyaha ave mu vyiyumviro vyiwe bibi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:7">Bagaruke k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we azobagirira imbabazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:7">bagaruke ku Mana yacu, na yo izobaharira ku buntu.<verse eid="ISA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 55:8" />“Kuko ivyiyumviro vyanje atari vyo vyiyumviro vyanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:8">kandi n’inzira zanyu atari zo nzira zanje,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:8">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 55:9" />“Nk’uko amajuru ari hejuru cane y’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:9">ni ko n’inzira zanje ziri hejuru cane y’inzira zanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:9">kandi ni ko n’ivyiyumviro vyanje biri hejuru cane y’ivyanyu.<verse eid="ISA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 55:10" />Nk’uko imvura na shelegi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">bimanuka bivuye mw’ijuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:10">hanyuma ntibisubire inyuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">bitavomeye isi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:10">bigatuma itota igashobora kumera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:10">kugira ngo ihe umubivyi umwimbu n’umuryi ivyokurya,<verse eid="ISA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 55:11" />ni ko n’ijambo riva mu kanwa kanje riri:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:11">ntirizosubira inyuma uko ryaje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:11">ariko rizoshitsa intumbero yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:11">rishitse intumbero yatumye ndarituma.<verse eid="ISA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 55:12" />Namwe muzovanayo umunezero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">murongowe mu mahoro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">imisozi n’imitumba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">bizoturika bibaririmbire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:12">n’ibiti vyo ku misozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:12">bibakomere amashi.<verse eid="ISA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 55:13" />Ahahora imibambangwe hazomera amasederi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">ahari imikere hamere imiriteli</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 55:13">Ivyo bizotuma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aba rurangiranwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">kubera ico kimenyetso gihoraho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 55:13">kitazigera gikurwaho.”<verse eid="ISA 55:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="ISA 56" />
  <para style="s1">Agakiza ku bandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 56:1" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:1">“Nimuce iziroranye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">kandi mukore ibibereye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:1">kuko agakiza kanje kari hafi cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:1">kandi ukugororoka kwanje kukaba kugira guhishurwe vuba.<verse eid="ISA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 56:2" />Hahiriwe uwukora ivyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:2">uwo muntu abifashe nkama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:2">yubahiriza Isabato ntayihumanye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:2">akarinda amaboko yiwe ntakore ikibi na kimwe.”<verse eid="ISA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 56:3" />Umunyamahanga yifatanije n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ashobora kuvuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:3">“<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azonca mu bantu biwe.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:3">Kandi n’inkone ishobora kuvuga iti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:3">“Jeho ndi igiti cumye.”<verse eid="ISA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 56:4" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:4">“Inkone zubahiriza Isabato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:4">zigahitamwo gukora ibimpimbara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:4">zikazigama isezerano,<verse eid="ISA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 56:5" />nzoziha igihome c’icibutso mu nzu yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">icibutso hamwe n’izina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">risumba iry’abahungu n’abakobwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:5">nzoziha izina rizohoraho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:5">rizokwamaho ibihe bidashira.<verse eid="ISA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 56:6" />Abanyamahanga bifatanya n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">kugira ngo bamukorere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:6">bakunde izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">babe abakozi biwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:6">hamwe n’abo bose bubahiriza Isabato ntibayihumanye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:6">bakagumya isezerano ryanje,<verse eid="ISA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 56:7" />nzobazana ku musozi wanje wera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">ndabahere umunezero mu nzu yanje yo gusengeramwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:7">Amashikanwa y’ibiturirwa bikamota neza hamwe n’ibimazi vyabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">bizokwakirwa ku gicaniro canje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:7">kuko Ingoro yanje izokwitwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:7">inzu isengerwamwo n’amahanga yose.”<verse eid="ISA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 56:8" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:8">we yegeranije Abisirayeli abakuye mu kinyago, avuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:8">“Nzokwegeranya n’abandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:8">ndabashire hamwe n’abamaze kwegeranywa.”<verse eid="ISA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imana yagiriza inkozi z’ibibi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 56:9" />Nimuze, yemwe nyamaswa zo mu gahinga mwese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:9">nimuze mutabagure namwe bikoko vyo mw’ishamba!<verse eid="ISA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 56:10" />Abateramyi ba Isirayeli ni impumyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">bose ni imburabwenge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:10">ni imbwa z’ibiragi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">zidashobora gukuga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:10">bararyama bakarota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:10">bakunda gusinzira!<verse eid="ISA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 56:11" />Ni imbwa zitigera zihaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">zitigera zironka ibikwiye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:11">Ni abungere batagira ubwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">bazimirira mu nzira zabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:11">umwe wese akironderera inyungu ziwe.<verse eid="ISA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 56:12" />Umwe wese aravuga ati: “Nimuze, hinge nzane umuvinyu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">Reka tunywe iziboreza kugeza tuborewe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 56:12">Kandi ejo bizoba bimeze nk’uno musi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 56:12">canke mbere binarushirize kuba vyiza.”<verse eid="ISA 56:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="ISA 57" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 57:1" />Abagororotsi bariko barahona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">ariko nta n’umwe abishizeko umutima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:1">Intungane ziriko zirakurwaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">ariko nta n’umwe atahura</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:1">ko abagororotsi bakuweho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:1">kugira ngo barindwe ivyago biri imbere.<verse eid="ISA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 57:2" />Abagendera mu kugororoka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:2">bashikira mu mahoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:2">bararuhuka basinziriye itiro ry’urupfu.<verse eid="ISA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 57:3" />“Ariko mweho nimwigire hano, mwa bana b’umupfumukazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:3">namwe ruvyaro rw’umusambanyi n’umumaraya!<verse eid="ISA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 57:4" />Mbega uwo mucokora ni nde?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">Ni nde muha ibinoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">mukamwereka ururimi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:4">Mbega ntimuri abana b’abagarariji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:4">uruvyaro rw’ababeshi?<verse eid="ISA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 57:5" />Muganzwa n’ivyipfuzo vy’ubusambanyi muri musi y’ibiti binini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:5">no musi y’igiti cose gitotahaye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:5">abana banyu mukabatangako ibimazi mu myonga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:5">no mu migaga y’ibitandara.<verse eid="ISA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 57:6" />Mu mabuye asenye yo mu myonga ni ho hari umugabane wanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">kandi ni vyo ragi ryanyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:6">Ni yo mwashikaniye amashikanwa yanyu y’ibinyobwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">muyashikanira n’amashikanwa y’ifu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:6">Mbega ivyo nobinezerererwa?<verse eid="ISA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 57:7" />Wasambaniye ku mpinga z’imisozi mu kuhasengera ibigirwamana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:7">ni ho wagiye urashikanira ibimazi.<verse eid="ISA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 57:8" />Inyuma y’inzugi n’ibishimaryango vyawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">wahashize ibimenyetso vy’ingene uri umunyavyaha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">Mu kunta, wapfukuye uburiri bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">urabwurira urabugaranzura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:8">ugirana isezerano n’abo wikundiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:8">urabana ukwipfuza imibiri yabo iri gusa.<verse eid="ISA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 57:9" />Wagiye kuraba Moleki wisize amavuta ya elayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">wisize n’ibimota cane iyo bituriwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:9">Utuma intumwa zawe kure cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:9">gushika n’aho zishika i kuzimu.<verse eid="ISA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 57:10" />Wagenze urugendo rurerure, urananirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">ariko ntiwikebuka ngo uvuge uti: ‘Nta kizovamwo.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:10">Ariko kuko ukwipfuza kwawe kwari gukomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:10">wakomeje urugendo, ntiwacitse intege.<verse eid="ISA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 57:11" />Mbega uwo mwatinya akabatera ubwoba ni nde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">bigatuma mumbesha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">mukanyibagira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">ntimunanyiyumvireko mu mitima yanyu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:11">Mbega si kubera namaze igihe kinini nihoreye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:11">vyatumye mutanyubaha?<verse eid="ISA 57:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 57:12" />Nzoshira ahabona ivyo wita ukugororoka kwawe n’ibikorwa vyawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:12">ariko nta co bizokumarira.<verse eid="ISA 57:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 57:13" />Niwasemerera ushaka gutabarwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">ibigirwamana wegeranije birazogutabara!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">Igihuhusi kizobitwara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">n’umuyaga usanzwe uzobikuraho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:13">Ariko uwungira ubuhungiro bwiwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">azoragwa igihugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:13">ahabwe umusozi wanje wera.”<verse eid="ISA 57:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uguhumurizwa kw’abihanye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 57:14" />Kandi bizovugwa ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:14">“Nimuharure, nimuharure, mutunganye inzira y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:14">Mukure mu nzira ivyotsitaza abantu banje vyose.”<verse eid="ISA 57:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 57:15" />Kuko uwushizwe hejuru cane, aravuze</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">uwuhoraho ibihe vyose, akitwa uwera:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">avuze ati: “Mba hejuru, kandi hera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">ariko kandi mbana n’uwufise umutima umenetse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">yicishije bugufi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:15">kugira ngo mpembure imitima iciye bugufi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:15">n’imitima imenetse.<verse eid="ISA 57:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 57:16" />Sinzokwama ntongana ibihe vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:16">kandi sinzokwama ndatse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:16">ahandi ho imitima n’impwemu vy’umuntu naremye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:16">vyohonera rimwe imbere yanje.<verse eid="ISA 57:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 57:17" />Icaha ciwe ni co candakije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">maze ndamuhana, nyegeza mu nyonga hanje kubera ndatse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:17">ariko yigumira mu vyo yigombeye.<verse eid="ISA 57:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 57:18" />Narabonye ingeso ziwe, ariko nzomukiza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:18">nzobarongora, nongere ndemeshe Abisirayeli bagandaye,<verse eid="ISA 57:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 57:19" />ndeme ishimwe mu kanwa kabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:19">Amahoro, amahoro, ku bari hafi no ku bari kure,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:19">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 57:19">“Kandi nzobakiza.”<verse eid="ISA 57:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 57:20" />Ariko abanyakibi bameze nk’ikiyaga gisuriranya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:20">kidashobora gutekana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 57:20">imipfunda yaco ikazikurura isuri n’ivyondo.<verse eid="ISA 57:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 57:21" />“Nta mahoro ku munyakibi,” ni ko Imana yanje ivuze.<verse eid="ISA 57:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="ISA 58" />
  <para style="s1">Ukwisonzesha nyakuri</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 58:1" />“Semerera cane, ugumizeko.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">Duza ijwi ryawe nk’inzamba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:1">Ubwire abantu banje ivy’ubugarariji bwabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:1">n’abakomoka kuri Yakobo ubabwire ivy’ivyaha vyabo.<verse eid="ISA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 58:2" />Kuko uko bukeye uko bwije barandondera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">basa n’abafise inyota yo kumenya inzira zanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">bakaboneka nk’ihanga rikora ibigororotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">ritataye ivyagezwe vy’Imana yaryo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:2">Bansaba gukora ivyo bategerezwa gukora bonyene ubwabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:2">bakiyerekana nk’abashaka ko Imana ibegera.<verse eid="ISA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 58:3" />Barabaza bati: ‘Ni kuki twisonzesha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">ariko ntubibone?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:3">Ni kuki twicishije bugufi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">ariko ukavyirengagiza?’</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 58:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:3">Ariko ku musi mwisonzesheje mukora ibibahimbara gusa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:3">mugakoresha nabi abakozi banyu bose.<verse eid="ISA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 58:4" />Ukwisonzesha kwanyu guherera mu mitongano no mu matati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">mu kugwana mukubitana ingumu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:4">Ntimushobora kwisonzesha uko mubigira uwu musi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:4">ngo mwitege ko ijwi ryanyu ryumvikana mw’ijuru.<verse eid="ISA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 58:5" />Mbega ukwo ni kwo kwisonzesha nahisemwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">umusi abantu bicisha bugufi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">Umusi umuntu yunamika umutwe kurya kw’irenga rigondwa n’umuyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">akaryama ku magunira yisize iminyota?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:5">Ivyo ni vyo mwita kwisonzesha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:5">umusi wemewe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?<verse eid="ISA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 58:6" />Mbega uku si kwo kwisonzesha nahisemwo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:6">gucagagura ingoyi z’akarenganyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">mugapfundurura imigozi iboheye imitwaro ku bantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:6">abacinyijwe bakidegemvya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:6">mukavunagura ingogo zose?<verse eid="ISA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 58:7" />Mbega si ugusangira ivyokurya vyawe n’abashonje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">no guha abakene aho baba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:7">mubonye uwugenda gusa mukamwambika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:7">ntimwirengagiza mwenewanyu?<verse eid="ISA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 58:8" />Aho ni ho umuco wanyu womurika nk’umutwenzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">n’ugukira kwanyu kukihuta kugaragara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:8">Maze ukugororoka kwanyu kuzobitangira imbere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:8">kandi ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buzoba igihome kibakingira.<verse eid="ISA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 58:9" />Ni ho muzohamagara <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we akabishura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">muzomutabaza, na we azobishura ati: ‘Ndi hano.’</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 58:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:9">Nimwakura imitwaro ku bacinyijwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:9">mukareka gutungana intoke no kubwirana nabi,<verse eid="ISA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 58:10" />mukitanga kugira ngo mushobore kugaburira abashonje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">mugahaza abakene n’abahahajwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:10">ico gihe umuco wanyu uzokayangana mu mwijima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:10">kandi ijoro ryanyu rizohinduka rimere nk’umutaga.<verse eid="ISA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 58:11" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokwama akurongora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">aguhere ivyo ukeneye mu gihugu kigatuwe n’uruzuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">azokomeza ubugingo bwawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:11">Uzomera nk’itongo rivomerewe neza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:11">umere nk’iriba ritigera rikama.<verse eid="ISA 58:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 58:12" />Abantu bawe bazosanura ivyasambutse kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">baduze amatanguriro yashizweho n’aba kera cane;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:12">uzokwitwa uwusanasana ibirengero vy’inzitiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:12">uwusibura amayira n’amazu yo kubamwo.<verse eid="ISA 58:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 58:13" />Nimutahumanya Isabato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">mukareka gukora ivyo mwigombeye ku musi wanje wera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">mukayita umusi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> anezerererwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">wera kandi ukwiye kwubahwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:13">mukawubahisha kutigira mu ngeso zanyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:13">no mu kudakurikira ivyo imitima yanyu yipfuza n’amajambo y’imburakimazi,<verse eid="ISA 58:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 58:14" />muzonezerererwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">nanje nzobashira hejuru muri iki gihugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 58:14">ndabahe gutorana umugabane wa Yakobo.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 58:14">Akanwa k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni ko kabivuze.<verse eid="ISA 58:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="ISA 59" />
  <para style="s1">Ukwihana</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 59:1" />Ehe, ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntikwabaye kugufi ngo kunanirwe kubakiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:1">kandi n’amatwi yiwe ntazivye ku buryo adashobora kubumva.<verse eid="ISA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 59:2" />Ibigabitanyo vyanyu ni vyo vyabatandukanije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:2">n’Imana yanyu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:2">ivyaha vyanyu ni vyo vyatumye abahisha mu nyonga hiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:2">kugira ngo ntabumve.<verse eid="ISA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 59:3" />Kuko ibiganza vyanyu vyuzuyeko amaraso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">intoke zanyu zandujwe n’ivyaha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:3">Iminwa yanyu yuzuye ububeshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:3">ururimi rwanyu rukavuga ibibi gusa.<verse eid="ISA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 59:4" />Nta n’umwe arondera ubutungane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">kandi nta n’uwuvugisha ukuri mu kuburana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:4">Ivyo bashikiriza ni amajambo gusa, bavuga ibinyoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:4">batwara inda y’ibikorwa bibi bakavyara icaha.<verse eid="ISA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 59:5" />Babundikira amagi y’imvuvyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">bakajisha nk’ibitangurirwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:5">Uwuriye amagi yabo wese arapfa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:5">kandi iyo igi rimwe rimenetse, havamwo inzoka<verse eid="ISA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 59:6" />Ivyo bajisha nta mpuzu zishobora kuvamwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:6">ntibashobora kwipfuka ivyo bijishiye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:6">Ibikorwa vyabo ni ivy’ukugabitanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:6">kandi amaboko yabo akora ivy’umuryano.<verse eid="ISA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 59:7" />Ibirenge vyabo vyirukira gukora ivyaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:7">barihuta gusesa amaraso y’abantu ata co bazira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:7">Ivyiyumviro vyabo bihengamiye ku bibi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:7">ibikorwa vy’umuryano ni vyo birangwa aho baciye.<verse eid="ISA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 59:8" />Ntibazi inzira z’amahoro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:8">nta butungane buba mu nzira bacamwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:8">Inzira zabo barazigoramika;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:8">abazicamwo ntibigera bagira amahoro.<verse eid="ISA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 59:9" />Ni co gituma ubutungane buri kure yacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">ukugororoka ntigushika aho turi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:9">Turondera umuco, ariko ico turonka ni umwijima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">tukarondera ugukayangana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:9">ariko tukagendera mu gitutu c’umwijima.<verse eid="ISA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 59:10" />Dukabakaba impome nk’impumyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">tukarondera inzira nk’abatagira amaso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:10">Dutsitara ku murango nk’aho bwamaze kwira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:10">mu bakomeye tumeze nk’abapfuye.<verse eid="ISA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 59:11" />Twese twivuga nk’idubu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">ariko tukaniha nk’inuma ziguguza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:11">Turondera ubutungane ariko tukabubura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:11">twarondera ukubohoka, kukaba kure yacu.<verse eid="ISA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 59:12" />Kuko ibicumuro vyacu vyabaye vyinshi mu nyonga zawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">kandi ivyaha vyacu bikaba biturega kuri wewe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:12">Ibicumuro vyacu bitwomyeko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:12">kandi ibigabitanyo vyacu turavyemeye:<verse eid="ISA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 59:13" />gucumura no kwihakana <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">gutera umugongo Imana yacu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:13">kuvuga ivy’agahahazo n’imigumuko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:13">kuvuga ibinyoma imitima yacu yigeneye.<verse eid="ISA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 59:14" />Ni co gituma ubutungane bwasubiye inyuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">ukugororoka kugahagarara kure cane;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:14">ukuri kukaba kwaratsitaye mu nzira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:14">ukuba inyankamugayo ntibikunde kwinjira.<verse eid="ISA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 59:15" />Ukuri nta na hamwe kuboneka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:15">kandi uwugwanya ikibi ahigwa bwa gikoko.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 59:15" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:15">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaravyihweje biramubabaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:15">abonye ko ata butungane bukihari.<verse eid="ISA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 59:16" />Yararavye abona nta n’umwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">atangazwa n’uko ata n’umwe wo gutabara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:16">Ni co catumye ukuboko kwiwe kubazanira agakiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:16">ukugororoka kwiwe kukaba ari kwo kubashigikira.<verse eid="ISA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 59:17" />Yambaye ukugororoka nk’icuma gikingira igikiriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">yambara n’inkofero y’agakiza ku mutwe wiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:17">Yambara impuzu z’uguhora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:17">yambara n’ishaka nk’umutamana.<verse eid="ISA 59:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 59:18" />Akurikije ivyo bakoze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">azobishura ibikwiranye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:18">uburake ku bansi biwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">n’impera ikwiye abamugwanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:18">n’amazinga azoyishura ibikwiranye n’ivyo yakoze.<verse eid="ISA 59:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 59:19" />Uhereye mu burengero, abantu bazokwubaha izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">guhera mu buseruko bazohindira agashitsi icubahiro ciwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 59:19">Kuko azoza nk’umwuzure</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:19">uhushwe n’uguhumeka kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="ISA 59:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 59:20" />“Umucunguzi azoza i Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:20">gucungura aba Yakobo bihanye ivyaha vyabo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 59:20">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 59:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 59:21" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuze ati: “Nanje iri ni ryo sezerano ngiranye na bo: Mpwemu wanje ntazova kuri mwebwe, kandi n’amajambo yanje nashize mu kanwa kanyu ntazohava, eka ntazova no mu kanwa k’abana banyu, canke mu kanwa k’uruvyaro rwabo, uhereye ubu ugashitsa ibihe vyose,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 59:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="ISA 60" />
  <para style="s1">Icubahiro ca Siyoni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 60:1" />“Haguruka ukayangane, kuko umuco wawe washitse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:1">kandi n’ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bukaba buri kuri wewe.<verse eid="ISA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 60:2" />Ehe raba, umwijima utwikiriye isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">umwijima w’umuzitanya utwikiriye amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:2">ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahagurutse ku bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:2">kandi umuco wiwe uragukayanganiye.<verse eid="ISA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 60:3" />Amahanga azoza akurikirana umuco wawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:3">abami bazoza kuraba ugukayangana kwawe.<verse eid="ISA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 60:4" />Unamura amaso yawe urabe hirya no hino:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">bose barakoranye baje aho uri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:4">abahungu bawe baje bava kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:4">abakobwa bawe na bo baje bateruwe mu maboko.<verse eid="ISA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 60:5" />Mu maso hawe hazokayangana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">umutima wawe na wo udidagizwe kubera umunezero;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:5">ibidandazwa vyo ku kiyaga bizozanwa kuri wewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:5">ubutunzi bw’amahanga yose buzozanwa iwawe.<verse eid="ISA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 60:6" />Ingamiya zizokwuzura igihugu cawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">inyana zazo zizozanwa zivuye i Midiyani no muri Efa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:6">Ab’i Sheba bazoza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">bazanye inzahabu n’ibiturirwa bikamota neza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:6">baze bavuga amatazirano y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="ISA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 60:7" />Ibitungwa vy’i Kedari bizokwegeranirizwa iwawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">intama z’i Nebayoti zizanwe ku gicaniro cawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:7">zizokwemerwa nk’ibimazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:7">nanje nzokwuzuza ubwiza Ingoro yanje.<verse eid="ISA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 60:8" />Mbega abo mbona baguruka nk’ibicu ni ba nde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:8">bameze nk’inuma zitashe mu vyari vyazo?<verse eid="ISA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 60:9" />Ni ukuri amazinga ni jewe yipfuza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">n’amato y’i Tarushishi arafashe inzira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">azanye abana bawe, bavuye kure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">bazanye inzahabu n’ifeza zabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:9">gusenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">Uwera wa Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:9">kuko yakwambitse ugukayangana.<verse eid="ISA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 60:10" />Abanyamahanga bazosanura inzitiro zawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:10">abami bayo na bo bagukorere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:10">Naho nagukubise kubera uburake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:10">mu buntu bwanje nkugiriye impuhwe.<verse eid="ISA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 60:11" />Amarembo yawe azokwama yuguruye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">ntazokwigera akingwa, haba ku murango, haba mw’ijoro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:11">kugira ngo abantu bazokwame bazana ubutunzi bw’ayandi mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:11">abami bayo bazanwe bashorewe mu birori.<verse eid="ISA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 60:12" />Kuko ihanga canke ubwami butazogukorera buzotikizwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:12">buzosenyurwa burangire.<verse eid="ISA 60:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 60:13" />Ubwiza bw’i Libani buzoza kuri wewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">ibiti vy’amasederi, imitidari n’amapinusi vyose hamwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:13">bizoza gushariza Ingoro yanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:13">nanje nzokwubahisha aho nshira ibirenge vyanje.<verse eid="ISA 60:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 60:14" />Abana b’abagutwaza umukazo bazoza bakwunamire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">abakugaya bazoza bikubite imbere y’ibirenge vyawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:14">bakwite Igisagara c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:14">Siyoni h’Uwera wa Isirayeli.<verse eid="ISA 60:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 60:15" />Naho wari waratawe, ukankwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:15">ata wukugendera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:15">nzoguha ubwiza butazokwigera buvaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:15">nkugire umunezero w’urunganwe rwose.<verse eid="ISA 60:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 60:16" />Uzonywa amata y’amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">wonke amabere y’ubwami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:16">Ni ho uzomenya ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ndi Umukiza wawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:16">Umucunguzi wawe, Umunyenkomezi wa Yakobo.<verse eid="ISA 60:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 60:17" />Mu gishingo c’umwakaka nzokuzanira inzahabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">nkuzanire ifeza mu gishingo c’ivyuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">Mu gishingo c’imbaho nzokuzanira imyakaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">nkuzanire n’ivyuma mu gishingo c’amabuye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:17">Abategetsi bawe bazoba abanyamahoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:17">co kimwe n’abatware bawe.<verse eid="ISA 60:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 60:18" />Nta muryano uzosubira kwumvikana mu gihugu cawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">nta gusenyura n’ugutikiza bizovugwa aho imbibe zawe zigera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:18">ariko inzitiro zawe uzozita Gakiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:18">amarembo yawe na yo uyite Mashimwe.<verse eid="ISA 60:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 60:19" />Ku murango ntuzoba ukibonesherezwa n’izuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">kandi ugukayangana kw’ukwezi si kwo kuzokumurikira mw’ijoro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:19">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari we azokubera umuco wamaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:19">Imana yawe izokubera ubwiza.<verse eid="ISA 60:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 60:20" />Izuba ryawe ntirizoba rikirenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">n’umuco w’ukwezi kwawe ntuzigera ugabanuka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:20">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba umuco wawe uzohoraho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:20">kandi imisi y’umubabaro wawe izorangira.<verse eid="ISA 60:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 60:21" />Hanyuma abantu bawe bose bazoba abagororotsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">kandi bazoragwa igihugu ibihe vyose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:21">Ni bo giterwa nitereye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">ni bo gikorwa c’amaboko yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:21">kigaragaza ubwiza bwanje.<verse eid="ISA 60:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 60:22" />Uwa nyuma muri mwebwe azogwira abemwo ibihumbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:22">umuto muri mwebwe avemwo ihanga rikomeye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 60:22">Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 60:22">ivyo nzobishitsa mu kanya gato cane, igihe cavyo kigeze.”<verse eid="ISA 60:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="ISA 61" />
  <para style="s1">Umwaka wo kwemererwamwo n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 61:1" />Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, ari kuri jewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yansize amavuta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">ngo mbwire aboro ubutumwa bwiza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:1">Yantumye kwunga imitima isanzaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">kumenyesha inyagano ko zibohowe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:1">no guha imbohe umwidegemvyo.<verse eid="ISA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 61:2" />Yantumye kumenyesha umwaka wo kugirirwa ubuntu n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:2">n’umusi wo kwihora kw’Imana yacu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:2">no kuremesha abagandaye bose,<verse eid="ISA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 61:3" />nshirireho no kuri abo b’i Siyoni bagandaye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">urugori rw’ubwiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">mu gishingo c’iminyota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">amavuta y’akanyamuneza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">mu gishingo c’ikigandaro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">n’umwambaro w’amashimwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">mu gishingo c’umutima wihebuye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:3">Bazokwitwa igiti c’ukugororoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">catewe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:3">ngo cerekane ubwiza bwiwe.<verse eid="ISA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 61:4" />Bazosubira bubake ivyasambuwe kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">basanasane ahasanganguwe kera cane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:4">Bazosanura ibisagara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:4">vyasambuwe hakaba haciye igihe kirekire.<verse eid="ISA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 61:5" />Ba kavantara bazokuragirira ibitungwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:5">abanyamahanga bazokurimira mu mirima y’imizabibu.<verse eid="ISA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 61:6" />Namwe muzokwitwa abaherezi b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">muzokwitwa abakozi b’Imana yacu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:6">Muzorya ku butunzi bw’amahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:6">kandi muzokwiratira mu butunzi bwabo.<verse eid="ISA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 61:7" />Mu gishingo co kumaramara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">muzoronka umugabane wanyu ugwije kabiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">mu gishingo co guteterwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">muzonezerererwa umugabane wanyu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:7">Muzohabwa umugabane wanyu ugwije kabiri mu gihugu canyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:7">umunezero udashira uzoba uwanyu.<verse eid="ISA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 61:8" />Kuko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nkunda guca iziroranye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">nkanka ubusuma n’ubugunge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:8">Mu bwizigirwa bwanje nzoha impera abantu banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:8">nongere ngirane na bo isezerano ritazovaho.<verse eid="ISA 61:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 61:9" />Uruvyaro rwabo rumenyekane mu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:9">n’abana babo bamenyekane mu bantu benshi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:9">Abazobabona bose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:9">bazomenya ko ari ubwoko bwahezagiwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="ISA 61:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 61:10" />Nzohimbarwa n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">umutima wanje unezerererwe Imana yanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">Kuko yanyambitse umwambaro w’agakiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">akantwikiriza umutamana w’ukugororoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:10">nk’uko umukwe ashariza umutwe wiwe nk’umuherezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:10">umugeni na we akishariza n’udusharizo twiwe tw’inzahabu.<verse eid="ISA 61:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 61:11" />Nk’uko isi isokorora ingemwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:11">maze itongo rigakuza ibiterwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 61:11">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji azoshiraho ukugororoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 61:11">maze amashimwe yiburuke imbere y’amahanga yose.<verse eid="ISA 61:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="ISA 62" />
  <para style="s1">Izina rishasha rya Siyoni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 62:1" />Ku bwa Siyoni sinzocereza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">no ku bwa Yerusalemu sinzotekereza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:1">gushika ukugororoka kwiwe gukayanganye nk’umutwenzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:1">n’agakiza kiwe kamuritse nk’urumuri.<verse eid="ISA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 62:2" />Amahanga yose azokwihweza ukugororoka kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:2">abami na bo babone ubwiza bwawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:2">uzokwitwa izina rishasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:2">iryo uzohabwa n’akanwa k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="ISA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 62:3" />Uzoba urugori rw’ubwiza mu kuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:3">n’urugori rw’ubwami mu biganza vy’Imana yawe.<verse eid="ISA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 62:4" />Ntuzoba ucitwa intabwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">canke ngo igihugu cawe bacite icahebwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">Ariko uzokwitwa Hefuziba, bisigura “umugwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> anezerererwa”,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">igihugu cawe na co citwe Beyula, bisigura “Uwarongowe”;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:4">kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokunezerererwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:4">akwemere nk’uwiwe.<verse eid="ISA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 62:5" />Nk’uko umukwe amenyana n’umugeni wiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:5">ni ko abakwubaka muzomenyana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:5">kandi nk’uko umukwe anezerererwa umugeni wiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:5">ni ko Imana yawe izokunezerererwa.<verse eid="ISA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 62:6" />Nashize abateramyi ku nzitiro zawe, ewe Yerusalemu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">ntibazigera bahora haba ku murango canke mw’ijoro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:6">Yemwe abambaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:6">ntimuruhuke,<verse eid="ISA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 62:7" />kandi na we nyene ntimumwemerere ko aruhuka, gushika ahinduye Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:7">ishimwe ryiwe kw’isi yose.<verse eid="ISA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 62:8" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yararahiye n’ukuboko kwiwe kw’i buryo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">ari kwo kuboko kw’inkomezi, ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">Sinzosubira kugabura ingano zanyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">ngo ndazihe abansi banyu bazirye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:8">kandi n’abanyamahanga ngo banywe imivinyu mishasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:8">iyo mwaruhiye;<verse eid="ISA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 62:9" />ariko abavyimbura ni bo bazobiryako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:9">hanyuma bashime <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:9">kandi n’abazogana inzabibu bazozinywako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:9">bazinywere mu rugo rw’Ingoro yanje.<verse eid="ISA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 62:10" />Nimurenge, nimurenge amarembo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">Mutegurire inzira abantu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">Nimuharure, muharure inzira zagutse!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:10">Nimukure amabuye mu nzira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:10">Nimudugirize ibendera amahanga.<verse eid="ISA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 62:11" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatanze itegeko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">gushika ku mpera z’isi zose ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">“Nimubwire umukobwa w’i Siyoni muti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">‘Ehe Umukiza wawe araje!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:11">Ehe aje azanye impera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:11">kandi impembo yiwe iramuherekeje.’ ”<verse eid="ISA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 62:12" />Bazokwitwa ubwoko bwera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:12">abacunguwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 62:12">nawe uzokwitwa Uwipfuzwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 62:12">Igisagara Kitahebwe.<verse eid="ISA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="ISA 63" />
  <para style="s1">Umusi w’ukwihora kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 63:1" />Uriya ni nde aje ava muri Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">azananye i Bozira, yambaye impuzu z’amabara atukura?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">Uriya ni nde yambaye impuzu z’icubahiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">agenda anyaruka kandi afise inkomezi nyinshi?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 63:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:1">“Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ntangaje intsinzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:1">jewe mfise ububasha bwo gukiza.”<verse eid="ISA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 63:2" />Ni kubera iki imyambaro yawe itukura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:2">isa n’iy’abaganira inzabibu mu bwato?<verse eid="ISA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 63:3" />Ni jewe naganiye inzabibu mu bwato jenyene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">kuko mu mahanga yose nta n’umwe yari kumwe nanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">Nabaganishije ibirenge ndatse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">ndabahonyangira hasi mfise uburake;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:3">amaraso yabo yatarukiye ku myambaro yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:3">maze impuzu zanje zirandura.<verse eid="ISA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 63:4" />Uwo musi kuri jewe wari uwo kwihora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:4">n’umwaka wo gucungura ukaba washitse.<verse eid="ISA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 63:5" />Narondeye uwomfasha ndabura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">ntangazwa n’uko ata n’umwe ahari wo kumfasha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:5">ni co catumye ukuboko kwanje kunzanira agakiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:5">ubushangashirwe bwanje na bwo burampagarikira.<verse eid="ISA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 63:6" />Nahonyanze amahanga nshavuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:6">ndababoreza uburake bwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:6">maze amaraso yabo ndayasesa hasi.<verse eid="ISA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishimwe n’isengesho</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 63:7" />Nzovuga ukugira neza kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">birakwiye ko ibikorwa vyiwe abihererwa ishimwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">twisunze ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yadukoreye vyose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:7">Ni vyo, ivyiza vyinshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">yarabikoze ku bwa Isirayeli nk’uko impuhwe ziwe ziri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:7">nk’uko impuhwe ziwe n’ukugira neza kwiwe bingana.<verse eid="ISA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 63:8" />Yavuze ati: “Koko ni abantu banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:8">abana batazosubira kumpemukira;”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:8">maze na we ababera Umukiza.<verse eid="ISA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 63:9" />Mu mibabaro yabo yababaranye na bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">abamarayika b’imbere yiwe barabakiza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:9">Mu rukundo no mu mbabazi ziwe yarabarokoye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">arabaterura, arabajana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:9">abaheka imyaka yose ya kera.<verse eid="ISA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 63:10" />Ariko baragararije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">bababaza Mpwemu Yera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:10">na we arabahindukirira, aba umwansi wabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:10">ubwiwe arabagwanya.<verse eid="ISA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 63:11" />Maze abantu biwe bibuka ibihe vya kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">ibihe vya Mose n’abantu bayo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:11">ari hehe uwabatahanye abacishije mu kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">bari kumwe n’umwungere w’umukuku wiwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:11">Ari hehe uwarungitse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:11">Mpwemu Yera wiwe ngo abane n’abantu biwe?<verse eid="ISA 63:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 63:12" />Ari hehe uwatumye ukuboko kwiwe kwiza kandi kw’ubushobozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:12">kukagendera i buryo bwa Mose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:12">uwagabuyemwo kabiri amazi igihe Mose yaramvura ukuboko kwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:12">maze bimuha kuba rurangiranwa ibihe vyose?<verse eid="ISA 63:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 63:13" />Ari hehe uwacishije abantu i bwina mu kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:13">bakagenda nk’amafarasi yiruka mu bugaragwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:13">atigera atsitara?<verse eid="ISA 63:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 63:14" />Nk’uko ibitungwa bica mu kiyaya gitekanye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">ni ko Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabahaye akaruhuko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:14">Uko ni ko warongoye abantu bawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:14">uhesha izina ryawe icubahiro.<verse eid="ISA 63:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 63:15" />Ihweze hasi uri mw’ijuru, witegereze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">uri ku ntebe yawe yera kandi y’icubahiro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:15">Ishaka n’inkomezi vyawe biri hehe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:15">Ubugwaneza n’imbabazi vyawe vyanse kudushikako.<verse eid="ISA 63:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 63:16" />Ariko uri Data wa twese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">naho Aburahamu atatuzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">canke ngo Isirayeli atwemere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:16">Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, uri Data,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:16">Umucunguzi wacu ryamye ari ryo zina ryawe.<verse eid="ISA 63:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 63:17" />Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni iki gituma utureka tukava mu nzira zawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">ugakomantaza imitima yacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">bikanka ko duhinda agashitsi imbere yawe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 63:17">Hindukira utabare abasavyi bawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:17">imiryango yawe ari yo mugabane wawe.<verse eid="ISA 63:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 63:18" />Abantu bawe baganje ahera hawe igihe gito,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:18">none ubu ho abansi bacu bahasanganguye.<verse eid="ISA 63:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 63:19" />Turi abawe kuva kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:19">ariko bobo ntiwabaganje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 63:19">ntibigeze bitirirwa izina ryawe.<verse eid="ISA 63:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ISA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="ISA 64" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 64:1" />Ese icompa ugasatura ijuru, ukururuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:1">maze imisozi igahindira agashitsi imbere yawe!<verse eid="ISA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 64:2" />Nk’uko umuriro uturira inkwi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">na zo zikabiza amazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:2">ukuza kwawe kwotuma izina ryawe rimenywa n’abansi bawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:2">amahanga agatetemera imbere yawe!<verse eid="ISA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 64:3" />Kuko igihe wakora ibitangaza tutari twiteze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:3">waramanutse, imisozi ihindira agashitsi imbere yawe.<verse eid="ISA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 64:4" />Uhereye kera cane, nta wurumva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">nta gutwi kwigeze kwumva</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:4">canke ijisho ryigeze ribona Imana imeze nkawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:4">ikorera ibitangaza abayiteze.<verse eid="ISA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 64:5" />Waje gutabara abakora ivyiza banezerewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">bakibuka inzira zawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:5">Ariko igihe twigumira mu vyaha vyacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">waraturakiye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:5">None tuzokizwa n’iki?<verse eid="ISA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 64:6" />Kuko twese twahindutse abanduye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">kandi ivyo twakora nk’ukugororoka vyose vyabaye nk’imishambara yanduye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:6">Twese twakabiranye nk’ibabi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:6">ivyaha vyacu bidukubeba nk’umuyaga.<verse eid="ISA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 64:7" />Nta wambaza izina ryawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">kandi nta wirukira kukwumirako;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:7">kuko waduhishije mu nyonga hawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:7">uratureka twicwa n’ivyaha vyacu.<verse eid="ISA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 64:8" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni wewe Data wa twese.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:8">Turi ibumba, nawe uri umubumvyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:8">twese turi igikorwa c’amaboko yawe.<verse eid="ISA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 64:9" />Ntuturakire birenze urugero, yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:9">kandi ntuze wigere usubira kwibuka ivyaha vyacu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 64:9">Turabishe inyonga zawe, turagusavye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:9">kuko twese turi abantu bawe.<verse eid="ISA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 64:10" />Ibisagara vyawe vyera vyahindutse ubugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:10">na Siyoni hasigaye ari agahinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:10">Yerusalemu na ho habaye umusaka.<verse eid="ISA 64:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 64:11" />Ingoro yacu y’ubwiza bwinshi, iyo ba sogokuruza baguhimbarizamwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:11">yaraturiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:11">ivyari ivy’agaciro vyose kuri twebwe vyarononekaye.<verse eid="ISA 64:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 64:12" />None inyuma y’ivyo vyose, uzoguma utwigira kure, ga yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 64:12">Uzoguma winumiye, uduhane ibirenze urugero?<verse eid="ISA 64:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="ISA 65" />
  <para style="s1">Urubanza n’agakiza</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 65:1" />“Nihishuriye abatariko baranandondera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">mbonwa n’abatariko baranabaza ivyanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:1">Ihanga ritigeze ryambaza izina ryanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:1">naribwiye nti: ‘Ndi hano, ndi hano!’<verse eid="ISA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 65:2" />Umusi wose niriwe nshanje amaboko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:2">ndayategeye abantu b’intagondwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:2">bagendera mu ngeso mbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:2">bagakurikira ivyiyumviro vyabo bipfuye;<verse eid="ISA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 65:3" />abantu bama bariko barakora ibikorwa vyo kumbabaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">babikorera imbere yanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:3">mu gutangira ibimazi mu matongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:3">no mu guturirira ibimota neza ku bicaniro vy’amatafari.<verse eid="ISA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 65:4" />Mw’ijoro baja kwicara mu mva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:4">bagahamagara imizimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:4">bakarya ingurube</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:4">hamwe n’ibindi vyose bihumanye.<verse eid="ISA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 65:5" />Ariko bakabarira abandi ngo: ‘Ntunyegere, wompumanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">kuko ndi uwera kugusumvya!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:5">Abantu nk’abo bameze nk’umwotsi mu mazuru yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:5">ni umuriro waka bukarinda bwira.<verse eid="ISA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 65:6" />Ehe raba, ivyo biguma vyanditswe imbere yanje:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">sinzokomeza guhora, nzobasubiriza mu nkoko bikwiranye n’ivyo bakoze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:6">ni vyo, nzobibishura,<verse eid="ISA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 65:7" />mbahanire ivyaha vyabo n’ivya ba sekuruza babo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">“Baturirira imibavu ku misozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">bakantukira ku mitumba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:7">nzobasubiriza mu nkoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:7">ibikwiranye n’ivyo bakoze.”<verse eid="ISA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 65:8" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:8">“Nk’uko ihando ry’inzabibu riboneka ko ririmwo umutobe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">maze abantu bakavuga bati: ‘Ntimuwurandure</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">kuko ugifise akamaro,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:8">nanje ni ko nzogirira abasavyi banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:8">sinzobarandura bose.<verse eid="ISA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 65:9" />Muri Yakobo nzohakura uruvyaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:9">no muri Yuda nzohakura abazokwegukira imisozi yanje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:9">abantu banje batoranijwe ni bo bazoyitorana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:9">kandi abasavyi banje ni yo bazobako.<verse eid="ISA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 65:10" />Sharoni hazoba uburagiro bw’imikuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:10">ikiyaya ca Akori na co kibe icanya co kuvyagiramwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:10">Kubera abantu banje bandondera.<verse eid="ISA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 65:11" />Ariko mwebwe mureka <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">mukibagira umusozi wanje wera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:11">mugaterekera imeza ikigirwamana c’imigisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:11">mugasukira umuvinyu ikigirwamana ca kazoza<verse eid="ISA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 65:12" />nanje ndabateguriye kwicwa n’inkota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">namwe muzotega izosi imbere y’uwuritema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">kuko nabahamagaye ntimwanyitaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">ndavuga ntimwanyumviriza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:12">Mwakoreye ibibi imbere yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:12">muhitamwo ibitampimbara.”<verse eid="ISA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 65:13" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">“Abasavyi banje bazorya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">ariko mwebwe muzokwicwa n’inzara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">abasavyi banje bazonywa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">ariko mwebwe muzokwicwa n’inyota;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:13">abasavyi banje bazonezerwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:13">ariko mwebwe muzokwicwa n’isoni.<verse eid="ISA 65:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 65:14" />Abasavyi banje bazoririmba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">kubera umunezero wo mu mitima yabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:14">ariko mwebwe muzorira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">kubera agahinda ko mu mitima yanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:14">muborogeshwe n’ukubabara kw’imitima yanyu.<verse eid="ISA 65:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 65:15" />Izina ryanyu muzorisigira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">abo natoranije, ngo baze barikoreshe mu mivumo yabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:15">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji azobarandura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:15">ariko abasavyi biwe azobaha irindi zina.<verse eid="ISA 65:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 65:16" />Uwuzogomba umugisha mu gihugu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">azowusaba Imana y’ukuri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">n’uwuzorahira mu gihugu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">azorahire Imana y’ukuri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:16">Kuko nzokwibagira imibabaro yanyu ya kera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:16">inyegezwe mu nyonga hanje.”<verse eid="ISA 65:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ijuru rishasha n’isi nshasha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 65:17" />“Ehe raba ngiye kurema ijuru rishasha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:17">n’isi nshasha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:17">Ivya kera ntibizosubira kwibukwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:17">ntibizosubira no guca mu mitwe y’abantu.<verse eid="ISA 65:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 65:18" />Ariko nimuhimbarwe, munezerererwe ibihe vyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">ivyo ngiye kurema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:18">kuko ngira ndemere Yerusalemu kuba ibihimbaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:18">n’abantu baho kuba umunezero.<verse eid="ISA 65:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 65:19" />Nzonezererwa Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:19">mpimbarwe n’abantu banje;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:19">urwamo rw’amarira n’amaborogo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:19">ntibizosubira kwumvikana.<verse eid="ISA 65:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 65:20" />Aho ntihazokwongera kuba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">abana bapfa bakiri inzoya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">canke abatama bapfa batamaze imyaka yabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">Uwuzopfa afise imyaka ijana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">azoba apfuye nk’uwukiri umwana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:20">kandi uwutazoyishikana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:20">azofatwa nk’uwavumwe.<verse eid="ISA 65:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 65:21" />Bazokwubaka amazu bayabemwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:21">barime imizabibu, barye ivyamwa vyayo.<verse eid="ISA 65:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 65:22" />Ntibazoba bacubaka amazu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">hanyuma ngo abandi baze bayabemwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:22">canke ngo barime</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">abandi baze bimbure.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:22">Kuko abantu banje bazomara imyaka nk’iy’ibiti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:22">abo natoranije bazomara imyaka barya ivyo babiriye akuya.<verse eid="ISA 65:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 65:23" />Ntibazoruhira ubusa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:23">canke ngo bavyare abagenewe amagorwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:23">kuko ari abantu bahezagiwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:23">kandi n’uruvyaro rwabo rwarahezagiwe.<verse eid="ISA 65:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 65:24" />Nzobitaba bataranampamagara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:24">kandi bakivuga nzoba nabumvise.<verse eid="ISA 65:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 65:25" />Ibingira n’umwagazi w’intama bizosangira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">intare izorisha ivyatsi nk’inka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">kandi umukungugu ni wo uzoba indya y’inzoka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 65:25">Nta kwonona canke ugusambura bizosubira gukorwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">ku musozi wanje wose wera,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 65:25">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 65:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="ISA 66" />
  <para style="s1">Urubanza n’ivyizigiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 66:1" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:1">“Ijuru ni intebe yanje y’ubwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">isi na yo ni indava y’ibirenge vyanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:1">Mbega mwonyubakira inzu nyabaki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:1">Canke ikibanza canje co kuruhukiramwo coba hehe?<verse eid="ISA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 66:2" />Mbega ukuboko kwanje si kwo kwaremye ivyo vyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">hanyuma bikabaho?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 66:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:2">“Ariko abo ndaba ryiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">ni abicisha bugufi, bafise imitima imenetse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:2">kandi bahindira agashitsi ijambo ryanje.<verse eid="ISA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 66:3" />Ariko uwutanga ikimazi c’impfizi uko abibonye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">ameze nk’uwica umuntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">kandi uwushikana umwagazi w’intama uko abibonye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">angana n’uwubaga imbwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">n’uwutanga amashikanwa y’ifu uko abibonye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">ameze nk’uwushikana amaraso y’ingurube,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">nayo uwuturira ibimota neza uko abibonye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">ameze nk’uwusenga ikigirwamana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:3">Bahisemwo inzira zabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:3">imitima yabo inezerererwa ibizira.<verse eid="ISA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 66:4" />Ni co gituma nzobarungikira ivyago bikomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">ivyo batinya cane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Kuko igihe nahamagara, ntibitavye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">n’igihe navuga, ntibanyumvirije.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:4">Bakoreye ibibi mu maso yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:4">bahitamwo ibitampimbara.”<verse eid="ISA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 66:5" />Nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">yemwe abahindira agashitsi ijambo ryiwe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">Benewanyu babanka, bakabakumira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">bakabakumira kubera izina ryanje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:5">bavuze bati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nashimagizwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">kugira ngo tubone umunezero wanyu!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:5">Ariko bazokwicwa n’isoni.<verse eid="ISA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 66:6" />Nimwumve urwamo rw’umuvurungano ruri mu gisagara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">nimwumve iyo nduru iri mu Ngoro!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:6">Ni urwamo rw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:6">ariko arishura abansi biwe ibihwanye n’ivyo bakoze.<verse eid="ISA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 66:7" />“Imbere yo gutera ibise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:7">Yerusalemu haravyaye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:7">imbere y’imibabaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:7">havyaye umwana w’umuhungu.<verse eid="ISA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 66:8" />Ni nde yari bwavyumve?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">Ni nde yari bwabibone?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Mbega igihugu covuka ku musi umwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">canke ihanga ryovyarirwa icarimwe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:8">Ariko igihe co gutera ibise nicahera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:8">Siyoni hazoba hamaze kwibaruka.<verse eid="ISA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 66:9" />Mbega nzoshitsa umugore ku mwanya wo kuvyara, hanyuma sindamureke ngo avyare?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:9">“Mbega ndapfunga inda y’umuvyeyi hageze ko avyara?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:9">ni ko Imana yawe ibaza.<verse eid="ISA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 66:10" />“Nezeranwa na Yerusalemu mwongere muhahimbarirwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">yemwe abahakunda mwese;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:10">munezeranwe na ho cane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:10">yemwe abaharirira.<verse eid="ISA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 66:11" />Kuko muzokwonka muhage,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:11">amabere yaho abahumuriza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:11">Muzokwonka cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:11">mwongere munezererwe ubwiza bwaho buhebuje.”<verse eid="ISA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 66:12" />Kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">“Nzohasesekazako amahoro atemba nk’uruzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">n’ubutunzi bw’amahanga butemba nk’imigende;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:12">muzokwonka, murerurwe mu maboko yaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:12">habasimbagize ku bibero.<verse eid="ISA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 66:13" />Nk’uko umuvyeyi ahumuriza umwana wiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:13">ni ko nanje nzobahumuriza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:13">namwe muzohumuririzwa i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="ISA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 66:14" />Ivyo nimwabibona muzonezerwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">kandi muzototahara nk’ubwatsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:14">Abasavyi b’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bose bazobona ukuboko kwiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:14">ariko abansi biwe bazobona uburake bwiwe.<verse eid="ISA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 66:15" />Ehe raba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aje afise umuriro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:15">kandi imikogote yiwe ije nk’igihuhusi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ISA 66:15">azomanukana uburake bwiwe n’umujinya mwinshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:15">igihano ciwe kizanane n’imbeya z’umuriro.<verse eid="ISA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 66:16" />Kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azozana umuriro n’inkota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:16">acire urubanza abantu bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ISA 66:16">kandi abazotikizwa na we ni benshi.<verse eid="ISA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 66:17" />Abiyeza bakitunganiriza kwinjira mu mashamba, bakagira imisi mikuru barya ingurube n’imbeba, hamwe n’ibindi bizira, bose bazohonera rimwe,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 66:18" />“Nanje ndazi ibikorwa vyabo n’ivyiyumviro vyabo, kandi ngiye kuza negeranye amahanga yose n’indimi zose, na yo azoza abone ubwiza bwanje.<verse eid="ISA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 66:19" />Nzoshira ikimenyetso muri bo, kandi nzorungika bamwe mu bazoba bacitse kw’icumu mu mahanga; i Tarushishi, muri Libiya n’i Ludi mu bazi kugwanisha imiheto, i Tubali no mu Bugiriki, no mu mazinga ya kure, aho bataramenya izina ryanje canke ngo babone ubwiza bwanje. Bazokwerekana ubwiza bwanje mu mahanga. <verse eid="ISA 66:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 66:20" />Bazozana ubwoko bwanyu, babakuye mu mahanga, babazane ku musozi wanje wera Yerusalemu, baze nk’ishikanwa ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, baje ku mafarasi, mu mikogote no mu bikwegana, ku nyumbu no ku ngamiya,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. “Bazobazana, nk’uko Abisirayeli bazana amashikanwa yabo mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bayazanye mu bikoresho bimeze neza. <verse eid="ISA 66:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 66:21" />Nzobatoranyamwo bamwe ndabagire abaherezi n’Abalewi,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="ISA 66:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 66:22" />“Nk’uko ijuru rishasha n’isi nshasha nzorema bizokwamaho, ni ko izina ryanyu n’uruvyaro rwanyu bizoramba,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="ISA 66:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 66:23" />“Kuva mu mboneko z’ukwezi kumwe gushika mu z’ukundi, no kuva kw’Isabato kugeza ku yindi, abantu bose bazoza bampfukamire,” ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze. <verse eid="ISA 66:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 66:24" />“Bazosohoka baje kuraba imivyimba y’abangararije; inyo zabo ntizizopfa, kandi umuriro wabo ntuzozima, kandi bazotera ishishi abantu bose.”<verse eid="ISA 66:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 66" />
</usx>